&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Web Presence &amp;amp; Platform (WPP) is organized into two pillars: &lt;strong&gt;Platform&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Presence&lt;/strong&gt;. The Platform pillar builds internal systems, tooling, and infrastructure to support the web. The Presence pillar owns Stripe’s public-facing storytelling across &lt;strong&gt;stripe.com&lt;/strong&gt;, including our homepage, product landing pages, industry and solutions pages, and other high-impact go-to-market surfaces. Together, we shape how millions of people understand what Stripe is and what it can do for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designers on the Presence team work at the intersection of craft and impact—balancing clarity, polish, and systems thinking with strategic storytelling and experimentation. We collaborate closely with engineering, marketing, content, and product to deliver work that is not only beautiful, but measurably moves the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Designer on the Presence team, you&#39;ll contribute to the strategy and execution of Stripe’s most visible web surfaces. You’ll design new product pages, evolve storytelling for specific industries or audiences, and refine reusable patterns that make it easier to scale exceptional work across stripe.com. This is a high-impact role for a thoughtful, collaborative designer who deeply values visual craft, user clarity, and iteration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who’s excited to operate at the intersection of storytelling, systems, and scale—and who takes pride in the pixels. Your work will directly shape how millions of users understand Stripe, and help convert interest into action across a range of audiences—from founders to enterprise CTOs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design new and improved experiences across stripe.com, including product, industry, and solution landing pages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers, PMMs, and content designers to define problems, explore solutions, and bring them to life&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other designers to maintain and evolve systems that uphold Stripe’s design standards at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance storytelling with usability to create pages that are engaging, credible, and easy to navigate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use user research, user testing, and data to guide and validate your decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in critique and feedback sessions, contributing to the overall quality bar of the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a meticulous attention to craft—ensuring designs are not only functional, but visually excellent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these, we encourage you to apply—even if you don’t meet every preferred qualification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of relevant design experience, ideally in web or product marketing contexts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio of web design work that demonstrates exceptional &lt;strong&gt;visual design skills&lt;/strong&gt;, systems thinking, and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently scope and lead small to medium-sized projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a collaborative mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in layout, typography, color, hierarchy, and interaction fundamentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using Figma and working in component-based systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on CMS-driven websites and modular systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with front-end development workflows or an ability to speak fluently with engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of web performance, accessibility, and SEO best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing for international audiences or multilingual websites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in fast-paced, cross-functional environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care deeply about craft—but also about moving with urgency and focus. We seek feedback early and often, because we believe design gets stronger through collaboration and iteration. We keep our users front and center—whether that’s a small business owner evaluating Stripe for the first time, or a CTO trying to understand a complex product at a glance. And we take pride in delivering work that is not only beautiful and precise, but that delivers clear, measurable impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value curiosity, humility, and resilience. You’ll do well here if you love to learn, enjoy working across disciplines, and bring energy and optimism into your work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a great opportunity for someone eager to grow. Designers on the Presence team have gone on to lead major product launches, shape system-wide improvements, and take on leadership roles. You&#39;ll be supported by experienced peers and have space to develop your craft, influence, and ownership over time.&lt;/p&gt;

job-0n82mf1:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;section-header section-header--large font-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;About Digital Asset &amp;amp; the Canton Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Asset builds the technologies that are reshaping the foundations of financial markets. Our mission is to create the world’s most trusted, privacy-enabled, and interoperable digital infrastructure for global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of this mission is the Canton Network - the blockchain purpose-built for institutional finance. Uniquely combining privacy, compliance, and scalability, Canton enables real-time, secure settlement across multiple asset classes. Governed by the Canton Foundation with participation from leading financial institutions, it is the proven link between the promise of blockchain and the power of global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 and headquartered in New York City, with offices in London, Zurich, Budapest, Hong Kong, and Sydney— we are on a mission to transform finance— and that transformation is now playing out rapidly on the Canton Network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you’re interested in playing a crucial role at the intersection of traditional and crypto-capital markets and want to help bring the next trillion dollars of finance on-chain, join us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring the first Analyst on our newly formed Operations team, reporting directly to the Director of Strategy &amp;amp; Operations. This is a ground-floor opportunity to help define how a fast-growing blockchain infrastructure company runs — from executive governance and cross-functional workflow management to the data and AI systems that support company-wide decision making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work across Finance, Legal, Product, and Engineering, and you’ll have direct exposure to how a Series F, venture-backed crypto infrastructure company operates at the executive level. We’re looking for someone early in their career who is hungry to learn, comfortable owning the unglamorous details as well as the strategic ones, and excited to bring modern data and AI tools into how the team works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive governance coordination by managing agendas, materials, follow-ups, and documentation with a high level of accuracy and discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and manage multiple cross-functional workflows simultaneously, keeping projects moving, surfacing blockers, and following through on the operational details that keep the team on track.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Director of Strategy &amp;amp; Operations to identify workflows across the team — reporting, intake, documentation — that can be improved or automated using AI tools, and help build and maintain those solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain SQL-based queries, dashboards, and reporting views (e.g., in BigQuery and connected visualization tools) that turn operational and on-chain network data into clear, decision-ready reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aggregate and analyze data from both internal systems and blockchain/network sources to support leadership reporting, trend identification, and ad hoc analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on research, documentation, process cleanup, meeting logistics, with scope and ownership growing quickly with the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct ad hoc research on industry developments — capital markets infrastructure, crypto/web3 trends, regulatory shifts — that inform the Operations team’s priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of professional experience; prior internships or early roles in operations, finance, consulting, or a data-heavy function are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with SQL or databases, and real interest in data visualization and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with AI tools (e.g., ChatGPT, Claude) and real curiosity about applying them to real workflows, not just using them casually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A real interest in capital markets, blockchain infrastructure, crypto, and web3 — you follow the space and want to build a career in it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven and highly organized, with the ability to manage multiple competing priorities in a fast-paced, distributed team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, and the judgment to handle sensitive or confidential information appropriately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a related field (business, finance, economics, computer science, or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The range below may vary if based outside the New York tri-state area (New York, New Jersey, and Connecticut). Base salaries are determined during our interview process, during which we assess the candidate&#39;s experience, skills, and capabilities against internal peers and the scope and responsibilities of the position.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$100,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$125,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Digital Asset, we are committed to compensation structures that reward impact consistently across our global teams. We support our people at every stage of life with comprehensive, family-forward benefits and flexible working models designed to help you do your best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support the well-being of our team members. Health and insurance benefits vary by region to ensure local relevance and compliance, and may include medical, dental, and vision coverage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Digital Asset is an equal opportunity employer committed. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, sex, religion, sexual orientation, age, disability, citizenship status, veteran status, or any other basis protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Eligibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If and as required by applicable law, all persons hired to work at Digital Asset will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the location for which they have an offer to work and to complete the necessary employment eligibility verification documents upon hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ccommodations&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Applicants with disabilities who require accommodation during the application or interview process should contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@digitalasset.com&quot;&gt;talent@digitalasset.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Privacy Act (CCPA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If you are based in California, we encourage you to read this important information for California residents linked &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.digitalasset.com/ccpacpranotice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-03gt3i8:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gemini is a global crypto and Web3 platform founded by Cameron and Tyler Winklevoss in 2014, offering a wide range of simple, reliable, and secure crypto products and services to individuals and institutions in over 70 countries. Our mission is to unlock the next era of financial, creative, and personal freedom by providing trusted access to the decentralized future. We envision a world where crypto reshapes the global financial system, internet, and money to create greater choice, independence, and opportunity for all — bridging traditional finance with the emerging cryptoeconomy in a way that is more open, fair, and secure. As a publicly traded company, Gemini is poised to accelerate this vision with greater scale, reach, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Department: Enterprise Risk&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Risk at Gemini is a team dedicated to managing the next generation of financial and non-financial risks in a complex and evolving landscape. We are a diverse group of technology, legal, and operational professionals who develop new approaches to solving classic problems using cutting edge tools and processes in an ever changing industry. We are looking for like-minded individuals who are willing to be bold, visionaries and live the ethos of turning risk into return for our shareholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate, Risk Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gemini is seeking an Sr. Associate, Risk Analytics to join the Risk Management function. As we evolve our risk infrastructure, we are looking for a quantitative and technically proficient individual to move our risk management from reactive, manual processes to a proactive, automated, and agentic model. This role will own the design and implementation of systems for continuous control monitoring, using agentic AI to detect, escalate, and remediate risk across the entire enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with Engineering, Data, Compliance, and Operations to build the &quot;risk brain&quot; of the company—an environment where risk controls are codified, monitored in real-time, and scaled through autonomous agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Control Monitoring
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and implementation of an automated, continuous monitoring framework that spans all enterprise risk domains (Credit, Fraud, Operational, Compliance). Move the firm away from periodic/manual checks toward real-time observability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic Risk Infrastructure&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale our risk management capabilities by developing and deploying AI agents to monitor control activities. Orchestrate agentic workflows to perform proactive anomaly detection, perform root-cause analysis on incidents, and suggest risk mitigation actions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise Risk Analytics&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interpret large, complex datasets to formulate problem statements and generate insights across all business verticals. Develop predictive models and detection tools that reduce risk exposure and enhance operational efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Governance &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a comprehensive view of the AI and model risk inventory. Develop automated dashboards that provide senior management with a &quot;solid analytical story,&quot; leveraging BI tools to track Key Risk Indicators (KRIs) against appetite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Risk Engineering, Identity, and Product teams to ensure risk telemetry is properly instrumented. Provide clear communication and training on how to interpret agentic outputs and maintain human-in-the-loop oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a quantitative field (e.g., Computer Science, Statistics, Finance, Engineering).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of experience in risk management, analytics, or a related technical domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Proficiency: Strong SQL and relational database skills; intermediate-to-advanced Python ability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI/Agentic Frameworks: Demonstrated experience or strong familiarity with building or deploying AI agents (e.g., LangChain, AutoGen, or similar orchestration frameworks) and large language model integration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Monitoring: Experience designing or maintaining automated systems for data quality, observability, or control monitoring.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Communication: Ability to translate complex data and AI output into clear, actionable reporting for senior stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mindset: A &quot;no-task-is-too-small&quot; attitude, combined with the ability to operate in ambiguity and a healthy balance of empathy and skepticism toward automated systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Business Intelligence and Data Visualization (Tableau, Looker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in model risk management (MRM) and knowledge of MAS AI MRM supervisory expectations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS Bedrock, GCP and opensource LLMS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in MLOps or AIOps (e.g., CI/CD pipelines for AI/ML models).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;It Pays to Work Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;The compensation &amp;amp; benefits package for this role includes:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Competitive starting pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A discretionary annual bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Long-term incentive in the form of a new hire equity grant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;401K with company matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range&lt;/strong&gt;: The base salary range for this role is between $99,400 - $142,000 in the State of New York. This range is not inclusive of our discretionary bonus or equity package. When determining a candidate’s compensation, we consider a number of factors including skillset, experience, job scope, and current market data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;In the United States, we offer a hybrid work approach at our hub offices, balancing the benefits of in-person collaboration with the flexibility of remote work. Expectations may vary by location and role, so candidates are encouraged to connect with their recruiter to learn more about the specific policy for the role. Employees who do not live near one of our hubs are part of our remote workforce. All employees, however, are required to onboard in-person at one of our office locations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Gemini, we strive to build diverse teams that reflect the people we want to empower through our products, and we are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, or Veteran status. Equal Opportunity is the Law, and Gemini is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. If you have a specific need that requires accommodation, please let a member of the People Team know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;@LI-MW1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-11xdji5:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;LZFhdTUxNoyvN1xZQZVulOvTszc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W7bWdFaZ5oKtPbxgOVNuIGjRs5e&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AlggdU4BIoBFSYx8CAluD5I3sHh&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XKvAdEO0YoYSTOxmmNOuKkaVsme&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an enthusiastic Relationship Manager to join our team in France, and serve as the primary point of contact, to further enhance customer experience, foster client loyalty, and drive business success in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_76644bd8 bb9ef317 e1f058a3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform client acquisition and strong relationship management with a portfolio of global VIP clients;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rapport, including enhancing and expanding relationships with existing clients via frequent and sustained communication;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building key customer service processes and systems, formulating management rules, and tracking the status of key customers;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze the clients&#39; behavior, identify their unspoken needs, prepare key customer analysis reports;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with various stakeholders from different departments to provide optimal excellent service solutions and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;_76644bd8 bb9ef317 e1f058a3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client portfolio including institutional clients, high net-worth individuals, private bank customers with brokers, futures institutions or commercial banks, etc.;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in trading platforms or exchanges is highly advantageous;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior working experience in sales and client services function with international financial background in banking, investments, etc. is preferred;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and written skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work under pressure and tight deadlines while maintaining good multi-tasking skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates enthusiasm for the rapidly evolving crypto industry and stays up-to-date with the latest trends and innovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in French and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-15hn0jm:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Staff Engineer, AI Platform&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways of leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks&#39; platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets, and it&#39;s trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;boiler&quot;&gt;Founded in 2018 and already valued at over $8 billion, Fireblocks is a SaaS platform that helps companies create innovative products on the blockchain and manage day-to-day crypto operations. We have offices in New York, London, Tel Aviv, and Singapore, and we are continuing to expand our teams to reach new customers globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own our internal AI platform — the shared foundation teams across the company rely on to build and run AI-powered tools securely and at scale. This is a hands-on Staff-level role: you&#39;ll architect and write production code, own the roadmap, and keep the platform reliable, secure, and easy to build on as it serves the entire organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond the platform itself, you&#39;ll help drive an AI mindset across the company — spotting where AI creates real leverage, setting technical direction, and raising the bar for how teams build with it. Doing that well means working like a product owner as much as an engineer: proactively engaging stakeholders across engineering, product, go-to-market, and operations, turning what they need into a clear plan, and communicating it credibly all the way up to the executive level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vast, Staff-level engineering experience.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;A long track record building and running high-scale systems, still deeply hands-on with the code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real AI experience and mindset.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Genuine command of how modern AI systems are built — frontier-model APIs, multi-agent orchestration, RAG, and the surfaces developers build against, from CLIs to MCP — plus the instinct for where AI creates leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product sense and proactive communication.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You work like a product owner as much as an engineer — finding stakeholders, shaping what they need into a roadmap, and communicating it clearly from whiteboard to executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model routing and gateway experience.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ve built or run a gateway that routes inference across providers on cost, latency, capability, and data sensitivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measuring and improving AI systems.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comfort with unpredictable outputs — telling whether a change helped, catching regressions, and keeping quality, cost, and safety in check.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security-first by design.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You treat a high security bar as a design principle, not an afterthought — guardrails, least-privilege access, human-in-the-loop escalation, monitoring, and audit for autonomous systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid DevOps foundation.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Comfortable owning the infra too — cloud, Kubernetes, CI/CD, and IaC — with a healthy security posture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional influence.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You lead through ownership, partnering closely with security, legal, and finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Advantages&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in a high-trust, regulated environment (fintech, security, or custody) where data sensitivity, auditability, and reliability are first-order concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A feel for how large organizations work — navigating many stakeholders, competing priorities, and cross-team dependencies to get a platform adopted at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with digital assets, blockchain, or Web3 — familiarity with the domain Fireblocks operates in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;close&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re an experienced engineer and a genuine AI expert who wants to shape how an entire company builds with AI — come and join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-135n5k2:
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with the Best&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Orderly Network is a combination of an orderbook-based trading infrastructure and a robust liquidity layer offering spot and perpetual futures orderbooks. Unlike traditional platforms, Orderly doesn’t have a front end; instead, it operates at the core of the ecosystem, providing essential services to projects built on top of it.&lt;br&gt;Our DEX white-label solution is carefully crafted to save builders time and capital while granting access to our bootstrapped liquidity. Picture having the best features of CEXs while keeping settlements on-chain and maintaining full self-custody.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With Orderly, anyone can create a trading application thanks to our seamless plug-and-play experience leveraging our liquidity and composability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Looking ahead, our grand vision is to create an omnichain protocol, connecting traders from both EVM and non-EVM chains within the same orderbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;A Glimpse into Your Future at Orderly Network&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Orderly&#39;s Partnership team accelerates the growth of our ecosystem by identifying, engaging, and supporting builders and partners who build on top of Orderly&#39;s infrastructure. In this role, you will be the driving force behind expanding our partner ecosystem — building and managing a robust pipeline of prospective partners, tracking relationship progress through structured CRM workflows, and ensuring partners are activated and growing on Orderly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, high-ownership role for someone who thinks in systems — who can apply internet-era frameworks (funnel management, data-driven tracking, automated workflows) to relationship building and pipeline management at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;What will you be working on?&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and maintain a structured pipeline of prospective partners across multiple verticals (DeFi, gaming, NFT, infrastructure, and beyond), using CRM tools and data-driven tracking systems to manage the full lifecycle from prospect to activation&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Apply internet-thinking frameworks to relationship management — treat partner outreach as a funnel: identify → qualify → engage → activate → grow, with clear metrics and tracking at each stage&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop and execute new growth initiatives to expand the Orderly ecosystem&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with BD, DevRel, Marketing, and Operations teams to implement ecosystem growth initiatives end-to-end&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Engage with builders, investors, exchanges, and infrastructure providers to drive ecosystem growth and partnership activation&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage grants programs and hackathon participation to attract builders to build on Orderly and encourage composability&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Research emerging protocols and verticals; collaborate with L1/L2 ecosystems to drive token utility and cross-chain adoption&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain a clean, up-to-date partner database with clear status tracking, next-step actions, and follow-up cadences&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Who will you be working with?&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain close collaboration with Marketing, Operations, Product &amp;amp; BD Teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;About you&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual fluency in English and Mandarin Chinese&lt;/strong&gt; — you can switch seamlessly between both languages in business settings (native-level English speaker, e.g., ABC or equivalent bilingual profile, strongly preferred)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Energetic and early-career&lt;/strong&gt; — you&#39;re young, hungry, and eager to prove yourself; we value drive and adaptability over years of tenure&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Internet-native mindset — you naturally think in terms of funnels, pipelines, tracking systems, and data-driven relationship management; you&#39;re comfortable using CRM tools, spreadsheets, and automation to manage large volumes of relationships without losing personal touch&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;2+ years of experience in ecosystem growth, BD, partnerships, or portfolio support at a blockchain (L1/L2), venture firm, or internet/tech company — with demonstrated experience onboarding and growing projects from the ground up&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You are biased toward action while respecting team-oriented priorities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You are no-ego, adaptable, entrepreneurial, detail-oriented&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You are an excellent speaker and writer&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;You are personable and able to manage expectations across many stakeholders and multiple on-going relationships&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in Learning More?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our hiring process begins by meeting with our People Team, who help facilitate the process of placing you in your new role. You can expect to share your experience and ideas in online video interviews with our hiring team, made up of management and potential new colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you have experience in developing trading systems or financial-related products is a&amp;nbsp;plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can prepare for this interview by mentally organizing your strategies and opinions on topics such as Web3, cryptocurrency trading platforms, and your vision of how to succeed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share this! Don’t be afraid of friends or co-workers stealing this job! If you are amazing and smart we will find a place for you. Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://boards.greenhouse.io/orderlynetwork/jobs/5170520003&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;External Referral Incentives Program&lt;/a&gt; as well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-1bs5uxf:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;VrrNdLuYDoYtIixEpiku6FKFsGb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-XJhkdNVwlolHRzxxKHyu2OcisFe&quot;&gt;Job Background&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XAE6dsnfQoalxDxeNWpuJgUEsjb&quot;&gt;Serving as the technical lead for the compliance portal, you will own and drive one of the company’s most challenging compliance‑portal initiatives. The work involves multi‑tenant architecture implementation and in‑depth CI/CD customization. Beyond high technical complexity, this role demands strong cross‑department orchestration capabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-AazKdRLReo3OKbxLjEJup34ssxd&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G48UdeY3FoK6GExfz0PujXLisMh&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own multi‑site core architecture. Lead end‑to‑end technical architecture design, technology selection and core development for the “one‑codebase, multi‑site release” initiative. Resolve tough challenges including differentiated configuration across platforms/environments/tenants, dynamic UI‑theming, and proper code isolation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S45cdb3C8oIT8BxWc97uGOZDshX&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cross‑functional technical alignment. Act as the central technical point‑of‑contact for this project, aligning Product, UI/UX, Backend Architecture, QA and DevOps teams. Define cross‑platform interaction protocols, orchestrate resources, unblock technical bottlenecks across teams, and ensure high‑quality on‑time delivery.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zfyvde1IXop7gDxxIuXubXGrsSd&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build enterprise‑grade DevOps &amp;amp; CI/CD. Design and implement fully‑automated mobile build, test and release pipelines (e.g. Flavor / Target‑based multi‑target build solutions) to support frequent multi‑site rollouts and significantly boost delivery efficiency.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QIPLdDymyob8RxxxTHPu9uKmsUb&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Technical deep‑dive &amp;amp; performance optimization. Work deep within the Flutter Engine layer to resolve performance pain‑points such as memory leaks and rendering jank under complex business scenarios. Establish and roll out mobile high‑availability monitoring systems (Crash analytics, APM monitoring, etc.).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NtMddopTZo2DLqxTuoJuKLEYszb&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQ3tdMe0noi081xsNCIubIdjsNe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong ownership mindset. Take full accountability for business outcomes and engineering quality of the project. Proactively identify risks along the delivery chain and drive issues to closure with a strong bias for action.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdQcdhkC5opjUwxdpHCuL0Ons7e&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent cross‑functional collaboration. Possess solid communication, negotiation and conflict‑resolution skills. Translate sophisticated technical concepts into business‑friendly language, and drive consensus &amp;amp; tangible results amid conflicting priorities from multiple stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AKJadjOP1oPImZx9JZJuBRqNsAh&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrated technical leadership. Influence and drive other teams through technical credibility — examples include pushing backend teams to refactor APIs or encouraging DevOps to upgrade pipelines. Comfortable making high‑stakes technical decisions and taking corresponding risks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PotIdb1MHo1LIVxPWRhuhU6esfe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Education &amp;amp; baseline experience. Bachelor’s degree or above in Computer Science or related fields. 5+ years of mobile (iOS / Android) engineering experience, with at least 3 years hands‑on experience architecting and delivering complex production‑grade Flutter projects.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DC5adjN53omJEhxKbUcuAqgzsJc&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Multi‑site / white‑label architecture experience. Proven track record building large‑scale variant apps, multi‑tenant applications, unified multi‑region releases, or heavily modularized systems. Deep expertise in Build Flavors / Targets, dynamic asset delivery and differential compilation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FXHddMnfBoLEe3xybFLuc08MsLO&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;In‑depth Flutter expertise. Solid understanding of Flutter rendering pipeline, Widget tree mechanics and Dart internals. Proficient in Flutter‑Native hybrid development and communication patterns including MethodChannel.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QE7Od996koS5DRxXMFyut9hzs7c&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Engineering capability. Hands‑on experience building sophisticated multi‑flavor / multi‑target CI/CD pipelines using Fastlane, Jenkins, GitHub Actions or equivalent tooling.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ONyhdi7RposaetxP7ICuvILSsuc&quot;&gt;Nice‑to‑Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ExUSdOc05oflCHxG2kFuI2BHsVd&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Led or played a core role in architecture evolution for mobile applications with millions of daily active users.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NfpodEsnhow6X0xknGgu7GWksAf&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deep low‑level development and performance‑tuning experience in native platforms (iOS / Swift or Android / Kotlin).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QlmOdKDU9oWjrixCRABu2rCbsyd&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;High‑quality open‑source Flutter contributions on GitHub, including PRs submitted to the official Flutter repository.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DDXsdxRffo1tAGxK44SugdV2syh&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience collaborating across multinational &amp;amp; cross‑time‑zone teams, or strong written &amp;amp; verbal English proficiency.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1rgtqls:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; on the Agent Engagement and Experience team within Coinbase&#39;s Enterprise Applications and Architecture (EAA) org, you&#39;ll build the customer experience platforms that power customer service and compliance processes for CX agents across the company. This team creates innovative services, tools, and applications that help resolve customer issues and compliance KYC processes faster and with greater accuracy. You&#39;ll anchor new projects, set technical direction, and mentor engineers while architecting the distributed systems that directly improve customer satisfaction and compliance outcomes at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect and deliver distributed backend systems and foundational infrastructure components, including dynamic configuration, container orchestration, and secrets storage, using Golang, gRPC, TypeScript, and React&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical direction for the team by defining strategic roadmaps with engineering management and stakeholders, translating ambiguous problems into clear architectural plans with measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale high-reliability services that streamline CX agent workflows and compliance processes, owning end-to-end delivery from design through production deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers on design techniques, coding standards, testing practices, and operational best practices, raising the overall engineering quality bar across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with teams across multiple time zones to identify platform improvements, foresee potential issues, and communicate complex technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software engineering experience, with demonstrated ability to architect and deliver distributed systems that solve ambiguous, high-impact problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in Go (Golang) and experience building scalable, high-traffic backend services in production, including API development (gRPC, GraphQL), event-driven architectures (Kafka, MQ), and SQL or NoSQL databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with cloud infrastructure and DevOps tooling such as AWS, Kubernetes, Terraform, and CI/CD pipelines (BuildKite or similar), including rate limiters, caching, load balancing, circuit breakers, and observability (metrics, logging, tracing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading technical projects end-to-end, mentoring engineers, and influencing architectural decisions across teams without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$256,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1n13x5m:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Compliance Specialist to own and grow our control room function in Hong Kong. This team decides when Jane Street should stop trading a name — for example, if we&#39;ve been wall-crossed on a deal, or due to sanctions or other regulatory concerns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our trading business in Asia is growing quickly, and the volume and variety of restrictions we handle is growing with it. On any given day you might be walking a desk through what they can and can&#39;t do while a restriction is live, working with our Global Capital Markets team on a time-sensitive block or assessing whether a new sanctions regime touches instruments we hold.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional responsibilities of the role will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running day-to-day restriction processes end-to-end, including evaluating the scope of affected names, applying and lifting restrictions, and record keeping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising traders, our Business Development team, and other teams on what a restriction means in practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the policies and procedures behind these business lines and processes, and keeping them accurate as our business, systems and regulations change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling sanctions and government-driven trading restrictions and monitoring for any changes that affect us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting surveillance, look-back reviews, and information barrier and clean room arrangements where MNPI is involved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuing to build and evolve our control room function over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 7+ years of compliance experience at a financial institution, with meaningful time in a control room or capital markets compliance or equivalent restricted list function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a high degree of familiarity with wall crossings, information barriers and MNPI controls work in practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable making judgment or escalation calls under time pressure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong written communicator who can produce policy and procedure documentation as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong verbal communicator who is capable of liaising with traders to understand live and proposed flows and translate them into compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with APAC regulatory frameworks (Hong Kong and China especially) and with sanctions regimes affecting global trading&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

job-07cnj7u:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gemini is a global crypto and Web3 platform founded by Cameron and Tyler Winklevoss in 2014, offering a wide range of simple, reliable, and secure crypto products and services to individuals and institutions in over 70 countries. Our mission is to unlock the next era of financial, creative, and personal freedom by providing trusted access to the decentralized future. We envision a world where crypto reshapes the global financial system, internet, and money to create greater choice, independence, and opportunity for all — bridging traditional finance with the emerging cryptoeconomy in a way that is more open, fair, and secure. As a publicly traded company, Gemini is poised to accelerate this vision with greater scale, reach, and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Department: Trading Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role: Senior Software Engineer (Full Stack, React)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Full-Stack Engineer to build and own products across web, mobile, and backend systems. Your primary focus will be developing complex web applications using React and TypeScript. You will also contribute to React Native mobile applications and backend services built with Scala and Go on AWS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver scalable web applications using React and TypeScript.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own features from technical design through release, monitoring, and improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define frontend architecture and build reusable components.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to React Native applications for iOS and Android.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and integrate backend services using Scala or Go.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make pragmatic technical decisions and communicate trade-offs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve performance, accessibility, reliability, testing, and security.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product managers, designers, and engineers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code, mentor engineers, and improve engineering standards.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI development tools effectively while remaining accountable for code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with React, TypeScript, JavaScript, HTML, and CSS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building large-scale, production-grade web applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of frontend architecture, performance, testing, and accessibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid software engineering and system-design fundamentals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating web applications with APIs and distributed systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to contribute to React Native and backend development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ownership of complex projects from design to production.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, technical leadership, and mentoring skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;React Native or native mobile development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend development with Scala, Go, Java, or Kotlin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS, Docker, Kubernetes, Terraform, and CI/CD.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;REST APIs, event-driven architecture, Kafka, and distributed systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI coding agents and AI-assisted development workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial services, trading, payments, or regulated systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It Pays to Work Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We take a holistic approach to compensation at Gemini, which includes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comprehensive health plans covered at 100% for employees and dependents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Long-term incentive in the form of a new hire equity grant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In Singapore, we have a hybrid work policy. Employees are expected to work from the office part of the week. We believe our hybrid approach increases productivity through more in-person collaboration where possible. All employees are required to onboard in-person at our office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Gemini, we strive to build diverse teams that reflect the people we want to empower through our products, and we are committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, or Veteran status. Equal Opportunity is the Law, and Gemini is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. If you have a specific need that requires accommodation, please let a member of the People Team know.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;#LI-AA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-1pvmi1r:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The world of digital assets is accelerating in speed, magnitude, and complexity, opening the door to new ways for leveraging the blockchain. Fireblocks’ platform and network provide the simplest and most secure way for companies to work with digital assets and it trusted by some of the largest financial institutions, banks, globally-recognized brands, and Web3 companies in the world, including BNY Mellon, BNP Paribas, ANZ Bank, Revolut, and thousands more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Fireblocks&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Fireblocks is on a mission to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. As a leading provider in the digital asset space, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workforce that mirrors the global clientele we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;The FinApps Access team at Fireblocks builds the backbone of on-chain access for some of the world&#39;s largest financial institutions and crypto-native organizations. We operate at the intersection of blockchain protocol engineering and enterprise-grade reliability — designing systems that route, protect, and optimize transactions across dozens of chains at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work on mission-critical infrastructure powering DeFi connectivity, multi-chain integrations, transaction execution pipelines, and on-chain data access — with direct impact on how billions of dollars flow through decentralized networks every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build robust, scalable backend services supporting high-volume on-chain transaction flows across multiple blockchain networks — both EVM and non-EVM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end development of backend components and APIs — from architecture decisions to production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead integrations with DeFi protocols, on-chain data sources, and blockchain nodes across a wide range of chains and ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and evaluate emerging blockchain technologies, protocols, and standards to keep Fireblocks at the cutting edge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize existing production systems for performance, reliability, and security — reducing latency and increasing throughput.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product, protocol research, and platform engineering teams to deliver high-quality solutions on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive features from inception through to delivery at scale, taking full ownership of the product lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience as a Backend or Full Stack Engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) or equivalent degree/experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Blockchain and Web3 experience are a must — including deep understanding of transaction lifecycles, consensus mechanisms, smart contract interactions, and on-chain data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working across multiple blockchain ecosystems — EVM-compatible chains (Ethereum, Polygon, Arbitrum, Base, etc.) as well as non-EVM chains such as Solana, TON, Tron, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Node.js and TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and operating microservices in production CI/CD environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of security principles, cryptography, and best practices in a blockchain context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with DeFi protocols — AMMs, lending markets, bridging infrastructure, or on-chain routing — is a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Web3 tooling and libraries (ethers.js, viem, web3.js, Solana web3.js, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience taking products from inception to delivery at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full stack experience (React, frontend development) — a nice to have.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think in systems and care deeply about correctness, reliability, and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable navigating ambiguity and can drive technical decisions with limited oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a natural curiosity for how blockchain protocols work under the hood — and you actually read the specs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in fast-moving environments and can balance shipping velocity with long-term code quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly and collaborate effectively across engineering, product, and research.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Fireblocks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work at the frontier of blockchain infrastructure, with real impact on how DeFi scales for institutional and retail users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackle genuinely hard engineering problems — multi-chain routing, on-chain data indexing, protocol integrations, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with world-class engineers, protocol researchers, and product minds in a fast-growing global company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, meaningful equity, and a culture that rewards ownership and initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For employees hired to work from Poland, the estimated compensation range for this role is &lt;strong&gt;PLN 300,000 – 3800,000 gross annually&lt;/strong&gt;. It is not typical for a candidate to be hired at or near the top of the pay range and each compensation decision is dependent on each individual case. The base salary is one component of the total compensation package, which for some roles may include a target bonus, a very competitive equity grant, and very generous benefits. While we believe competitive compensation is a critical aspect of you deciding to join us, we do hope you also spend time considering why our mission and culture are right for you. We are creating something transformational here, and we hope you are as excited about the future as we are.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fireblocks&#39; mission is to enable every business to easily and securely access digital assets and cryptocurrencies. In order to do that, we strongly believe&amp;nbsp;our workforce should be as diverse as our clients, and this is why we&amp;nbsp;embrace diversity and inclusion in all its forms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fireblocks.com/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Please see our candidate privacy policy here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

