&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for the design and development of the backend system of the trading core system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for system maintenance, upgrade and optimization, overcoming various technical difficulties brought by high concurrency, stability, low latency, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business sense, participate in business design, propose feasible and constructive solutions, and be able to independently write relevant technical documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in research and practice of cutting-edge technologies, promote and plan the future technology architecture direction of the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;5&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;6&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job requirements:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;7&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above, major in computer science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C++ solid foundation, familiar with folly, boost and other open source libraries, studied excellent open source component source code and experience is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in NoSQL cache, message queue, search engines, such as Redis, Kafka, Elasticsearch, etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in system analysis and design, code refactoring, with experience in large-scale project foundation and application architecture design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with the design and application of distributed systems with high traffic, high concurrency, and high performance, and skilled in performance tuning is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full stack technical expert/trading system construction experience/memory system construction experience bonus points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-0ol94pp:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Coinme, we’re redefining access to financial services in a digital world. By combining the cutting-edge power of blockchain technology with everyday simplicity, we make digital currencies accessible and usable for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the world&#39;s largest network of cryptocurrency kiosks with over 40,000 locations nationwide, we&#39;re breaking down barriers to crypto adoption through our seamless mobile app, secure digital wallet, and DeFi integrations. Beyond our consumer offerings, we&#39;re also the infrastructure powering the crypto revolution for businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through our enterprise Crypto-as-a-Service (CaaS) platform, we enable businesses to launch crypto capabilities in weeks, not months. Our modular, API-first infrastructure provides everything from KYC and payment processing to liquidity and custody solutions—all fully licensed and compliant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re big enough to lead the charge in decentralized finance but small enough that your ideas will make waves. Every role at Coinme contributes to building a financial future where everyone has the tools to thrive. At Coinme, your growth fuels our mission. Together, we RISE.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coinme is part of Polygon Labs, and together we&#39;re putting out a stablecoin payments stack: our fiat on and off ramps, Sequence wallets, and settlement on Polygon. Fintechs and financial institutions are integrating it now, and the documentation hasn&#39;t caught up. Partners are asking questions that should have been answered in a doc six months ago, and those questions land on engineers who need to be building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role fixes that. You&#39;ll own our API docs and the integration path, help BD answer technical questions during deals, and take signed partners from kickoff through go-live. Most of the job is figuring out how the stack actually works, then writing it down well enough that the next person doesn&#39;t have to ask. If a developer with an AI coding assistant can&#39;t integrate us without a call, that&#39;s the problem you&#39;re solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the API and integration docs. Rewrite what&#39;s wrong, fill what&#39;s missing, keep it current as the stack changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the quickstarts, sample code, and reference architectures that get a developer from nothing to a working integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Answer technical questions from partners during sales conversations and during builds, and resolve them yourself rather than passing them to engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take signed partners live: requirements intake, provisioning once KYB and KYC clear, sandbox testing, webhooks, go-live checks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the integration program manager on timelines so partners know what&#39;s coming and when&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn the stack deeply: CaaS ramps, Sequence wallets, Trails, OMSX, bank rails, custodial and non-custodial flows, virtual accounts, deposit addresses, webhooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build demos and sample apps that BD can use to show what the products do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push what you learn back into Product and Engineering. You&#39;ll see every rough edge in the API before anyone else does&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate the repetitive parts of onboarding and provisioning, and use AI tools to move faster on docs and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re open to two different backgrounds here, and you only need one:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ve run API integrations for customers at a payments or fintech company, taking them from kickoff to production. Or you&#39;ve owned docs, SDKs, or developer support at an API-first company and want to go deeper into payments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Either way, you should have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real hands-on API skills. You can read logs, debug a broken webhook, reason about auth, and work in Postman or Bruno and Datadog. You don&#39;t need to be a software engineer, but you do need to solve problems instead of routing them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical writing. You can take a messy system and document it so a stranger can follow it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Patience for ambiguity. The stack changes weekly, the docs are thin, and nobody is going to hand you a plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using AI tools in your daily work, and an eye for how to make our docs work well for developers who are using them too&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Payments fundamentals (fund flows, settlement, reconciliation) will help, but we can teach that to the right person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; crypto or web3 background, especially stablecoins and wallets. Enough coding to build a demo app. Experience with a docs platform like Mintlify. Exposure to KYB and KYC tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://coinme.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Coinme-AI-Usage-Guidelines-for-Candidates-10.2025.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Usage Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to understand how we approach AI tools during the hiring process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-097x4k9:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Coinbase is looking for a strategic, motivated communications leader to serve as the Internal Communications partner for our People Success team. With a new Chief People Officer building the next chapter of our people strategy, this role will shape how that vision reaches every employee through clear, well-timed, and compelling communications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as dedicated Internal Communications partner to the People Success team, owning communications strategy for People programs and company-wide rollouts with a business-first, product marketing orientation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise the CPO and senior People leaders on high-stakes moments, including org changes, policy shifts, leadership transitions, and other high-stakes announcements, crafting messaging that is clear, human, and builds trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own internal communications for the People Success Team itself, including monthly town halls, leadership communications, and other resources that build team awareness, alignment, and culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and edit range of content, including CPO comms, town hall scripts, company announcements, and FAQs, translating People programming into clear value propositions for Coinbase leaders and employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable communications infrastructure, including editorial calendars, playbooks, measurement frameworks, and rhythms that support a growing People organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with broader Internal Communications team and cross-functional partners to ensure People messaging is well-timed and aligned with the company narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build mature communications infrastructure and use data, employee insights, and AI-enabled workflows to measure impact, scale work, and continuously improve&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in internal communications, strategic communications, change communications, or product marketing, with proven experience advising C-suite or VP-level leaders on complex, high-stakes messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record producing executive-level content that drove measurable engagement or adoption outcomes, with strong writing, editing, and narrative development skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and interpersonal effectiveness, with the confidence to push back, influence decisions, and build trust quickly with senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage a broad portfolio of concurrent initiatives across multiple senior stakeholders while maintaining a coordinated, clear communications strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable communications processes, systems, and measurement frameworks from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Job ID: P77829&lt;/p&gt;
