&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgxtdXWZxovH7mxI5arlWe3lgeg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A track record of shipping in a regulated, high-stakes domain at real scale&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
