&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of backend software development experience, with a proven track record of building and operating high-availability, large-scale applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong engineering fundamentals — data structures, algorithms, concurrency, and software design patterns — and the judgment to know when to reach for which.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership instinct. You take responsibility for outcomes, not just tickets. When something&#39;s broken or unclear, you move toward it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive cross-team collaboration, managing complex dependencies and competing requirements without losing momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills, and comfort operating with autonomy in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
