job-1auiojm:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Tech Recruiting team is fuelling Stripe’s regional growth by aligning world-class engineering talent with our most critical business challenges. We don’t just hire, we integrate Stripe’s operating principles into every interaction, ensuring a candidate experience that is as seamless as our products. By blending data-driven insights with compelling storytelling, we serve as strategic advisors to our leaders and shape the future of Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support our long-term objectives in the region, we are seeking a strategic partner to scale our Technology&amp;nbsp; teams across APAC. In this role, you will manage the full recruitment lifecycle while advising leadership on talent strategy and market insights. We are looking for colleagues who value a continuous learning environment and are committed to improving our processes through thoughtful experimentation and collaborative feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message-list_1787819599.322929&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships with hiring managers and cross-functional teams, including Compensation, People, Finance, Recruiting Operations, and business leaders, to align on hiring priorities and deliver against headcount plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with stakeholders to translate changing business needs into practical recruiting plans, clear ownership, and timely actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the day-to-day execution of recruiting plans, including sourcing, candidate outreach, interview process management, offer support, and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay agile as hiring priorities, business needs, and market conditions change. Identify risks early, adjust plans quickly, and keep stakeholders aligned on trade-offs and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain qualified candidate pipelines through proactive sourcing, employee referrals, recruiting events, and local talent-market outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share regular, data-informed updates on hiring progress, pipeline health, risks, and opportunities. Use stakeholder feedback and hiring data to improve execution and candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6 - 10 years of full-cycle recruiting experience (in-house experience strongly preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Mandarin Chinese, including the ability to communicate effectively with candidates in Taiwan, read Chinese-language materials, and understand local language usage in Taiwan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience partnering with tech hiring teams throughout the recruiting process, acting as an effective hiring partner and trusted advisor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess great written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to act as a trusted advisor to both internal stakeholders and external candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate strong initiative and the ability to navigate complex, evolving environments with a high degree of autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take a data-driven approach to recruiting, using market trends and internal metrics to refine your strategy and improve process efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

