&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus9qcafz8J9vhi3nwZgrckWg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Eo2Zd7sgyo79DnxjgvMlmoPIgNf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YA4sdUzpKolOp4xk1VdlGZddgzd&quot;&gt;Our Trading Product Group leads the design of all the products on OKX&#39;s derivatives trading exchange, including spot trading, spot margin, futures, leveraged tokens, trading options, etc.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JW1xdTLaFoAU9ZxYMyMlBCMJgde&quot;&gt;We seek a senior trading product manager to join the Trading team. &lt;br&gt;The successful candidate will manage the development and delivery of our product, including defining and executing product strategy, collaborating with cross-functional teams, and ensuring that our product meets the needs of traders in onboarding and Spot &amp;amp; Derivatives trading experience.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxushHxPgvpIV0pJrijghkWDWe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Eo2Zd7sgyo79DnxjgvMlmoPIgNf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EDb4deTUloKL2AxmwjVlz7LYgYc&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and design risk monitoring and risk-related solutions for our crypto asset trading products, including mark price, liquidation system, insurance fund, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize risk control rules, improve the efficiency of the risk control system, reduce the probability of and losses from abnormal events, and increase the amount and growth rate of the insurance fund.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor risks and collect feedback on our risk control system after its launch, and continue to optimize the system based on effective iterative mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor project progress and coordinate with developers, designers, market team, operation team and other departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instruct junior product managers to form a methodology on risk control products.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
