&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D1bPdeYesoIaetxvcTKlXRUVgff&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree with product manager experience, preferably from a well-known internet or blockchain company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong interest in trading, blockchain and the financial industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid product design and project management knowledge, especially skilled at discovering user demands through data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think logically, work in a team and communicate effectively. Be able to organize and coordinate resources to solve problems and achieve goals in collaboration with different departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, enthusiastic, responsible to our customers and your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in English language, Chinese Language is an added bonus but not a requirement (to work cross functionally with the tech team).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
