&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Benefits and eligibility are dependent on employment status and pay class (full-time, part-time, or PRN). Specific details will be provided during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
