job-01acsaa:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Product Designer to help shape the future of our decentralized finance experiences. DeFi is one of the most complex and rapidly evolving spaces in crypto, and the design problems we&#39;re solving don&#39;t always have strong precedents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll drive product vision and execution across DeFi initiatives— Robinhood Chain, Robinhood Wallet, and more— working closely with product, engineering, legal and compliance and other cross-functional partners to ship best-in-class experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design at Robinhood is AI-first. This role is for someone who already uses AI as a core part of how they think, explore, and execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA, and New York, NY office(s), with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive outcomes end-to-end.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with product to define problems, validate solutions, and ship experiences that change how customers interact with crypto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring clarity to complexity.&lt;/strong&gt; Simplify complex crypto concepts into simple and intuitive interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uphold the craft bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Help set the standard for design quality and product excellence across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start with AI.&lt;/strong&gt; Use AI to explore problem spaces, surface edge cases, and generate early prototypes while you guide intent, structure, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product design experience working on complex, consumer-facing products with end-to-end ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active use of AI in your design workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid systems thinking, balancing detail with the big picture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with engineering, product, research, legal, and compliance in a highly regulated environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep crypto knowledge— experience isn’t required, but fluency is&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
