&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Da21dEazzo6ccSxU031ly6qegdh&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KPt8dBDOxoKjhpxmaBElU2PygPG&quot;&gt;The Compliance function at OKX is responsible for the overall compliance culture at the company. We’re a team of risk-minded problem solvers who advise the business on the company’s regulatory obligations and enterprise risk.Our OKX Malta team, in particular, is responsible for the overall AML and regulatory compliance programs in-country, meeting ongoing EU and global applicable requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
