job-1f5qy6d:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe’s People Systems Team sits at the intersection of technology and human experience. We are internal consultants who turn ambiguity into scale. Part of the People Solutions org, we partner with Corporate Technology, Finance, Payroll, the wider People team including Total Rewards &amp;amp; Benefits teams to build a world-class employee experience. We are a &quot;strategy-first, quality- execution-always&quot; team that values technical rigor, nimble problem-solving, and a deep empathy for the Stripes we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Workday Analyst, Payroll, you&#39;ll be a technical anchor for our Workday ecosystem and a driver of what&#39;s next for it. This role goes beyond keeping the lights on: you&#39;ll bring new Workday feature knowledge into the team, help automate manual payroll processes, and shape how we use emerging Workday capabilities (including AI-driven and agent-based tools) to modernize our payroll operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the technical health of our Workday Payroll environments for Workday in-house payrolls, balancing critical keep-the-lights-on (KLTO) operations with high-impact strategic projects. You&#39;ll also act as a bridge to our broader tech stack, supporting HRIS tools built on top of Workday and partnering with Payroll and other internal and external stakeholders for smooth data flow and a unified user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payroll partnership and delivery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Payroll:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary technical partner for the Payroll team, translating business needs into scalable Workday solutions and setting clear expectations on delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver payroll changes: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead technical configuration for Workday Payroll changes end to end, from requirements through implementation, testing, and deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support new country onboarding: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead implementation to onboard new payroll countries as Stripe expands, covering configuration, testing, and knowledge transfer so the team can support new geographies independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation and automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring new capability into the team:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay current on new Workday Payroll features and functionality, and assess and pilot them for Stripe&#39;s environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate and modernize: &lt;/strong&gt;Identify manual, repetitive payroll processes and redesign them using Workday automation, integrations, or agent-based tools, reducing manual effort and error rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategic roadmapping: &lt;/strong&gt;Work alongside People Solutions to lead product-led strategic projects from discovery to deployment, so our Workday footprint evolves ahead of Stripe&#39;s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence best practices: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to influence stakeholders on workday and HRIS best practices to apply, to deliver solutions and projects that are scalable and supportable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HCM operations support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resolve open tickets:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide operations support on the Workday HCM &amp;amp; Payroll side to resolve and close Stripe&#39;s open Workday tickets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Handle integration-specific tasks: &lt;/strong&gt;This includes issue resolution, data access requests, report writing, and managing integration errors and warnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as Tier 3 expert: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the escalation point for complex HCM, Payroll, and security issues that other tiers can&#39;t resolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day to Day Project work: &lt;/strong&gt;Project work may include developing Workday configurations, creating Workday dashboards, and producing custom Workday reports.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance and collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain compliance: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with Payroll, Compliance, Legal, and Internal Audit to manage payroll compliance controls (SOX ITGCs, segregation of duties, ACA reporting, multi-state tax nexus, FLSA rules, provincial obligations, and leave laws), annual access certifications, EEO-1/VETS-4212 filings, and T4/ROE year-end processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Share knowledge: &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to a supportive team culture by sharing knowledge and helping peers, and use good judgment to escalate risks and roadblocks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in HRIS/People Systems, with at least 3+ years of deep configuration experience in the Workday HCM, Reporting, Time and Absence and Payroll modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with highly confidential information&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;and supporting critical business operations and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal skills with the ability to set clear expectations with senior stakeholders and the confidence to escalate issues when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead cross-functional projects, navigating ambiguity and high-pressure timelines with a sense of urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of payroll processing, payroll calculations, costing, retro payroll, reconciliations, payroll auditing, and payroll security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workday certifications in Payroll for US and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of EIBs, Studio, or Core Connectors to support data flow between Workday and third-party vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Workday automation tools, AI-driven features, or agent-based capabilities (for example, Workday Illuminate or Extend), and an interest in applying them to payroll operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience supporting Workday Payroll implementations in new countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a &quot;low-ego, high-talent&quot; person who likes bringing order to complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-0zya5tz:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team/ Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coinbase is building the future of institutional trading as part of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups#pg-tabs&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Institutional&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Everything Exchange, powering the systems that let the world&#39;s largest financial institutions trade across markets with speed, depth, and trust. As an Infrastructure Lead on the Exchange team, you&#39;ll own the infrastructure, deployment, and operational tooling behind a unified trading platform that runs across cloud and on-prem/colocated venues, keeping latency-sensitive, multi-node trading environments fast, reliable, and easy to build on. It&#39;s a rare chance to shape trading infrastructure from the ground up, with the ownership of a startup and the reach of Coinbase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own infrastructure, deployment, and operational tooling for latency-sensitive, multi-node trading environments across cloud and on-prem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive reliability and developer velocity, owning observability, deploy safety, and incident response for systems that run 24/7.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the operational bar through standards, reviews, and automation, and reduce single-point-of-failure risk across the trading stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineers building the trading platform to make latency-sensitive systems operable and performant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and build team resilience across a lean, high-impact environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Institutional Markets, and SRE to turn platform needs into a roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills and experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of infrastructure, platform, or SRE engineering, with demonstrated ownership of production systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record running infrastructure for latency-sensitive trading environments, including on-prem/colocated deployments, not generic platform work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency with orchestration tooling, containerized and baremetal deployments, and observability/logging tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux performance and networking fundamentals in latency-critical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering end-to-end: scoping, implementation, deploy safety, monitoring, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a regulated or financial environment where reliability and low-latency performance are critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Position ID:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;TBC&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$218,025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$256,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
