job-0ykfav3:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team/ Role Paragraph:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coinbase is building the future of institutional trading as part of the Everything Exchange, powering the systems that let the world&#39;s largest financial institutions trade across markets with speed, depth, and trust. As an Architect on the Trading team, you&#39;ll design, build, and own the core trading systems that power Coinbase: order and execution management, algo execution, settlement, multi-venue connectivity, and low-latency messaging that serve our Retail, Prime, and wholesale brokerage customers. It&#39;s a rare chance to architect trading infrastructure from the ground up, with the ownership of a startup and the reach of Coinbase.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture of the end-to-end trading platform: the sequencer, the low-latency connectivity and messaging fabric, OMS/EMS, multi-venue connectivity, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design low-latency, high-throughput systems for real-time financial products used across institutional and retail markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive reliability and performance, owning SLOs, observability, and incident response for systems where correctness and latency are non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical bar through code, design reviews, and standards, and pay down the technical debt that matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce single-point-of-failure risk across the trading stack and build team resilience through mentorship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally with Product, Risk, Security, and Compliance to turn technical vision into a roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required skills and experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on architect, able to design, build, deploy, and support 24/7 trading systems that process billions of dollars of transactions daily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive backend engineering experience, with demonstrated ownership of complex, production-grade distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of architecting an end-to-end trading platform (OMS, front/middle office, multi-exchange connectivity), not just a single gateway.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in low-latency Java and high-throughput messaging (Aeron, SBE, or similar), designing event-driven, high-availability systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering projects end-to-end: scoping, architecture, implementation, monitoring, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building systems in a regulated or financial environment where correctness, auditability, and low-latency performance are critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience making user-facing product decisions that balance engineering trade-offs with end-user quality, demonstrated through shipped products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible use of generative AI, with human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Position ID: &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;P77879&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$253,895&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$298,700 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-15kw1j6:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Founded in Silicon Valley in 2009 by Marc Andreessen and Ben Horowitz, Andreessen Horowitz (aka a16z) is a venture capital firm that backs bold entrepreneurs &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/news-content&quot;&gt;building the future&lt;/a&gt; through technology. We are &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio&quot;&gt;stage agnostic&lt;/a&gt;. We invest in seed to venture to &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/growth/&quot;&gt;growth-stage technology&lt;/a&gt; companies, across &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/ai/&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/bio-health/&quot;&gt;bio + healthcare&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/consumer/&quot;&gt;consumer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/&quot;&gt;crypto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/enterprise/&quot;&gt;enterprise&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/fintech/&quot;&gt;fintech&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/games&quot;&gt;games&lt;/a&gt;, and companies building toward &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/american-dynamism/&quot;&gt;American dynamism&lt;/a&gt;. a16z has $100B+ under management across multiple funds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We’ve established a &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/crypto/#vertical-landing-staff&quot;&gt;team&lt;/a&gt; that &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/about/&quot;&gt;is defined by&lt;/a&gt; respect for the entrepreneur and the company-building process; we know what it’s like to be in the founder’s shoes. Our team is at the forefront of new technology, helping founders and their companies impact and change the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;a16z crypto aims to foster innovation, accelerate progress, and enable the crypto ecosystem to thrive in the U.S. — bringing the best of blockchains/crypto/decentralization to the world. (When we say “the best” of crypto, we mean the more &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/posts/article/blockchain-culture-computer-vs-casino/&quot;&gt;productive, not purely speculative&lt;/a&gt;, uses of blockchains that can deliver on &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/posts/article/read-write-own-intro/&quot;&gt;many benefits&lt;/a&gt; that people beyond the crypto industry want and need.) a16z crypto supports the crypto portfolio through engineering and security, go to market, regulatory and legal, research, talent and recruiting, as well as marketing — which includes an editorial content operation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This is a rare opportunity at an established, prolific “direct media” operation — a model pioneered and proven by this team for over a decade at a16z — that has published influential industry reports, op-eds, builder playbooks, podcasts/videos, newsletters, and other content distributed on various platforms. The marketing team is composed of experienced brand marketers, top communications/ PR experts, designers, and editors coming from both established media outlets and in-house content marketing operations; the social media will cover all these marketing functions, while reporting into editorial.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Social Media Lead is responsible for growing a16z crypto’s social channels, including engaging key communities across different audiences relevant to our industry. They will work closely with the crypto marketing team to (1) adapt and distribute existing content pieces into social media posts; and (2) help create content native to social media: clips, content campaigns, and more. This spans everything from social media for external podcast appearances/media interviews to investment announcements; to events and major industry conferences; to editorial content; to special projects, campaigns, and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This person will also advise the broader a16z crypto team (from investing to operations) — as well as our portfolio companies — in social media strategy and profile building.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This is a remote role (including on West Coast time), though occasional in-office presence will be required for regular team offsites, occasional conferences/events, and based on business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;To join our team, you should be excited to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and strategize. &lt;/strong&gt;You’re a doer who likes taking ideas to execution and is able to operationalize them into process, pipelines, and content calendars. But you’re not just good at the tactics: You’re also someone who is able to come up with fresh ideas — whether through collaboratively brainstorming with team members, proposing your own creative formats, or staying on top of the latest social media trends so you know which experiments to run and prioritize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze and optimize.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re data-driven, but also know how to trust your intuition and think big-picture. You (with us) will have hypotheses around content packages — and you will (working closely with our audience development lead) know how to test them, evaluate what’s working or not, and report back, so we build those learnings into our content programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create and produce. &lt;/strong&gt;You’re able to directly create social content when needed, help produce it with others, and help oversee our short-form clips operation (leveraging our technical A/V editors and internal production person). This includes identifying, adapting, editing, and timing the right clips, so they’re compelling, engaging, and well-received on socials&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plugged in online. &lt;/strong&gt;You’re on top of internet culture and the latest online conversations, monitor sentiment and “the current thing”, as well as track industry trends and shifts. You’re able to use this context to craft and tailor compelling, informative, and entertaining social media&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop community and voice.&lt;/strong&gt; You’re able to regularly engage with relevant social media communities and different audiences — as well as identify and engage key influencers across various crypto verticals/ domains. You would also be the online brand voice (and advocate for the industry) on behalf of a16z crypto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Excellent communicator — whether through text, multimedia, design, or memes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience owning or driving social media for a high-visibility or high-growth brand — past experience embedded in a content operation is especially welcome&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Proven ability to adapt style and voice across different formats, platforms, and audiences — able to be playful, thoughtful, smart, accessible, direct… all while striking the right tone (not corporate, not cringe)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with X, LinkedIn, Instagram, etc. required — and optionally, with crypto-native or alt social media tools and video (YouTube or TikTok)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Strong command of data — from implementing and using various analytics tools, to regularly interpreting and reporting insights&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to meet multi-threaded/ cross-functional deadlines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Passionate about technology, the internet, open source, and/or crypto — intellectually curious and always learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Low ego, high empathy, and the capacity to collaborate effectively with diverse teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role is between $199,000 - $232,000, actual starting pay may vary based on a range of factors which can include experience, skills, and scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role is eligible to participate in the a16z carry program and various discretionary bonus programs as well as benefit and perquisite plans including health, dental, vision, disability, life insurance, 401K plan, vacation, and sick leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a16z culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do only first class business and only in a first class way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We take a long view of relationships, because we are in the relationship business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We believe in the future and bet the firm that way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are all different, we recognize that, and we win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We celebrate the good times&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do it for the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We play to win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;At a16z we are always looking to hire the absolute best talent and recognize that diversity in our experiences and backgrounds is what makes us stronger. We hire candidates of any race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital or family status, disability, Veteran status, and any other status. These differences are what enables us to work towards the future we envision for ourselves, our portfolio companies, and the World.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Our organization participates in E-Verify. Click&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1674233464432000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1-yT1T3ug2xE734Ge62fLD&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; to learn about E-Verify.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Andreessen Horowitz hereby reserves the right to make use of any unsolicited resumes received from outside recruiting agencies and / or individual recruiters without being responsible for payment of any fees asserted from the use of unsolicited resumes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1glhzpb:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe, LLC. is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Regional sales leaders with intelligence and insight to accelerate growth;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Sales Strategy and Operations colleagues by standardizing global and regional common process that is currently decentralized;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a deep dive into key performance metrics and drive deep understanding of business performance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem solve and provide structure analysis outcomes for complex sales operations challenges through data, analytics and insight;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify new opportunities and areas of productivity efficiency gains for Regional sales leadership;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in projects defining go-to-market approaches, as well as in regular business and resource planning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run analysis on key performance metrics, and provide relevant insights for managing the business;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the implementation of enabling systems and tools, and work closely with internal systems teams;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare weekly senior leader forecast materials and provide ongoing updates on key business growth/metrics to leadership teams; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage bespoke projects and effectively manage stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must have a Bachelor&#39;s Degree or foreign equivalent degree in Business Administration, Finance, Economics, Management and Systems, or a related field, plus seven (7) years of related experience in Sales, Strategy, and Operations, of which at least five (5) years must be post-bachelor&#39;s progressive work experience. In the alternative, the employer is willing to accept a Master&#39;s Degree or foreign equivalent degree in Business Administration, Finance, Economics, Management and Systems, or a related field, plus five (5) years of related work experience in Sales, Strategy, and Operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must also have five (5) years of experience with each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SQL and other advanced analytic tools to develop and run complex SQL queries and analyze large data sets;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BI visualization tools, including Tableau; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with data and large data sets to identify trends and create insights to make recommendations to senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must also have four (4) years of experience with the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using AI to improve productivity and reduce manual processes, and automated reporting dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must also have three (3) years of experience with each of the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage cross-functional stakeholders and managing expectations and timelines; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with and manipulating large data sets to deliver deep analyses and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multiple positions available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary: $155,800.00 - $233,600.00/yr&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary range represents the base salary range for the role and any sales commissions /sales bonuses targets, if applicable, would be in addition to the base salary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;40 hrs/week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;50% Telecommuting permitted.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional benefits for this role may include: equity, company bonus or sales commissions/bonuses; 401(k) plan; medical, dental, and vision benefits; and wellness stipends. &lt;strong&gt;NY65&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
