&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Be proactive, strategic, and able to direct cross-regional financial systems independently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Must demonstrate willingness to be hands-on, mentor teams, and promote standardized solution plans cross-functionally. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficiency in English as a working language and fluency in Mandarin, in order to communicate effectively with Mandarin-speaking executive stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
