&lt;p&gt;Additional benefits for this role may include: equity, company bonus or sales commissions/bonuses; 401(k) plan; medical, dental, and vision benefits; and wellness stipends.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;NY44&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
