&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a passionate Backend Engineer to join our Card Issuing Team, which is building APIs and infrastructure that enable businesses to launch and manage their own card programs across Southeast Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will work closely with cross-functional teams to build scalable backend services, support integrations with payment providers and third-party systems, and contribute to the development of a card issuing platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who enjoys solving technical challenges, thrives in fast-paced environments, and is excited about building scalable fintech infrastructure from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, test, and maintain backend services and APIs for the Card Issuing platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain high-availability scalable systems supporting card issuance and payment processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with third-party APIs and payment integrations for local and global card transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot and resolve system issues, performance bottlenecks, and scalability challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regression testing, integration testing, and system reliability improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address bugs, technical debt, and operational support requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in sprint planning, code reviews, and technical discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement security and engineering best practices across services and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build internal operational tools and reporting systems for platform management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support incident response and on-call duties when required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Design, QA, and Operations teams on feature delivery and platform improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years of backend engineering experience, with a proven track record of building and operating production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in Golang&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining RESTful APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with microservices architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL databases, preferably MariaDB or MySQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Git and GitHub workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker and CI/CD pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn and operate in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-assisted development tools such as Claude, Codex, Cursor, or similar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Kubernetes, cloud infrastructure, and observability tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-0a4qvxg:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our new&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trading Operations Specialist&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a critical role in supporting the OTC Trading team by managing end-to-end partner onboarding, account maintenance, and portfolio reconciliation. This role sits at the intersection of trading operations, client success, and compliance. You will act as the operational linchpin—ensuring smooth onboarding workflows for Exchanges, Payment Service Providers (PSPs), and Liquidity Providers (LPs), while maintaining accurate reconciliations across both fiat and stablecoin positions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the end-to-end onboarding workflows for new business opportunities, Exchanges, PSPs, and LPs, ensuring all processes adhere to operational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support traders in monitoring the deal lifecycle and proactively follow up with prospective clients to retrieve necessary documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the internal cross-functional liaison—coordinating with Compliance for updated ACRA documents and the Corporate Secretary for UBO profiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track progress and report weekly operational highlights, milestones, and bottlenecks to the OTC Trading team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist traders with compliance preparations and execute periodic account reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with relevant divisions to resolve issues concerning Know Your Transaction (KYT) protocols and transaction monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow up with existing clients to secure outstanding documentation for Requests for Information (RFIs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promptly escalate any client pushback or onboarding blockers to the trading team for swift resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform financial reconciliation of revenue, P&amp;amp;L, and inventory balances across both fiat and stablecoin positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular performance analytics to evaluate and track exchange execution performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3+ years of experience in operations, client onboarding, or middle-office roles within fintech or financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail with a highly organized approach to managing multiple onboarding workflows and compliance documents simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with a proven ability to act as an effective liaison between external clients and internal cross-functional teams (e.g., Compliance, Traders).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive team player who thrives in a fast-paced environment and is always willing to support the trading desk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working at a cryptocurrency exchange, OTC trading desk, or in the broader Web3 industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid familiarity with KYC (Know Your Customer), KYB (Know Your Business), and KYT (Know Your Transaction) regulatory frameworks and screening protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Excel for daily financial and P&amp;amp;L reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

