job-1y6sio9:
&lt;p&gt;It all started with an idea at Block in 2013. Initially built to take the pain out of peer-to-peer payments, Cash App has gone from a simple product with a single purpose to a dynamic ecosystem, developing unique financial products, including Afterpay/Clearpay, to provide a better way to send, spend, invest, borrow and save to our 50+ million monthly active customers. We want to redefine the world’s relationship with money to make it more relatable, instantly available, and universally accessible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Cash App has thousands of employees working globally across office and remote locations, with a culture geared toward innovation, collaboration and impact. We’ve been a distributed team since day one, and many of our roles can be done remotely from the countries where Cash App operates. No matter the location, we tailor our experience to ensure our employees are creative, productive, and happy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Block, we strive to build the best financial products in the world. The Financial Platform Issuing team owns the card issuing platform that serves every Block brand — powering Cash App Card, the largest card program of all, alongside Square Card and the new programs Block launches next. We run the full lifecycle of a card: issuance, fulfillment, and activation; real-time transaction authorization and processing across card networks, digital wallet provisioning, 3-D Secure authentication and the disputes systems. When a customer taps their card at a register, our systems decide the outcome in milliseconds, around the clock, in partnership with card networks and bank partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a software engineer on the Issuing server engineering team, you will design, build, and operate the services that power these card experiences, through close collaboration with your team and partner disciplines. You&#39;ll own well-scoped features end to end — from design through testing, launch, and operation — and grow your scope as you go. The things you build will run at a massive scale and directly shape how millions of customers across Block spend their money every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of the team, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with your team to design, develop, test, ship, and maintain features across card issuance, transaction processing, and disputes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write high-quality, well-tested code, and participate actively in design reviews and code reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement systems that work within our microservice and event-driven architectures, with the reliability and correctness that moving money demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in operational ownership of tier-0 financial systems, including on-call, incident response, and postmortems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate AI fluency by leveraging AI-powered tools throughout the development lifecycle to improve velocity and quality, while applying sound judgment in their use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold your teammates — and yourself — to high engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn from and support other engineers through code reviews and technical discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of software development or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining production software systems, and delivering well-scoped projects or features end-to-end (design, build, test, ship, operate) with guidance from more experienced engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive to find flaws in a system with many moving parts and take whatever steps are necessary to fix them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset and an appetite for solving open-ended and ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated AI fluency, including experience using AI-powered developer tools and the ability to critically evaluate and responsibly apply their outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree or Diploma in Computer Science, Computer Engineering, Software Engineering, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies We Use and Teach&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Java, Kotlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;HTTP, JSON, gRPC, Protocol Buffers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hibernate, Aurora, MySQL, DynamoDB, Redis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kafka, event-driven architecture, microservices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Datadog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Buildkite, Gradle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI agents and tooling (Goose, Claude, MCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is an equal opportunity employer evaluating all employees and job applicants without regard to identity or any legally protected class. We will consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records for employment in accordance with state and local laws and “fair chance” ordinances.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible. &lt;strong&gt;Want to learn more about what we’re doing to build a workplace that is fair and square? Check out our&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/news/inclusion&quot;&gt;I+D page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While there is no specific deadline to apply for this role, U.S. roles are typically open for an average of 55 days before being filled by a successful candidate. Please refer to the date listed at the top of this job page for when this role was first posted.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate’s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To find a location’s zone designation, please refer to this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone A:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$142,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$213,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone B: &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$134,900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$202,300 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone C:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$127,800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,600 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone D:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$120,700&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$181,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-17aojio:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Risk Engineering builds the systems that protect Stripe from fraud, credit losses, and regulatory risk across user onboarding, compliance, financial crimes, and identity verification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Financial Crimes Engineering builds the systems and controls that let Stripe safely onboard businesses in emerging and regulated industries while keeping Stripe in compliance with sanctions law, anti-money-laundering rules, and financial partner requirements. We keep known bad actors off Stripe, find new through ongoing detection, and build AI-augmented tooling that helps expert reviewers resolve cases quickly and accurately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We operate at scale, screening every user, enforcing jurisdictional restrictions across money movement in real time, and automating signal acquisition and synthesis into investigation workflows. We&#39;re now re-architecting our screening platform to make it safe and easy for new Stripe products to launch with the right financial crimes controls, to express richer policy as code, and to serve as a multi-tenant Risk Platform offering across Stripe&#39;s products and subsidiaries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff Engineer on Financial Crimes Engineering, you&#39;ll own technical direction across our screening, detection, and review systems. You&#39;ll design infrastructure that balances screening latency with accuracy, build the systems that surface emerging risk and collect information to resolve it, and ensure investigators have the tooling they need. You&#39;ll work across distributed systems and policy logic, partnering with ML, Legal, and Compliance to translate regulation into working software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define technical strategy &amp;amp; vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish the multi-year architecture for Stripe’s real-time entity matching infrastructure, policy enforcement engines, and reviewer tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architect high-scale systems:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and optimize distributed screening engines and detection pipelines handling entity- and transaction-level requests at scale with strict SLA and uptime guarantees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build investigations infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt; Design the systems that surface suspicious activity, collect additional information from users, route cases to reviewers, and augment human judgment with AI to drive faster, more accurate case resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional technical alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary technical voice with Legal, Compliance, ML, and Product leaders to translate evolving global regulatory requirements into technical ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable Risk as a Service:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the architectural evolution toward a multi-tenant screening platform - laying the technical foundation for both internal product launches and external developer-facing APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the engineering bar:&lt;/strong&gt; Set standards for system design, API consistency, and operational rigor across backend and ML-adjacent systems; mentor senior engineers and lead high-stakes design reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Own system reliability, observability, and latency, ensuring production systems adapt quickly to sudden changes in global sanctions lists or traffic spikes, and participate in an on-call rotation for these systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience, including 5+ years in a strategic technical leadership role on core infrastructure, distributed systems, or platform engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing, building, and operating high-throughput, low-latency APIs and distributed backend systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of defining technical roadmaps and driving alignment across multiple engineering teams and cross-functional domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on technical depth - comfortable jumping from high-level system architecture down to code-level performance tuning and production debugging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with a track record of articulating technical decisions to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain experience in financial crimes, sanctions screening, AML (Anti-Money Laundering), entity resolution, or high-stakes trust &amp;amp; safety platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with applying LLMs or ML to operational workflows (e.g., case triage, entity resolution, review automation), or experience with fuzzy string matching and NLP for entity matching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building investigator/analyst tooling, case management systems, or human-in-the-loop review workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building platform products or APIs consumed by both internal engineering teams and external developers (e.g., API backward compatibility, client libraries).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience leading 0-1 platform builds or major architectural modernizations from concept to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech stack experience across multi-language environments (e.g., Primarily Ruby and Java) and modern data infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity and making high-judgment engineering calls in a fast-moving regulatory environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-0lw5kuy:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mesh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mesh, our mission is to enable consumers to pay and be paid with any asset. Today, trillions of dollars in tokenized assets exist but remain largely unusable for everyday commerce. Mesh is bridging this gap by making crypto payments reliable, useful, and ubiquitous. We combine a powerful orchestration engine with a seamless consumer app to unlock liquidity for the world. Backed by leading investors like PayPal Ventures, Paradigm, and Galaxy Ventures, we are building the infrastructure for the next era of the global economy. Join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a Senior Regulatory Counsel to help lead the legal side of Mesh’s global expansion. Working with the Chief Legal Officer and VP of Legal, you will own global regulatory strategy and market entry across LATAM, the EU, the UK, and APAC: assessing what it takes to launch in each market, shaping how our products are offered and distributed there, and driving the licensing and authorization workstreams that make it possible. You will work hand in hand with Compliance, Product, Sales, and outside counsel, and turn a complex, multi-jurisdiction picture into a clear, sequenced expansion plan. This is a hands-on role for someone who is comfortable operating across borders, legal systems, and time zones at startup speed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own global regulatory strategy and market-entry planning across LATAM, the EU, the UK, and APAC, including licensing and authorization requirements, sequencing, and go/no-go recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the regulatory workstreams for priority expansions: the Brazil VASP/SPSAV authorization (and any related acquisition), UK FCA registration and the FSMA authorisation regime, EU frameworks (MiCAR, EMI, and PSD2), and Singapore/MAS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure global product and distribution: how features are localized, offered, and distributed in each market, and the partner, reseller, and agent structures that support them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Compliance and regional MLROs on licensing applications, regulator engagement, and change-of-control and controller approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Select, manage, and coordinate outside counsel across jurisdictions, setting scope, budget, and timelines and synthesizing their advice into decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and stand up local entities for new markets, including cross-border entity setup and corporate structuring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise the business on market-entry risk and sequencing, translating multi-jurisdiction requirements into clear, practical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor regulatory and policy developments across target markets and adjust the expansion roadmap accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;8+ years of relevant legal experience, with significant time spent on cross-border or international financial services, payments, or crypto/digital-asset regulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Deep knowledge of financial services, payments, and crypto regulatory regimes in key markets (LATAM, UK, EU, APAC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Track record leading market-entry, licensing, registration, and authorization projects across multiple jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience structuring and standing up entities, including cross-border entity formation and corporate structuring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Practical, risk-based judgment, with comfort operating across borders, legal systems, and time zones at startup speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong cross-functional collaborator with Compliance, Product, and Sales, with the judgment to know what to decide versus escalate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;JD and active membership in good standing with at least one US state bar, or an equivalent qualification in a relevant jurisdiction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The compensation range provided may span multiple career levels and will be narrowed during the interview process based on factors including a candidate&#39;s experience, skills, qualifications, and geographic location. For candidates outside of New York or San Francisco, compensation will be adjusted to reflect the applicable market and location-based pay band. The base salary range listed excludes commission (if applicable), equity, and benefits. The pay range represents the minimum and maximum target for new-hire compensation. Actual compensation may vary and may be higher or lower depending on individual circumstances.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$280,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Love It Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mesh, you&#39;re not stepping into a typical role—you&#39;re joining a rocket ship in mid-liftoff. You&#39;ll tackle complex, meaningful problems that actually move an industry forward, working alongside a sharp, motivated team that moves quickly, collaborates deeply, and expects everyone to operate with ownership. This is the kind of place where you&#39;ll see your work ship fast, make real impact, and be able to point to something and say, &quot;I built that.&quot; You&#39;ll grow fast, level up your skills, and get a front-row seat to how a high-growth company scales from the inside, with competitive comp, solid benefits, and room to stretch your craft all coming standard. If you&#39;re energized by building, learning, and shaping something big—this is where you&#39;ll want to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Office Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employees based in our &lt;strong&gt;San Francisco, New York, and Bangalore&lt;/strong&gt; hubs are expected to work from the office at least 40% of the time (approximately two days per week). This expectation may vary slightly depending on role, team, and business needs. Certain roles that require closer cross-functional collaboration or operational support may have additional in-office requirements, which will be discussed during the interview process. Our hybrid approach is designed to balance meaningful in-person collaboration, team building, and real-time decision-making with the flexibility to work remotely. We believe this structure supports strong execution while preserving autonomy and focus time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Care For Our Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great work happens when people feel valued and supported. That starts with competitive salary and equity that grows as you and the company grow, plus comprehensive health coverage for you and your family. We offer unlimited PTO—and we mean it. Take the time you need to recharge and show up at your best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re invested in your growth with a dedicated budget for courses, conferences, and certifications. Work from wherever you&#39;re most productive with our remote-friendly approach, and count on having the top-tier tools and equipment you need to do exceptional work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mesh Pay is committed to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, genetic information, creed, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, lawful alien status, national origin, age, marital status, and non-job related physical or mental disability, or protected veteran status. Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1f685cf:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Figure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Figure (NASDAQ: FIGR) is transforming capital markets through blockchain. We’re proving that blockchain isn’t just theory - it’s powering real products used by hundreds of thousands of consumers and institutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining blockchain’s transparency and efficiency with AI-driven automation, we’ve reimagined how loans are originated, funded, and traded in secondary markets. From faster processing times to lower costs and reduced bias, our technology is helping borrowers, investors, and financial institutions achieve better outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Together with our 170+ partners, we’ve originated over $22 billion in home equity loans (HELOCs) on our blockchain-native platform, making Figure the largest non-bank provider of home equity financing in the U.S. Figure’s ecosystem also includes YLDS, an SEC-registered yield-bearing stablecoin that operates as a tokenized money market fund, and several other products and platforms that are reshaping consumer finance and capital markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be recognized as one of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.forbes.com/lists/fintech50/&quot;&gt;Forbes’ Most Innovative Fintech Startups in 2025&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fastcompany.com/91269557/finance-personal-finance-most-innovative-companies-2025&quot;&gt;Fast Company’s Most Innovative Companies in Finance and Personal Finance&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Figure is looking for an experienced backend Mortgage/HELOC originating professional to join our Operations team. In this role you will own the Figure HELOC post close process from beginning to end, leveraging your experience and expertise of the role to ensure we have recordable security instruments . The Post Close Operations Associate will manage all investor inquiries related to recorded deed of trust, note, assignments of mortgage, managing/shipping of trailing documents, as well as processing and recording of Assignments of Mortgage. Join this innovative team and make a big impact!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customer operations and processing to ensure a smooth post close mortgage process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide exceptional customer service to both internal and external customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be process focused and continuously look for opportunities for improvements and efficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to prioritize work based on investor delivery expiration and closing dates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle tasks such as printing, signing, notarizing, and recording relevant documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process paper Assignments of Mortgage (AOMs) related to loan sales and securitizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the Power of Attorney (POA) and AOM process for Private Label Partners until 100% of volume is on DART&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the onboarding and offboarding of DART loans via AOMs, ensuring timely and accurate processing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the processing of new PLDs, document revisions, and handling of tax affidavits, FP7, and other necessary paperwork in collaboration with our vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address security instrument exceptions and lien release issues, including conducting county research, outreach, and resolving recording exceptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage RSD tasks when closing defects are identified, dispositioning appropriately for next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage outreach efforts for unsecured liens, including calls, emails, FedEx letters, and SandCastle orders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process documents for closing&amp;nbsp; appointments as necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle curative efforts such as Scrivener&#39;s Affidavits and other document corrections, ensuring all documentation is accurate and compliant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the recording stage audit and ensure accountability for all security instruments (SIs), working with vendors to resolve outstanding liens and secure recorded SIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the&amp;nbsp; process for FNMA loan delivery and&amp;nbsp; MERS registration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform additional duties as assigned to support the team and company operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;1+ year of administrative and/ or customer-facing experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work and thrive in a fast-paced, startup environment with little direction and&amp;nbsp; meet tight deadlines&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to provide professional and concise communications with cross-functional teams and resolve any issues, including suspense conditions, within response deadlines&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional customer service skills to work with external customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to organize and manage a large pipeline of loans&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical skills and drive to look for process improvements and ways to digitize and automate processes&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate G-Suite (Docs, Sheets, Slides) and Google Drive to manage information and collaborate with team members through Slack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in residential mortgage lending with Post-Closing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of HELOC loans, FNMA, FHLMC, and private investor products&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thorough understanding of Federal and State regulations, including but not limited to&amp;nbsp; HELOC and Conventional guidelines, RESPA, TILA, HOEPA, and QM.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of State and County recording requirements and needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhere to all company security policies and data handling procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete mandatory security awareness training within required timeframes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promptly report any suspected security incidents or suspicious activity to the Security team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Base Compensation Range: $25/hr&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15% bonus target, paid monthly&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is the compensation range for the role in the United States. Actual compensation may vary based on a candidate’s experience, skills, location, internal equity, and evolving business needs. While most offers are generally made within the middle of the range, final compensation is determined based on the factors above.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision coverage, with 100% employer-paid premiums for employees and their dependents on select plans&lt;br data-start=&quot;2866&quot; data-end=&quot;2869&quot;&gt;Company HSA, FSA, Dependent Care FSA, 401(k), and commuter benefits&lt;br data-start=&quot;2936&quot; data-end=&quot;2939&quot;&gt;Employer-paid life and disability insurance&lt;br data-start=&quot;2982&quot; data-end=&quot;2985&quot;&gt;11 observed holidays and PTO plan&lt;br data-start=&quot;3018&quot; data-end=&quot;3021&quot;&gt;Up to 12 weeks of paid family leave&lt;br data-start=&quot;3056&quot; data-end=&quot;3059&quot;&gt;Continuing education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your residential location certain laws might regulate the way Figure manages applicant data. California Residents, please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figure.com/ca-employee-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;California Employee&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.figure.com/workforce-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;General Workforce Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for further information.&amp;nbsp;By submitting your application, you are agreeing&amp;nbsp; and&amp;nbsp;acknowledging&amp;nbsp;that you have read and understand the above notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Figure will not sponsor work visas for this position. In compliance with federal law, all persons hired will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the United States and to complete the required employment eligibility verification form upon hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MM1 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;

job-1gp5vkv:
&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn’t work together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we’ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We’re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Square is building a world-class, high-accountability field sales organization — and we’re looking for a leader based in &lt;strong&gt;Houston, Texas &lt;/strong&gt;who is both a coach and a builder. You know the craft of selling deeply: how to open doors, generate pipeline, position value competitively, and close with precision. You lead from the front, developing your team through active engagement — not from the sidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the driving force behind a disciplined, insight-led sales motion that blends in-person selling with proactive outbound strategy. Your leadership will elevate both the quality and velocity of revenue while shaping a culture rooted in excellence, ownership, and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a hands-on leader with deep product expertise, strong competitive instincts, and a track record of raising the bar for sellers — this is your next move.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with expertise in the field&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Territory Account Executives through active, in-market coaching — from sourcing and opening conversations to consultative discovery, competitive positioning, and closing with clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model world-class selling by joining prospect and customer meetings, demonstrating product fluency, value articulation, and decisive deal strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend significant time in the field with your team, strengthening local relationships, fueling community-driven pipeline creation, and ensuring sellers experience Square through a human, product-driven presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate in the details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage pipeline and KPIs with rigor — diagnosing gaps, identifying risks, expanding coverage, and guiding AEs to create and progress high-quality opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run disciplined weekly pipeline, forecast, and deal reviews that drive action, accountability, and predictable outcomes across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Use data-backed insights to coach AE effectiveness, elevate sales execution, and ensure consistent momentum across high-velocity, complex sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a high-performance, high-accountability culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment defined by trust, clear expectations, ownership, and open communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold the team to a high bar of execution while providing the clarity, structure, and hands-on coaching needed to meet it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard, and develop AEs to ramp quickly, deepen product expertise, and consistently exceed quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale expertise, process, and go-to-market effectiveness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a product and competitive expert — ensuring your team can confidently articulate Square’s value and differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable, repeatable field sales motions that increase funnel quality, improve outbound productivity, and accelerate growth in your assigned cities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine strategy, playbooks, and operating rhythms to deepen Square’s presence and win market share across key local ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner and innovate across the business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the customer voice and collaborate cross-functionally to strengthen product-market fit and unlock new revenue pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Engage deeply with community networks, partners, and local events to amplify brand awareness and fuel top-of-funnel opportunity creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of sales success, ideally in a high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of leadership experience, preferably managing field account executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in high-transaction SaaS or financial services sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong bias toward action and experimentation, balanced with thoughtful decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building a winning, high-performing culture through hands-on leadership and coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience operating in a metrics-driven sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence and collaborate with cross-functional partners in a rapidly scaling business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling and overseeing large Field Sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to communicate and build relationships with senior executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, leadership, organizational, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is a proud equal opportunity employer. We work hard to evaluate all employees and job applicants consistently, without regard to identity or other legally protected class.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about what we’re doing to build a workplace that is fair and square? Check out our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/inside/about-inclusion-and-diversity&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;I+D page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future. To find a location&#39;s zone designation, please refer to this &lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone A: ($198,000 - $297,000)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone B: ($184,000 - $276,000)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone C: ($174,000 - $261,000)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone D: ($164,000 - 246,000)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amounts listed above include target variable compensation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1sekcls:
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HGpydMG7copXARxmdcxlU0hHggd&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-T8H5dxcnRodqE8xfvvdlQVKmguc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OObndQnqAofJoNxWiTRl7dt3gUh&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-W5IZdcRXNohDXaxWwzalriL7g5f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ArZVdsd5dosVSVx5kDyl4XAEggd&quot;&gt;Our Card and Payment engineering team builds reliable, intuitive experiences at the intersection of cards, payments, crypto, and global financial infrastructure. We partner closely with product, design, backend, risk, compliance, and business teams to make card and payment products accessible to users around the world.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DhcYdIYrNowuqLxkzeRlFLGGgGe&quot;&gt;As a Senior Mobile Engineer on the Card and Payment team, your primary responsibility will be to own and improve the global card issuance process. You will work mainly with product and engineering partners in the US, while meeting regularly with teams in Asia to understand requirements and align delivery. We are looking for someone who is highly self-driven, takes real ownership, collaborates well, and is eager to learn the card issuing and payment businesses in depth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EvefdqQqSoe8Dbxf2UflYA9NgKe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UuZJdS2IzoyGhgx30DglaFNLg6c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own the end-to-end global card issuance process—from eligibility and application through card creation, activation, provisioning, and lifecycle servicing—and improve the experience as OKX expands into new markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SUpbdLGbqoQj4CxKEYHlhsvbgYd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Learn the card issuing and payment domains deeply, and translate business, user, payment, and regulatory requirements into sound architecture, clear trade-offs, and executable delivery plans.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RvfUdlJycojGU4xZUXxl6eK4gPg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own features from discovery through production, with a strong focus on security, reliability, observability, maintainability, documentation, and test coverage.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E0TAd5zfPoZrD6xmrvqlUV4Qgbf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive ambiguous, cross-functional initiatives to completion with a high degree of ownership, self-direction, and sound judgment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U9vbdbdjAoFItsxQ5F8lgnuAgCh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate primarily with product and engineering teams in the US, while joining regular discussions with Asia teams to discover, clarify, and align requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J8ewdAlCaoQAlOxgsDMl4UCvg51&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build with Swift, Kotlin, or Rust depending on the problem, and actively learn and adopt new languages, platforms, and tools rather than being limited to a single technology stack.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L9Madj6s9o1bJVxWjPOlR01Cgob&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Use AI coding tools throughout the development lifecycle—from exploration and implementation to testing, review, and documentation—while maintaining strong engineering judgment and accountability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YC2FdqHdioGdiHx3Dk9l2Abzgmh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and maintain reusable AI workflows, engineering harnesses, and technical knowledge bases that improve the entire team’s speed and quality.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D1dCd4Nc2oCm0wxISzrlv03MgWf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Review code, share context openly, mentor teammates, and make decisions that improve both engineering quality and overall team outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jd9rdBVDLoqGf6xXyWrlInBVg3X&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Contribute to hiring, onboarding, and the continuous improvement of team practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DgcMdSpSKoy1bMx9GQOlJ4kdgJg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vs5sd1RTdoqTZxxys9AlHRRkgFm&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;B.S. or M.S. in Computer Science, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ATBNdvNQNogPF4xC7Q6lJV4ngid&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience shipping and operating production-quality mobile applications, with deep expertise in iOS or Android.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZgIEdtHr6oXBldxKaFIl4stXg7g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong proficiency in at least one of Swift, Kotlin, or Rust, with a demonstrated willingness to learn and contribute in unfamiliar languages and technology stacks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KkwPddI7ToP7bKxrMhslkvILgfd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Exceptional ownership and self-direction, with the judgment to make pragmatic decisions and drive ambiguous work to completion.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YAEBdoqXPo7T0Ixc68olvDvygrg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrated, regular use of AI coding tools with measurable impact on delivery speed, code quality, or engineering effectiveness.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZZI7dwk16oRQehxQkOQlM3nTgVf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A team-first mindset: you communicate openly, share knowledge, support peers, and align technical decisions around the best outcome for the team and product.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GhEmdseKSo9uI8xlbVYlcC1YgLZ&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Genuine curiosity about card issuing and payment businesses, plus the ability to communicate technical decisions clearly with partners across the US and Asia. Professional proficiency in English and Mandarin Chinese is required.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-FslGdXrDYoj5k1xCzE8lMY0hgUP&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z8bYdsnVjo39HKxWl5qlR0ywgid&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience with global card issuance flows, card processing, payments, fintech, crypto, or other high-trust financial products.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UUcNdXLoUoQKI3x8PfalhMGSgVh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience launching products across multiple countries or regulatory environments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZRzdo4diokTrDx4m3el1uaggBc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Knowledge of mobile security, payment authentication, risk controls, or transaction lifecycle design.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FECOdVEG2oSIyexzqwUlRvvSgNd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience improving mobile architecture, shared components, developer tooling, or engineering productivity at team scale.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DzFMdMpI9oVat9xmvZklkVcNg2g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience mentoring engineers or leading cross-functional technical initiatives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ar22dU2mHoapTcxE12rlHadqg4f&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GUV6dmFkJouTO4xf7fvlFGMrghd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Competitive total compensation package&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RvqJdp0floKE84xhpLFlnkRigLd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;L&amp;amp;D programs and Education subsidy for employees&#39; growth and development&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ThbidCF2Lo0elpxaDnJlkwyygqh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Various team building programs and company events&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
