&lt;li&gt;AI-driven observability, automated operations, or stability engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with open-source middleware internals (Redis, Kafka, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microservice governance, service discovery, and configuration center design experience&lt;/li&gt;
