&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QCqMdPdP5onfxIxgotOlEVHGg2b&quot;&gt;We are looking for a dedicated and proactive Sr. VIP Relationship Manager to join our US Strategic Markets team.&amp;nbsp;As a Sr. VIP Relationship Manager, you will play a key role in expanding our base of VIP clients in the US. This role is focused on high net worth individuals, family offices and smaller corporate clients, driving our growth through partnerships and key client development in parallel to our institutional team, which on the other hand focuses on larger professional, enterprise and institutional clients.&lt;/div&gt;
