&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CwTWd4JH2oF5sBxAvSClKS8mgrd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A highly data-driven and results-oriented mindset.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOUidvDz1oLzRzxToaAlpj4Xghg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Exceptional communication and stakeholder-management skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtTTdOLRyoed4Ixq9e1l4inbgyb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset, with strong ownership, adaptability, and bias toward action.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SRjUdwhHKob0L1xDGd8l0lJNgVe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent organization and project-management capabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DGT9dWGDooHTIPxzJGFlGWRggqb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent years of experience&lt;/div&gt;
