&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7486&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in software development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7535&quot;&gt;Expertise in backend development using languages such as Go, Python, or Java, with deep knowledge of cloud-native architectures.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;7665&quot;&gt;Strong grasp of system design, data modeling, and software engineering fundamentals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
