job-1le02po:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;section-header section-header--large font-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;About Digital Asset &amp;amp; the Canton Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Asset builds the technologies that are reshaping the foundations of financial markets. Our mission is to create the world’s most trusted, privacy-enabled, and interoperable digital infrastructure for global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of this mission is the Canton Network - the blockchain purpose-built for institutional finance. Uniquely combining privacy, compliance, and scalability, Canton enables real-time, secure settlement across multiple asset classes. Governed by the Canton Foundation with participation from leading financial institutions, it is the proven link between the promise of blockchain and the power of global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 and headquartered in New York City, with offices in London, Zurich, Budapest, Hong Kong, and Sydney— we are on a mission to transform finance— and that transformation is now playing out rapidly on the Canton Network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you’re interested in playing a crucial role at the intersection of traditional and crypto-capital markets and want to help bring the next trillion dollars of finance on-chain, join us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Sr. Technical Support Engineer is responsible for owning and resolving client incident and request cases, throughout &amp;nbsp;the entire &amp;nbsp;lifecycle of each case. It includes documenting and advising our clients on how to best install, configure, deploy, connect and use DA products and maintain utmost uptime for DA’s online services. The primary objective is to provide DA &amp;nbsp;clients with a great experience when using/learning our products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Triages complex software issues and provide technical assistance to customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prioritizes and resolve incidents and requests raised by external and internal clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Documents issue resolutions and FAQs not found in our official products documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Properly escalates unresolved issues to appropriate internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Participates in a scheduled on-call rotation to provide support coverage during non-business hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in computer science, engineering or related discipline (or equivalent technical training and/or work experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;6+ years of experience as a Technical Support Engineer, Developer, or similar technical role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Technical Skills – strong understanding of computer hardware and software, networking, security and other related technical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience developing commercial applications using Java, Javascript, Python or Scala&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using and administering databases, particularly SQL, PostgreSQL and/or Oracle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Good understanding of networking protocols/firewalls and cloud computing environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experienced in packaging and deploying applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to diagnose and troubleshoot basic technical issues (eg,analyzing problems, testing solutions, and recommending changes)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with configuring and using &amp;nbsp;Operating Systems (Linux/Windows/MacOS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with &amp;nbsp;configuring and using blockchain based Distributed Ledgers (Fabric, Ethereum)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience with deploying and configuring services on Cloud Environments (AWS, GCP, Azure), and using Containerization/Orchestration tools (Docker, Kubernetes)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with using support third party tools such as (Salesforce, Jira, Confluence, Datadog, Jaeger, Github, etc..) is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Communication Skills – ability to effectively interact with clients, colleagues and other stakeholders and use excellent verbal, written and listening skills to explain technical concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Problem-solving Skills – able to identify and understand software issues and develop solutions to fix them. &amp;nbsp;Ability to research and analyze software problems, identify potential solutions and implement them. &amp;nbsp;Strong attention to detail and ability to be hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Customer service skills – ability to maintain a supportive and calmative approach to answer client questions, solve problems and provide solutions in a pressure situation with clients during production outage situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Continuous Learning – in the use and troubleshooting of DA products and DA developed support tools; in the use and troubleshooting of third-party products and services typically used in conjunction with DA products; and in using third-party tools used at DA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to work as a self-starter, with high energy and confidence, in a fast-paced, change-oriented environment&lt;br&gt;Experience in working in a Financial Services environment and familiarity with Financial asset types is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Digital Asset, we are committed to compensation structures that reward impact consistently across our global teams. We support our people at every stage of life with comprehensive, family-forward benefits and flexible working models designed to help you do your best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support the well-being of our team members. Health and insurance benefits vary by region to ensure local relevance and compliance, and may include medical, dental, and vision coverage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Digital Asset is an equal opportunity employer committed. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, sex, religion, sexual orientation, age, disability, citizenship status, veteran status, or any other basis protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Eligibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If and as required by applicable law, all persons hired to work at Digital Asset will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the location for which they have an offer to work and to complete the necessary employment eligibility verification documents upon hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ccommodations&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Applicants with disabilities who require accommodation during the application or interview process should contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@digitalasset.com&quot;&gt;talent@digitalasset.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Privacy Act (CCPA)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If you are based in California, we encourage you to read this important information for California residents linked &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.digitalasset.com/ccpacpranotice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-00cshtj:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Junior Associate – Operations, you will perform daily shift operations to ensure the accurate and smooth settlement of routine fiat and blockchain-based transactions. Working under direct supervision, you will manage daily reconciliations, maintain operational logs, escalate errors promptly, and utilize modern tools and AI to keep workflows efficient. This role requires resourcefulness, problem-solving skills, and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, highly-regulated environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute routine daily settlement and processing for standard fiat and blockchain-based transaction queues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform accurate daily reconciliations and maintain meticulous transaction logs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor transaction queues to meet daily SLA cut-offs and prevent backlogs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify processing errors or system glitches promptly and escalate them with detailed context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage approved AI tools, templates, and software to streamline individual tasks and daily outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear and timely communication with peers and immediate stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team OKRs and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17kggzo&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;159&quot;&gt;Diploma or Bachelor&#39;s degree, with 0–2 years of experience in financial operations, banking, payments, fintech, or other fast-paced operational environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v5su2q&quot; data-start=&quot;160&quot; data-end=&quot;307&quot;&gt;Strong attention to detail with the ability to maintain accurate records, identify operational discrepancies, and ensure timely issue escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;q46goy&quot; data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;459&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively across teams in a high-volume, SLA-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xudjlp&quot; data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;609&quot;&gt;Willingness to work rotating shifts, including weekends, public holidays, and evening schedules, while adapting to changing operational priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ux1nv0&quot; data-start=&quot;610&quot; data-end=&quot;812&quot;&gt;Tech-savvy with a willingness to leverage productivity and AI tools (e.g., ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude) to improve efficiency; familiarity with customer support platforms and spreadsheets is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4ip19h&quot; data-start=&quot;813&quot; data-end=&quot;952&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Eagerness to learn and grow, with a foundational understanding of blockchain, stablecoins, or digital asset operations considered a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

job-0jpnd33:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a player-coach Director, Global SDR Operations to lead a team of six Sales Development Representatives spanning New York, São Paulo, London, Dubai, and Singapore. You&#39;ll own the SDR team&#39;s contribution to qualify pipeline through two motions: outbound prospecting, and fast, thorough follow-up on marketing-sourced leads. You&#39;ll partner closely with Growth Marketing to convert leads into qualified opportunities and to feed lessons from outbound efforts back into refining campaign targeting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports directly to the leader of the GTM Strategy and Operations team. This role, as well as the individual SDRs, will have a dotted-line reporting relationship with the regional Managing Directors, reflecting the SDR team&#39;s primary directive: to serve the revenue goals, strategic priorities, and market nuances of each sales region. Success in this role requires operating as a true extension of the regional sales leadership teams — deeply embedded in their go-to-market rhythms, attuned to regional deal dynamics, and consistently translating regional feedback into how the SDR team targets, messages, and prioritise its efforts. You will also develop talent, and serve as the SDR team&#39;s voice in Ripple&#39;s go-to-market planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Team Leadership and Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and hold accountable a global SDR team to hit and exceed individual and team pipeline targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build individualised development plans within the SDR organisation; celebrate growth at every level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the SDR ramp-up framework: design structured onboarding for new SDRs that accounts for regional variation across a globally distributed team and tracks milestone attainment through to full productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach SDRs on discovery, objection handling, product and industry knowledge, and consultative selling techniques; conduct regular call reviews and message audits to raise the quality bar across the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong talent pipeline through evergreen recruiting; develop top talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and refine outbound and inbound playbooks, messaging, and cadences tailored to ideal customer profiles (ICP) and the latest GTM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Growth Marketing team on lead handoff, campaign follow-up, and feedback loops to improve lead quality and conversion velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strategy and Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define SQL and SQO criteria in collaboration with Sales leadership; own the opportunity handoff process to ensure clean, consistent transitions to sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a dual-motion prospecting strategy covering both outbound pipeline generation and inbound lead triage and follow-up; ensure no marketing-sourced lead falls through the cracks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Growth Marketing and Product Marketing to define and maintain ICP and TAM targeting (territory carving); ensure SDR outreach is aligned to the highest-value segments with a constant optimisation mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operations and Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Global SDR Playbook and harmonisation of regional nuances around: onboarding, training frameworks, and evolving standard processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the SDR tool stack strategy: own evaluation, selection, implementation, and optimisation across core platforms including Outreach, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, Lusha, ZoomInfo, and AI-powered prospecting and coaching tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, implement and optimise processes for team efficiency, including account creation and approval workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, track, and report on team KPIs; conduct regular Win/Loss analysis and share insights with leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast lead pipeline and revenue contribution accurately on a monthly and quarterly basis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Functional Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong relationship with regional Managing Directors and Sales leadership and regular cadence of communication to stay tightly aligned on regional pipeline priorities, market dynamics, and strategic shifts, while advocating for global process consistency across all SDR motions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Growth Marketing, Product Marketing, and Enablement to remove pipeline blockers and align on campaign follow-up and GTM priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the SDR team in go-to-market planning and strategy discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years managing quota-carrying SDR, BDR, or inside sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing and working within a distributed team across multiple time zones and regions; ability to adapt playbooks, messaging, and coaching approaches to account for regional market nuances and cultural differences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of hitting pipeline and revenue goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of B2B outbound and inbound prospecting motions and sales engagement tooling, as well as sharp written communication skills with the ability to write and edit high-converting outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with core SDR tools: Salesforce, Outreach or Salesloft, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, ZoomInfo or Apollo; familiarity with AI-powered tools (Gong, Lavender, or similar) a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills across Growth Marketing, Product Marketing, Sales, and Enablement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven approach to performance management and process improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience hiring, ramping, and developing sales development talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background as an individual contributor in crypto, FinTech or B2B software sales preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please find our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/eu-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;UK/EU Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;and our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/ca-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for reference.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-15cqo5e:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT HUT 8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine the ultimate destination for those who want to work at the cutting edge of technology, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;energy,&lt;/span&gt; and infrastructure. Hut&amp;nbsp;8 is on a mission to build and operate some of the world’s largest data centers for next-generation computing workloads, including AI, Colocation, Cloud, and Bitcoin Mining. We are proud to offer interesting and challenging opportunities for individuals who want to build teams, solve problems, and make an impact from day one. If you’re an ambitious individual looking for a career that is as rewarding as it is challenging, you’ve come to the right place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;standard-markdown grid-cols-1 grid [&amp;amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 gap-3 [&amp;amp;_&gt;_*:last-child]:mb-0 print:block print:[&amp;amp;_&gt;_*_+_*]:mt-3 standard-markdown&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Own customer-facing project management from lease execution through Ready for Service (RFS), serving as the central link among the customer, Hut 8 Commercialization, Asset Management, Engineering and Construction, and the general contractor. The role covers the development, construction, commissioning, and delivery period; at RFS and project closeout, customer and site responsibility transitions to Asset Management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roles and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Serve as the customer&#39;s primary point of contact for all design, engineering, construction, commissioning, and delivery matters through RFS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Act as the day-to-day integrator across the customer, internal Hut 8 teams, and the general contractor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain ground-level knowledge of the project — design development, construction sequencing, RFIs, submittals, schedule dependencies, open issues, and change orders — by working directly with Hut 8 and contractor engineering and construction teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own customer-initiated change requests end to end: intake, clarification, technical scoping, internal coordination, cost and schedule impact assessment, pricing, customer approval, implementation tracking, and closeout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Evaluate and communicate the downstream effects of proposed changes on cost, schedule, design, procurement, commissioning, and contractual commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ensure change orders and customer requests follow the processes established under applicable EPC, general contractor, engineering, and lease arrangements; escalate deviations to the appropriate internal owner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Translate customer requirements into clear direction for internal and contractor teams, and translate technical and schedule information into clear updates for the customer and Commercialization leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Provide the customer with regular, accurate updates on design, engineering, procurement, construction, commissioning, schedule, open decisions, and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Prepare for and lead recurring customer project meetings, maintaining action logs, decision records, and issue trackers with accountability for follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Maintain a single source of truth for customer requests, project commitments, lease-driven delivery obligations, amendments, change-order history, approvals, and communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Identify and escalate issues that could affect RFS, customer expectations, commercial terms, project economics, or long-term operability of the asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Coordinate project closeout and formal handoff to Asset Management at RFS, including final change-order documentation, delivery of project records, confirmation of open items, and transfer of customer, contractual, and operational history.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Following handoff, transition to the next development or construction-stage customer project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;5 to 10 years of experience in project management, construction management, owner&#39;s representation, or customer delivery, including direct experience within data center environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong working knowledge of EPC and general contractor processes, including design development, RFIs, submittals, procurement, construction sequencing, commissioning, change management, and project closeout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Able to work in the details with engineering and construction teams while communicating clearly at the executive level with customers and internal leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience assessing and communicating the cost, schedule, technical, contractual, and operational impacts of proposed project changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to manage senior customer stakeholders and translate between technical and commercial audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Highly organized, with the ability to manage multiple decisions, timelines, approvals, and workstreams across one or more active projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proactive in identifying risks early, driving cross-functional resolution, and maintaining accountability across internal and external teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Familiarity with data center leases, EPC agreements, construction contracts, and change orders strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE WORK ENVIRONMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW3104751 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW3104751 BCX0&quot;&gt;This role is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW3104751 BCX0&quot;&gt;in office at our corporate headquarters in the Brickell area of Miami, Florida. Reasonable accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW3104751 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT MAKES HUT 8 A GREAT PLACE TO WORK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hut 8 offers a benefits and wellness program that includes medical, dental, vision, life, and&amp;nbsp;short-term and long-term disability insurance, as well as paid time off.&amp;nbsp;We are proud to invest in building the best team in the industry. At all levels of the organization,&amp;nbsp;we are driven by an entrepreneurial spirit, radical transparency, and relentless growth mentality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Hut 8, you will have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Work with bright, driven peers from a range of educational and professional backgrounds&amp;nbsp;including software development, energy, engineering, entrepreneurship, investment&amp;nbsp;banking, private equity, and management consulting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Design and pitch new products, services, and other initiatives to a leadership team&amp;nbsp;consisting of serial entrepreneurs and seasoned executives and backed by a board of&amp;nbsp;directors consisting of industry veterans of energy, finance, and government&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Debate ideas and alternatives in a truly meritocratic setting where the learning curve is&amp;nbsp;steep and the lessons come from both senior and junior members of the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Build a lifelong network of friends and professional connections at the cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;intersection of technology, energy, and infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

