&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;A Better Place to Build Your PT Leadership Career&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;When you join Upstream Rehabilitation, you get the strength of a national network with the feel of a local clinic.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our central support teams handle the administrative&amp;nbsp;work&amp;nbsp;so you can focus on what matters most — your patients, your team, and your clinic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With more than 1,200 clinics across 26 brand partners, we lead the industry in clinical outcomes. We&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;data, technology, and innovative tools to reduce administrative burden and support your success as a leader.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You’ll join an incredible community of clinicians who shape our culture, support one another, and have fun along the way.&amp;nbsp;It’s&amp;nbsp;easy to see why so many Physical Therapists grow into leadership at Upstream.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Estimated pay ranges listed above are based on several factors including but not limited to your pay class, experience, background, and geographic location of the clinic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Benefits and eligibility are dependent on employment status and pay class (full-time, part-time, or PRN). Specific details will be provided during the hiring process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Upstream Rehabilitation is an Equal Opportunity Employer that strives to provide an inclusive work environment where our differences are celebrated for the value they bring to our communities, our patients and our teammates. Upstream Rehabilitation does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, religion, gender (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, age, disability, veteran status, or other status protected under applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1wbt6cb:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Communications team builds and protects Stripe’s brand and influence across the world. Product Comms is a team of creative thinkers and entrepreneurial strategists tasked with deepening the understanding of Stripe’s products. We work closely with the Product, Marketing, Policy and wider Comms teams to produce imaginative and effective messaging and provide strategic counsel to our executive team that goes far beyond the bounds of traditional comms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is to lead global product communications for Stripe’s crypto offerings. You’ll work shoulder-to-shoulder with senior leaders and the teams building Stripe’s crypto products to shape the storytelling strategy around this new frontier of financial infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Three important dimensions of this role include: (i) entrepreneurialism — you’ll work in uncharted territory, building a new comms muscle for Stripe. It’ll be up to you to identify and go after the best opportunities. (ii) superb writing and storytelling — you’ll bring your writing skills to bear on Stripe’s highest profile public moments, such as company letters, executive keynotes, and other long-form content. The vision for Stripe’s crypto products needs to come to life with your words. (iii) attention to detail — building in a new space requires a foundation of trust and legitimacy. You’ll work at an uncompromising quality bar where no detail is too small to matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global product communications for Stripe’s crypto products,including Bridge and Privy (crypto infrastructure companies acquired by Stripe in 2025).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development, articulation and testing of Stripe’s long-term public vision for its crypto products, specifically as a substrate for economic growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and roll out strategic campaigns that build awareness for Stripe’s crypto products and deepen key audiences’ understanding of exactly what makes stablecoins so useful to global businesses of all sizes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and edit extremely high quality written materials for Stripe’s biggest moments, including newsroom posts, social content, industry keynotes, top tier media interviews and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with local and regional comms leads to raise awareness for Stripe globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain relationships with thought leaders and influencers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic counsel to our executive team, including Stripe’s founders and most senior product leaders, and collaborate closely with your counterparts on the partnerships, policy, and product marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve done exceptional work in your career to date and have the proof points to show for it (built a great product, ran a high-impact campaign, started your own business, or similar accomplishments).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a superlative writer; someone who has been recognized by their peers as a truly exceptional writer, with a particular knack for making technically sophisticated topics interesting and memorable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience collaborating effectively with large, cross-functional teams as well as working with senior executives 1:1.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ve worked in a technology, B2B and/or financial services or banking environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re passionate about the potential for (and real-world impact of) crypto.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re deeply immersed in the world of independent media—Substackers, podcasters, video makers, influencers on X. You might personally know some of the people shaping these conversations (or even be one yourself), but more importantly, you understand the culture, the discourse, and where the zeitgeist is heading next. You combine the best of what you’ve found online with your original ideas to create compelling stories and new insights. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-1nnwfl8:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenZeppelin is the security standard onchain finance is built on. Founded in 2015, our mission is to accelerate the world&#39;s transition to an open financial system, built on open standards and secured by rigorous research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our open-source Contract Libraries have facilitated over $35 trillion in onchain value and are used by 10 of the top 10 tokenized money market funds and 9 of the top 10 stablecoins by market cap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We combine AI-native security tooling with deep research and a decade of audit expertise to support leading institutions and crypto-native teams shaping the next generation of digital assets like DTCC, Fidelity, Coinbase, Uniswap, Aave, the Ethereum Foundation, and many more across the full secure development lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400, style=;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; Always refer to OpenZeppelin&#39;s official job page for the most accurate information about our open roles, as we have seen multiple third party job sites posting inaccurate information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Ecosystems Team&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenZeppelin&#39;s libraries and standards are the trusted foundation of onchain development across Ethereum, Stellar, Canton and beyond, powering the majority of the world&#39;s most valuable protocols and a new generation of institutional-grade financial infrastructure. The Ecosystems team builds the long-term partnerships behind that position: we work directly with L1 and L2 foundations, protocol teams and technology providers on security audits, secure development, reference implementations and strategic open-source programs that help entire ecosystems grow securely. As tokenization and institutional adoption accelerate, the team sits at the center of some of the most consequential projects in the industry. You will report to our Ecosystem Development Lead and work alongside senior sellers, our CTO office, and our solutions and delivery teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own a portfolio of ecosystem accounts and be responsible for growing it. This is a senior, full-cycle sales role for someone who is technical enough to lead discovery and scoping conversations with CTOs and core developers directly. You will deepen relationships with some of the most important foundations and protocol teams in the industry, and open doors to new ones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and grow a portfolio of ecosystem accounts (L1/L2 foundations, protocol teams, infrastructure providers) through renewals, expansion into new services, and multi-year partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Win new business through targeted, research-driven outreach to foundations and protocol teams, typically six to seven-figure engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the full sales cycle, including technical discovery: scoping security audits, secure development engagements and open-source partnership programs, and translating protocol roadmaps into compelling proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strategic account plans for your portfolio, staying close to your customers&#39; roadmaps and identifying opportunities early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our CTO office and solutions teams on strategic proposals, and help shape the institutional-grade solutions emerging from our largest partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent OpenZeppelin at ecosystem conferences, technical workshops and community events worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years in sales or commercial roles, including 3+ years owning and exceeding revenue targets for technical products or services (Web3, security, developer tooling, or infrastructure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of closing six and seven figure deals with blockchain foundations, protocol teams, or technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real technical fluency: you understand smart contract development, EVM architecture and blockchain infrastructure well enough to lead technical conversations, read documentation and EIPs/ERCs, and earn credibility with engineering audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-cycle ownership: you prospect, qualify, propose, negotiate and close, and you run your pipeline with discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established network across blockchain ecosystems, foundations and protocol teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent proposal writing and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background as a developer, solutions engineer or security researcher before moving into sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling security audits or security services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ecosystem funding mechanics: foundation budgets, grant programs, treasury-funded partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to financial institutions, tokenization or RWA projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with onchain analytics (Dune, Nansen, block explorers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our interview process takes place on Zoom and tends to consist of the following stages:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recruiter Call (30 minutes)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hiring Manager Call (60 minutes)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Team Interview (45 minutes)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Leadership Interview (30&amp;nbsp;minutes)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Paid work test (up to 20 paid hours of work)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Reference checks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;j-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;requirements&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Meet your teammates at company gatherings around the world 😎&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Enjoy the flexibility of fully remote work 🌎&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Take the time you need with flexible time off 🏝&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Grow your family with 8 weeks of paid leave for primary caregivers, 4 weeks for secondary caregivers, and a one-time $3,600 baby bonus 💙&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build your ideal home office with up to $500 in equipment support 🪑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Stay covered with medical insurance 🏥&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Keep growing with learning and development opportunities 🧠&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Get a monthly stipend for your preferred co-working space 💻&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OpenZeppelin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, we are an equal opportunity employer and we value different perspectives. We are committed to building a diverse workforce. This includes but is not limited to gender, race, sexual orientation, religion, national origin and other characteristics that make each one of us unique. In this uniqueness, we find the most value. Come join us!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Use of AI as part of the recruiting process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of OpenZeppelin’s recruitment process, we may use automated tools, including artificial intelligence, to assist in reviewing applications and assessing candidate qualifications. These tools are used to support our People team by identifying relevant skills and experience, and are not used to make decisions solely by automated means. All hiring decisions involve human review. Any personal data provided as part of your application will be processed in accordance with OpenZeppelin’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.openzeppelin.com/privacy&quot;&gt;Data Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have questions about this recruitment process or would like to request human review of your application, please contact us at talent@openzeppelin.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-0qryf5p:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe&#39;s Enterprise Sales team partners with over 50% of the Fortune 500 companies in North America, helping them build new business models and drive meaningful modernization. The East Coast region is one of our highest-concentration markets for strategic accounts and new logo opportunities across all industries with a concentration in fintech, media, financial services, retail, and travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Enterprise Sales for the East Coast, you&#39;ll own regional revenue delivery and team performance, working closely with our Americas Enterprise leadership on strategy while driving execution on the ground. You&#39;ll lead a team of Regional Sales Directors and their Account Executives, shaping this team to focus on industry-led motions, and you&#39;ll serve as the region’s GTM executive with our most important customers in Stripe’s New York office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own East Coast Enterprise revenue: new logo growth, expansion of existing accounts, and accurate forecasting across your region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a team of Regional Sales Directors and their AEs, setting high standards for performance, pipeline discipline, and customer engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry executive relationships with strategic accounts and step into key deals to accelerate outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Americas-level strategy into regional plans, priorities, and hiring decisions that reflect local market dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Marketing, and Solutions Architecture to bring the right resources to your largest opportunities and surface customer signal that shapes Stripe&#39;s roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and reinforce the industry-first motion, sales process, the Stripe Way methodology, and forecasting practices your team runs on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the playbook for consumption-based, API-driven enterprise sales in your region, and share what works across the broader team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As the Regional Sales Leader, you will lead a team of Regional Sales Directors and their Enterprise Account Executive teams, with direct management of RSDs and shared accountability for the broader supporting functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the vision and operating rhythm for the East Coast region, balancing long-term team development with near-term execution and forecasting discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and reinforce Stripe&#39;s sales methodology across your team, setting the standard for pipeline quality, deal progression, and forecast accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the repeatable practices your team needs to hit revenue targets and grow, then share what works with the broader Americas Enterprise organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step personally into the largest strategic deals, leading executive relationships and helping your team close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring customer and market signal back into Stripe, working with Product, Engineering, and Marketing to influence roadmap priorities based on what you&#39;re seeing in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements below. If you do, we encourage you to apply. Preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years in enterprise technology sales, including 7+ years managing managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of delivering revenue results at scale in a high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and hiring senior sales talent across multiple markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills: you&#39;re comfortable in the numbers and use data to drive decisions and hold the team accountable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage credibly at the C-suite level with complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling developer platforms, APIs, or financial infrastructure to enterprise buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in payments, fintech, or adjacent financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up new sales coverage in a region or market from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-1e7ak3v:
&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn’t work together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we’ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We’re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Square is building a world-class, high-accountability field sales organization — and we’re looking for a leader based in Orange County who is both a coach and a builder. You know the craft of selling deeply: how to open doors, generate pipeline, position value competitively, and close with precision. You lead from the front, developing your team through active engagement — not from the sidelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the driving force behind a disciplined, insight-led sales motion that blends in-person selling with proactive outbound strategy. Your leadership will elevate both the quality and velocity of revenue while shaping a culture rooted in excellence, ownership, and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a hands-on leader with deep product expertise, strong competitive instincts, and a track record of raising the bar for sellers — this is your next move.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with expertise in the field&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Territory Account Executives through active, in-market coaching — from sourcing and opening conversations to consultative discovery, competitive positioning, and closing with clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model world-class selling by joining prospect and customer meetings, demonstrating product fluency, value articulation, and decisive deal strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend significant time in the field with your team, strengthening local relationships, fueling community-driven pipeline creation, and ensuring sellers experience Square through a human, product-driven presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operate in the details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage pipeline and KPIs with rigor — diagnosing gaps, identifying risks, expanding coverage, and guiding AEs to create and progress high-quality opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run disciplined weekly pipeline, forecast, and deal reviews that drive action, accountability, and predictable outcomes across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Use data-backed insights to coach AE effectiveness, elevate sales execution, and ensure consistent momentum across high-velocity, complex sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a high-performance, high-accountability culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment defined by trust, clear expectations, ownership, and open communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold the team to a high bar of execution while providing the clarity, structure, and hands-on coaching needed to meet it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard, and develop AEs to ramp quickly, deepen product expertise, and consistently exceed quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale expertise, process, and go-to-market effectiveness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a product and competitive expert — ensuring your team can confidently articulate Square’s value and differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable, repeatable field sales motions that increase funnel quality, improve outbound productivity, and accelerate growth in your assigned cities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously refine strategy, playbooks, and operating rhythms to deepen Square’s presence and win market share across key local ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner and innovate across the business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the customer voice and collaborate cross-functionally to strengthen product-market fit and unlock new revenue pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Engage deeply with community networks, partners, and local events to amplify brand awareness and fuel top-of-funnel opportunity creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of sales success, ideally in a high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of leadership experience, preferably managing field account executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in high-transaction SaaS or financial services sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong bias toward action and experimentation, balanced with thoughtful decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building a winning, high-performing culture through hands-on leadership and coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience operating in a metrics-driven sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence and collaborate with cross-functional partners in a rapidly scaling business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling and overseeing large Field Sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to communicate and build relationships with senior executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, leadership, organizational, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is a proud equal opportunity employer. We work hard to evaluate all employees and job applicants consistently, without regard to identity or other legally protected class.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about what we’re doing to build a workplace that is fair and square? Check out our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/inside/about-inclusion-and-diversity&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;I+D page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future. To find a location&#39;s zone designation, please refer to this &lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone A: ($198,000 - $297,000)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone B: ($184,000 - $276,000)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone C: ($174,000 - $261,000)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone D: ($164,000 - 246,000)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amounts listed above include target variable compensation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

