&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Support daily office operations, collaborate with pantry assistants on office upkeep, manage office supplies and maintain adequate inventory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
