&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J5lMdPzOsooUWxxTU8PuJh7EsLf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong engineering execution paired with product instinct&lt;/strong&gt; — able to lead the design and delivery of security products, platform modules, and SDKs/Agents while balancing security outcomes against performance overhead, integration cost, and long-term operability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J5lMdPzOsooUWxxTU8PuJh7EsLf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional ownership,&lt;/strong&gt; cross-team communication, and the persistence to move security governance, rule enforcement, and remediation through to a clear result.&lt;/li&gt;
