&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgLRYi8JXZBW2yQuWiFR1JBe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Investigating possible matches generated by the scanning application that the Company uses to screen customers against sanctions, PEP&#39;s and adverse media news and ensuring the appropriate action is taken.&lt;/div&gt;
