job-1ca1awk:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Sp6mdz5uHonn3Mxv5yWuwPXPsDF&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusbuBVizV5cd8tI3y0LkZjVb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusfNqhiw0W4q7eidpL36ogjg&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in the design and optimization of the MasterCard/VISA card issuance business system to improve system performance and development efficiency, ensuring high availability, maintainability, and scalability of the system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusUJ7zvKWt8f7f1zqbGb83vb&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Involved in the design and implementation of multiple subsystems in card issuance business, including card application, card management, reconciliation, etc., ensuring clear boundaries between modules for easy expansion to support rapid business growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusG2uUOJGc6reXOeqD2Fezhc&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive rapid business development and efficient iteration through continuous technological research and innovation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuse72TAykpNVkxq5ZDDqCSmf&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Responsible for stability construction, ensuring high stability of card application and card management; guaranteeing the performance and accuracy of card transaction reconciliation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusM9rS8oFmil83TJcbfKpILr&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus1y4CX3URoB410rWZrNiSQ8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusYNSUY1x72eaSBGZtvYlSFS&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;3-5 years of work experience, a bachelor&#39;s degree or above in computer software or related fields.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusciRWxJCyjDHHqivxwaZwce&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Solid foundation in Java programming, mastery of common design patterns, and multithreading programming; familiar with common Java open-source frameworks (Spring/Spring Boot, Mybatis).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussHasrqGvNlwR5pLegnXZCe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Understanding of computer principles, with a good foundation in data structures and algorithms.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussHasrqGvNlwR5pLegnXZCe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Practical experience in developing highly available applications based on databases, caches, message middleware, and microservices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussHasrqGvNlwR5pLegnXZCe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficient in the use of databases like Mysql/Oracle, with some SQL tuning abilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussHasrqGvNlwR5pLegnXZCe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Capable of analyzing and designing general system modules.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussHasrqGvNlwR5pLegnXZCe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Passion for technology, meticulous and rigorous at work, with a strict requirement for system quality.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussHasrqGvNlwR5pLegnXZCe&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Good at communication, adept at cross-team and cross-cultural collaboration, proficient in English/Mandarin/Cantonese.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

