&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-Mw3adlMKdoH3F7xkdyGuKldFsJj&quot;&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hk0adsl4DougL5xfi7buRO3wsuh&quot;&gt;The EU BI Head serves as the single owner of all EU data management. This role is responsible for building and maintaining the data infrastructure that fulfills compliance, business, and financial requirements across multiple licensed entities. The position combines hands-on data governance with strategic advisory to management on business risks and opportunities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-K2Iidx0dUosqz4x8s8BuHnQcsad&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
1. EU Data Ownership &amp;amp; Structure
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YfUydnQ81oSp0exNZvwuhklJsc4&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as the sole owner of all EU BI data management across business lines&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EPuBdWGB3oPbjRxgiVFuSFJ2sfh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and implement data structures that fulfill compliance, business, and financial reporting requirements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVPsd5m37ovKAdxB3quuQOEVsfc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure data coverage spans all EU-licensed entities (MiCAR, EMI, MIFID, and future licenses)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XaRMdt3choyduqxiyOiu6womsg3&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish and maintain a unified data architecture that enables consistent cross-entity reporting&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-K0gad1NGpoIdbVx2Ri2uoQ57sNe&quot;&gt;2. Reporting &amp;amp; Financial Analysis&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hx1kdVIrvo37eWxi9i3upeQfscd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Own and deliver all regular regulatory reports with accuracy and timeliness&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T1OXdveNlohIyXxc9YeuGin4sYR&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Produce financial projections and business data analysis for management decision-making&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WmCfdpOcVogtQfxhXWjuQv93sMN&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage tax reporting data requirements and ensure data readiness for audits&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFbbdBxQfo3fHQxt8HhuTdgFsTg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Identify and resolve business data discrepancies; support management and teams in troubleshooting data issues&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
3. Data Governance &amp;amp; Compliance
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DDJddPHBRozLuXxYjy1ulpG0sMf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead data governance framework for EU operations, including data segregation and data protection policies&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EsTVdxxr8ojo9GxzIUiudaKfskg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure full compliance with EU GDPR and DORA requirements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J32ydwenZoLo1KxjJdNutdXtsVc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Implement and maintain data classification, access controls, and retention policies&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NmXXdUeNdop8ISxwRcxuvxNRscD&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate with legal and compliance teams on data-related regulatory obligations&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
4. Risk Alerting &amp;amp; Strategic Advisory
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KTbMdV3soooABrxfFl1urr2Ls7c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proactively identify and escalate business risks through data insights&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UhTSdeuTToO1UgxzZuMuu0dYsPb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support management and leadership in taking timely action on risk indicators&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LNmwd4LnKoxqMHxNnTFuVUZQsvO&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Monitor and report on important business impacts and competitor movements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G049dRKnnoKNCWxlmhhuIlDfswe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provide data-driven recommendations to inform strategic decisions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-HvIVdNqRwoKf7JxIq3UukkKCsBc&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-B8UadjuvdoH5nQxpiEKuiZ1vsrh&quot;&gt;Education&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A2kEdyoGWot3S7xZfX1uw895ssg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Business Intelligence, Data Science, Finance, Statistics, Economics, or a related quantitative field&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-V62BdMHc3oHUeHxNqYeu7qAisBV&quot;&gt;Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TtHmdLDv5oxnctx2NH4ulSE5sjf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven professional background in Business Intelligence, data processing, financial analysis, or business data analysis&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNmSdE2aEoMyMgxWeS6uyFBjslb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience in the financial industry or at large exchanges, with exposure to big data environments&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LPpadWlUvoK9a0xaxE5uwUVLsdc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Track record of managing data governance, compliance reporting, or regulatory data submissions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-CztGdDMXOoDGcBxzYVfufQazs3f&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AO2Gd3qyjoPk2PxPVEaufM2RsLb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong proficiency with mainstream data analysis and processing tools (SQL, Python/R, BI platforms)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G9mwdFSk2odaNgxzl3KuOGO5sJf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Solid understanding of data architecture and data structure design&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B9ZHd34bXoCeKwxDCy3uWLRVsRb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with financial data processing and reporting systems&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WlRndJ0WaodCXPxBZbAu5qEQs4g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with data governance frameworks and EU regulatory standards (GDPR, DORA)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TU48d3qcvoMThZxpIpkuI4TBsoe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Understanding of data virtualization and structured data processing techniques&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
