&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P8GRdzClaowcqKx4lWJuTN9vsCf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to communicate complex data issues to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IleAdZVanocIUSxwN8QuWK4QsVe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
