job-1vmyylq:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies, from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups, use Stripe to accept payments, grow revenue, and create new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet. The work ahead is substantial, which gives you the opportunity to help put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing some of the most meaningful work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Early careers is a critical part of Stripe’s long-term talent strategy. The University Recruiting team helps shape the company we become by building the systems, programs, and hiring partnerships that bring exceptional interns, apprentices, and new graduates to Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As University Recruiting Manager, you will lead and develop a team of University Recruiters while owning the strategy and delivery of intern and new graduate hiring across Stripe. This is a high-visibility leadership role with a wide stage: you will work across every line of business and role type, partner with leaders throughout the company, and turn ambitious hiring goals into thoughtful, durable programs. You will also help lead Stripe’s global internship and apprenticeship programs, including onboarding, intern experience, and employee-relations escalations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;University Recruiting at Stripe is not a transactional recruiting function. This role goes well beyond attending a career fair or filling individual roles. You will set direction for an early careers strategy that supports Stripe’s business needs today and builds the talent pipeline we will need next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will bring strategic judgment, a builder’s mindset, and a deep commitment to craft. You will balance the operational rigor required to deliver at scale with the creativity to design programs and experiences that are clear, useful, and memorable. You will use data to understand what is working, where we are falling short, and what needs to change. And you will build credibility with leaders by making complex recruiting challenges easier to understand and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of full-cycle University Recruiters. Set a high bar for judgment, execution, and candidate and hiring-team partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver a clear early careers hiring strategy across Stripe’s lines of business and role families, translating business needs into practical recruiting plans and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leaders and hiring teams across the company to understand workforce needs, influence decisions, and meet ambitious hiring goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global internship and apprenticeship programs, including onboarding, intern experience, program operations, and employee-relations escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve the end-to-end candidate experience in partnership with Finance, People Operations, Benefits, Onboarding, Legal, and other cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop thoughtful university, event, employer-brand, and employee-referral strategies that strengthen Stripe’s early careers talent pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use people analytics, recruiting data, and operational insights to identify patterns, measure performance, inform decisions, and improve the systems your team relies on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar for how University Recruiting works at Stripe by bringing rigor, care, and a strong point of view to both the strategy and the details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are a strategic recruiting leader who sees early careers as a company-building function. You pair high standards with a practical work ethic, and you are comfortable moving from long-range planning to solving the immediate problem in front of you. You care about the quality of the work, the experience it creates for people, and the decisions behind it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and delivering a university recruiting strategy or major early talent initiative at a high-growth or complex organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven record of leading and developing University Recruiting professionals. You give clear feedback, build strong teams, and help people grow their judgment and capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic thinking and the ability to bring clarity to ambiguous, multi-stakeholder problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The communication and influencing skills to earn trust with leaders at every level and turn ideas into aligned action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of ownership, a rigorous work ethic, and the ability to operate effectively in a fast-moving environment with shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appreciation for craft and beauty in the work. You care about the quality of the strategy, the programs, the candidate experience, and the operational details that make each of them work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep interest in people analytics, with experience using recruiting metrics, tools, and process data to improve decisions and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with hiring teams throughout the recruiting process as a trusted advisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

job-0ah7d7k:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold builders and sharp problem-solvers who are wired to deliver great outcomes. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. The DevX team’s mission is to build and operate the core developer infrastructure at Robinhood. Our team owns and scales the systems that thousands of engineers rely on daily, partnering with software developers across the company to make development fast, reliable, and cost-efficient!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Developer,&lt;/strong&gt; you will focus on building and scaling our developer infrastructure. You will manage and optimize monorepo builds with Bazel and own the remote build execution cluster that powers them, and you will scale CI pipelines to be fast, safe, and reliable across thousands of daily builds. You will also improve the developer onboarding experience and provide remote development environments to accelerate development&amp;nbsp; workflows. In this role, you will ensure developers can code, test, and deploy with minimal friction. This is an incredible opportunity to make a massive difference for the entire engineering organization!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Toronto, ON&lt;/strong&gt; office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimize monorepo builds using Bazel and own the remote build execution cluster, ensuring fast, stable builds and short feedback loops for our engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale CI pipelines to support thousands of daily builds, focusing on speed, safety, and reliability, while managing GitHub repository configurations, pre-merge checks, and test executions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the developer onboarding experience, reducing time-to-first-commit and making it easy for new engineers to get productive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide and maintain remote development environments to accelerate local workflows and ensure developers can code, test, and deploy with minimal friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining developer infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines, or large-scale build systems (such as Bazel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in writing clean, maintainable code in Go or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed or remote build execution systems, and a solid understanding of containerization and orchestration using Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and a focus on improving developer productivity, onboarding, and engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, and equity ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top tier benefits to fuel your work, including supplemental health insurance, ancillary insurance, and mental health support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible employer-paid benefits spending account expenses beyond traditional benefits such as wellness, childcare, learning, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, paid volunteer time off, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly commuter stipend to help offset in-office commuting costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is committed to providing an inclusive and welcoming interview experience for all candidates. If you require a specific accommodation during the application or interview process due to a physical or mental condition, please complete this&lt;a href=&quot;https://robinhood.hracuity.net/webform/index/752875e4-42ba-4dff-9951-fd51e315997e&quot;&gt; Applicant Accommodation Form&lt;/a&gt; to notify our team. The form should only be completed if you need a specific accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Usage Disclosure:&lt;/strong&gt; Robinhood uses artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of our recruiting process. These tools enhance the efficiency and consistency of our hiring process; however, all hiring decisions are made by our hiring teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacancy Notice: &lt;/strong&gt;This job posting represents an existing vacancy that we are actively seeking to fill.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Toronto, ON&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$166,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$195,000 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1f1psq4:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Lead Bybit&#39;s AI-powered trading product line, integrating large language models and Agent technology into trading scenarios to build next-generation products including conversational trading, intelligent strategy recommendations, and autonomous trading Agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Own the AI trading product roadmap: conversational trading, AI strategy recommendations, autonomous trading Agents, and intelligent risk alerts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Design natural-language-driven trading experiences that lower the barrier to strategy configuration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Define Agent autonomy boundaries (advisory / semi-autonomous / fully autonomous), balancing automation with user control&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;End-to-end product management: requirements definition → PRD → engineering collaboration → launch &amp;amp; iteration → data review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Collaborate with algorithm, engineering, and design teams to productize AI capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Track frontier LLM/Agent technologies and continuously deliver product innovation proposals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text universal-card-text--bold&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;5+ years as a Product Manager, with 2+ years in trading products or AI products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of crypto trading systems (spot/derivatives/strategy trading, matching engines, risk management)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Familiarity with LLMs, Agent architectures (ReAct / Tool-use / MCP), RAG, and Prompt Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__ul&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-marker=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;universal-card-markdown-list__li-content&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;universal-card-text&quot;&gt;Track record of 0→1 product delivery; data-driven with strong execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
