&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today,&amp;nbsp;Bybit&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;recognized&amp;nbsp;as&amp;nbsp;one&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;most&amp;nbsp;trusted&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;transparent&amp;nbsp;platforms&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;digital&amp;nbsp;asset&amp;nbsp;industry,&amp;nbsp;continuing&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;expand&amp;nbsp;its&amp;nbsp;global&amp;nbsp;presence&amp;nbsp;while&amp;nbsp;building&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;infrastructure&amp;nbsp;for&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;next&amp;nbsp;generation&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;financial&amp;nbsp;services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H7mQd3Z1YoyVOXxVsw2uAcSUsZb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TIrLdlfjVohkRDxOCYxuc4wEsug&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Responsible for reviews related to data security, account security, and fund security. Combine SOPs with risk judgment to complete risk screening and disposition; proactively identify various potential anomalies and risks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CzNAdw5q4oFwmwxFg1KupQ7tskb&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Responsible for daily operations of security and risk control monitoring alerts at all levels; promptly identify, analyze, handle, and escalate abnormal situations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTgjdeUX1o3kRexNSaWu5zsxs4f&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Communicate with users and relevant collaboration teams; collect and review EDD (Enhanced Due Diligence) materials; assist in completing identity verification and risk disposition.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tfb9dlxc8olgifxYSQeuCiuxsPg&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Summarize typical risk cases; assist in optimizing review processes, operational SOPs, and risk control security strategies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XPODdwCZ7ofwMVxqhsTuHLgLsCd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;list-number1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YVAbd1rz0o4IRrxmnu6u6vGassg&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;2+ years of work experience, with background in risk review, security operations, anti-fraud, or related fields.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M7Sfdus5do7pYwxtmEbuLq1us4N&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong risk awareness and independent judgment; able to proactively identify anomalies and potential risks beyond standard SOPs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UNSVdgCuYo4lDixvCMHuOTSysYg&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Highly responsible, detail-oriented, and rigorous; good communication and collaboration skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lwjdd1frmoYNowxP6C5ukyphsPX&quot; data-list=&quot;number&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Able to adapt to 7×24 shift-based work schedules.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;RR9rdUJP1oj3K7xHl7SuZLDcszc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U70AdX1mIo0Jzhx4zm3uD8vTsRh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Composition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FPu7d3WdBo9cs7xBxmRuZViysOh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Control Alerts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q5psdnkAyokBX2x2K7Ku4pn6ske&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Withdrawal Review: The last line of defense for funds — the most important and primary work. Covers all scenarios including account risk, platform fund risk, and transaction risk; risk scenarios are differentiated by tags.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MZ5sd0OS5ov8EdxIS66uEKWesRg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;P0 / P1 Alerts: Faster response, more proactive risk management; generally higher-priority risks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JATOdHRisoV1sgxG3QouGlTksd1&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;SF Tickets: Security parameter changes and manual account credits, initiated by CS (Customer Service), with risk control review making the final decision. Reason for this process: CS cannot independently assess risk, and full reliance on CS creates single-point-of-failure risk.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XDMpdU84JoQpiXxjMWTuruVnsAd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Workflow: When CS receives customer complaints related to risk that they cannot assess independently, they escalate to risk control for judgment assistance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cf4zdFP7jowYGDxxQBpuStLpsBe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Alerts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
