&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage permission settings and access controls to ensure secure and efficient user access to company resources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Security Systems Configuration and Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
