&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure security systems are configured according to specified requirements and industry best practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Assess security configurations across cloud and endpoint platforms, benchmark controls against CIS, STIG, SOC2, and internal security standards, and drive remediation activities to improve security posture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
