&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxlg9Bat1aJqSmsGpP9y3VRtWb&quot;&gt;3. Organizational AI Enablement &amp;amp; Adoption&lt;/h3&gt;
