job-14fg8le:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team + role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Robinhood set out to open the financial system to the many, not the few. We&#39;ve done it for tens of millions of people in the US—now we&#39;re taking it global. This is one of the most ambitious initiatives for the company, and you&#39;d be sitting at the center of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We&#39;re building an elite team that applies frontier technology to the world&#39;s biggest financial problems. We want bold thinkers, sharp problem-solvers, and builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn&#39;t a place for complacency—it&#39;s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. Expectations are high. So are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As a Senior Product Manager on the international team, you&#39;ll manage large-scale projects, own international trading experiences, and work with experts in data, design, engineering, marketing, operations, and research to bring ideas to life that will help us democratize the financial system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA and New York, NY offices, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The International PM team&#39;s goal is simple to say and hard to do: democratize finance globally. That means scaling our products to work across many regions and building market-specific experiences that serve customers where they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As a Senior PM on this team, you&#39;ll own end-to-end product experiences in new geographies and help set the playbook for every market that follows. Additionally, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ship groundbreaking products into new regions, working shoulder-to-shoulder with global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Bring together product development teams to craft and communicate a product vision and shared set of priorities that meet the most important needs of our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive the roadmap—extending what exists and defining what&#39;s next, including entirely new products for local markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop strong, collaborative relationships across design, engineering, and operations at the team and organizational levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner with communications, compliance, content, customer experience, and marketing so the vision, the products, and the progress are understood everywhere they need to be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ensure parity of product lines across global markets.&lt;/li&gt;
