job-17er924:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blockchain&lt;/strong&gt; is connecting the world to the future of finance. As the most trusted and fastest-growing global crypto company, it helps millions of people worldwide safely access cryptocurrency. Since its inception in 2011, Blockchain has earned the trust of over 90 million wallet holders and more than 40 million verified users, facilitating over $1 trillion in crypto transactions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior IT Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Operations team based in Dallas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Provide comprehensive and timely IT support to all employees, including VIP and&amp;nbsp;C-suite executives, delivering white-glove service with professionalism and discretion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Exercise security best practices and monitor and train employees to do the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Maintain and provision employee hardware and software for a global workforce,&amp;nbsp;leveraging Apple Business Manager and MDM platforms to deploy policies, push&amp;nbsp;updates, and apply patch fixes at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Perform onboarding, offboarding, and re-provisioning procedures efficiently and&amp;nbsp;securely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Support the setup and management of new and existing infrastructure, including&amp;nbsp;office builds and fit-outs from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Manage and administer core SaaS platforms at an admin level, including Slack, Jira,&amp;nbsp;Notion, 1Password, Google Workspace, and Apple Business Manager; additional&amp;nbsp;experience with Microsoft 365, Adobe, and DocuSign is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Support employees with AI tools (Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini and similar) and&amp;nbsp;handling queries, troubleshooting, and providing admin-level guidance to help teams&amp;nbsp;get the most out of AI in their workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Manage office LANs, Wi-Fi, and video conferencing systems, with hands-on&amp;nbsp;experience supporting AV hardware (Logitech, Owl) and platforms (Google Meet,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Zoom)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Manage laptop logistics for new hires and leavers, including coordinating shipments&amp;nbsp;and collections through carriers such as FedEx, UPS, or Retriever to ensure&amp;nbsp;seamless device delivery and retrieval globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Configure and manage network infrastructure including Meraki switches, access&amp;nbsp;points, and firewalls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Handle vendor management and ISP engagement (experience with Verizon or other&amp;nbsp;ISPs is a bonus), ensuring reliable and cost-effective service delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Support the operations team across all projects including internal events, external&amp;nbsp;events, and office moves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Support employees potentially out of hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL NEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in IT support or systems engineering, with a track record of&amp;nbsp;operating independently and thriving under pressure in fast-paced environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;A high degree of security awareness and current knowledge of best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Ability to prioritize, organize, and execute quickly and efficiently in a dynamic environment with ever-changing and competing demands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Solid knowledge of TCP/IP, networking, routing, and firewalls; hands-on experience&amp;nbsp;with Meraki or similar enterprise networking platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Superb problem-solving abilities with a calm, methodical approach to complex&amp;nbsp;incidents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Confident, outgoing, and whatever-it-takes attitude with the ability to work&amp;nbsp;independently and take full ownership of projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Previous startup or scale-up experience with the ability to manage multiple projects&amp;nbsp;across varying timelines and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Strong proficiency in macOS and Google Workspace administration (essential)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience with Jamf or equivalent MDM platforms at an admin level, including&amp;nbsp;creating and managing policies, pushing updates, and deploying patch fixes; Rippling&amp;nbsp;MDM experience is a bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience with AV systems and video conferencing hardware (Logitech, Owl) and&amp;nbsp;software (Google Meet, Zoom)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Admin-level experience across core SaaS tools: Slack, Jira, Notion, 1Password,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Google Workspace, and Apple Business Manager; Microsoft 365, Adobe, and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;DocuSign experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AI tools such as Claude or ChatGPT, and comfort supporting users at&amp;nbsp;an admin level with queries and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Experience with office moves, builds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Vendor management experience, including ISP engagement (Verizon or similar is a&amp;nbsp;bonus)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;VIP and C-suite support experience, with the professionalism and discretion that&amp;nbsp;comes with it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;A genuine enthusiasm for being in the office and being a visible, go-to presence for&amp;nbsp;the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;COMPENSATION &amp;amp; PERKS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Full-time salary based on experience and meaningful equity in an industry-leading&amp;nbsp;company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Work from Anywhere Policy: up to 4 weeks to work remotely from abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Awesome office location in the heart of Dallas, with a mandatory four days per week in-person scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Unlimited vacation policy; work hard and take time when you need it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apple equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The opportunity to be a key player and build your career at a rapidly expanding,&amp;nbsp;global technology company in an emerging field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Flexible work culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Blockchain is committed to diversity and inclusion in the workplace and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We prohibit discrimination and harassment of any kind based on race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender expression, sex, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status or any other characteristic protected by law. This policy applies to all employment practices within our organization, including hiring, recruiting, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, leave of absence, and apprenticeship. Blockchain makes hiring decisions based solely on qualifications, merit, and business needs at the time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You may contact our Data Protection Officer by email at dpo@blockchain.com. Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller’s recruitment related activities, which include setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating and assessing the results thereto, and as is otherwise needed in the recruitment and hiring processes. Such processing is legally permissible under Art. 6(1)(f) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation) as necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the Controller, which are the solicitation, evaluation, and selection of applicants for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider located in the United States of America and engaged by Controller to help manage its recruitment and hiring process on Controller’s behalf.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, if you are located outside of the United States, your personal data will be transferred to the United States once you submit it through this site. Because the European Union Commission has determined that United States data privacy laws do not ensure an adequate level of protection for personal data collected from EU data subjects, the transfer will be subject to appropriate additional safeguards under the standard contractual clauses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Controller as long as Controller determines it is necessary to evaluate your application for employment.&amp;nbsp; Under the GDPR, you have the right to request access to your personal data, to request that your personal data be rectified or erased, and to request that processing of your personal data be restricted. You also have the right to data portability. In addition, you may lodge a complaint with an EU supervisory authority.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1cfzl5a:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies - from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups - use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Sales Development is a customer-facing team that connects prospective customers with Stripe. The AMER Sales Development org generates roughly 60% of Stripe&#39;s overall sales pipeline through a hybrid inbound and outbound motion, using a multi-touch, multi-method strategy that includes personalized email, LinkedIn outreach, video prospecting, and phone calls. The team covers every market segment, from startups to enterprise, and partners closely with Sales, Marketing, and Sales Development Systems to keep pipeline generation aligned with go-to-market priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is an operator-builder and change leader: redesigning AMER Sales Development for an AI-first future while raising the bar for human discovery, qualification, user engagement, pipeline progression, and seller handoffs. The leader will partner with AMER Sales, Marketing, Operations, and Sales Development Systems to turn automation capacity into higher-value commercial work and a healthier pipeline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Head of AMER Sales Development leads the Core AMER Sales Development team across inbound and outbound motions. This leader directly manages managers and owns qualified pipeline, SQOs, ONR contribution, and talent progression into the wider Sales organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the AMER Sales Development org through a team of sales development managers, who in turn manage the SDRs driving roughly 60% of Stripe&#39;s overall sales pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set segmentation and coverage strategy across startups, digital natives, commercial, and enterprise accounts, and direct how managers structure their teams to pursue the right leads and accounts for quality and volume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own outbound strategy for AMER, including target markets, account and contact prioritization, and multi-touch outreach across email, LinkedIn, video, and phone, and translate that strategy into direction for your managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with AMER sales leadership, Marketing, and Sales Development Systems to align pipeline targets, lead routing, and tooling (including agentic outreach and account intelligence systems) with go-to-market priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and coach sales development managers directly, building their people management and pipeline strategy skills, and build bench strength and succession plans across the AMER SDR org&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the org against opportunity count and cumulative revenue generation, reviewing manager-level performance and reallocating coverage or adjusting strategy where the data points to it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Sales Development in AMER sales leadership planning, bringing an operator&#39;s view of pipeline health, capacity, and org productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 10+ years of relevant commercial leadership experience in Sales, Sales Development, Revenue Operations, Enablement, lead qualification, or a related function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led leaders at scale and can demonstrate how you have developed managers, built a leadership bench, and delivered ambitious outcomes through a multi-layer organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep experience across inbound and outbound sales-development motions, including qualification, routing, handoff, conversion, pipeline quality, and commercial performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are AI-first in your approach to operating-model design: you can apply automation and agents pragmatically while protecting user experience, quality, and sound human judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a record of improving qualified pipeline, SQOs, conversion, progression, and revenue impact—not activity volume alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly analytical and can use funnel, capacity, and outcome data to diagnose problems, make trade-offs, and drive execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong cross-functional influence and know how to work with Sales, Marketing, Growth, Operations, and systems teams to create shared plans and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable leading through ambiguity, taking informed risks, and driving necessary change with clarity, urgency, and care for people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly, operate with high integrity, and take ownership for outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leader of leaders:&lt;/strong&gt; proven manager-of-managers leadership, including manager development, organizational design, and accountability through layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-first operating leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; ability to redesign roles, workflows, and capacity around agents and automation while protecting user experience, quality, and sound human judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-funnel ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; a record of improving qualified pipeline, SQOs, conversion, progression, and revenue outcomes—not activity volume alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; credibility with Sales and Marketing leaders, including source-mix planning, shared funnel accountability, and seller-handoff design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operating rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; strong data fluency, consistent management systems, weekly performance reviews, and the ability to separate scalable standards from appropriate experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent builder:&lt;/strong&gt; demonstrated ability to develop managers, SDR and internal candidates into future commercial leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder management:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;ability to navigate complex cross-functional relationships, build consensus with Sales and Marketing leadership, and maintain alignment across competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience leading AI-assisted sourcing or SDR-in-the-loop workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience with MEDDIC-style qualification, pipeline defibrillation, aging-pipeline recovery, or later-funnel commercial support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience developing internal AE talent into people leaders or Sales Development managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Deep familiarity with AMER segment design, field-sales coverage, vendor operations, or commercial-systems partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AMER Sales Development is entering a period of meaningful change. AI-assisted sourcing can free capacity for stronger user conversations, better qualification, and deeper progression support—but only if the operating model, manager expectations, and partner relationships evolve with it. This leader will set that direction, build the organisation to execute it, and create a stronger commercial engine and talent pipeline for Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;

job-0fdllyw:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;JaOCdKtFxoBxsyxWhJEuo6zAsKg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FqWpd9viEoczqgxr13Iu2ys0sId&quot;&gt;We are looking for a highly capable Compliance Audit Manager to support the delivery of internal audit coverage over regulatory compliance topics across Bybit Group. The role will assist in planning and executing risk-based audits, evaluating the effectiveness of controls, and contributing to the enhancement of Bybit’s compliance framework across multiple jurisdictions. This position works closely with the Compliance Audit Director and broader Internal Audit team, providing high-quality audit execution, data-driven insights, and practical recommendations to strengthen governance and controls.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R6n2dNe6do1nuVxBLUhuLvFksvc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XmWad5dwNoZfIOx8452ugdYLslh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Planning &amp;amp; Preparation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WCM3diSfqolBchxz4Y7uLuXEs5g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conduct preliminary research and regulatory scanning to understand emerging risks, compliance obligations, and jurisdictional differences affecting Bybit.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LoCrdnnLyormzyxDYz3uJX4ys6f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Participate in walkthroughs with Compliance, AML, Legal, Operations, and other stakeholders to understand processes, risks, and controls.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BP5SdKrQ0oVhe5xh1huuHu2QsEe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GHHHdpROXo9amnx9x0luJLxhsoc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Perform end-to-end compliance and AML/CTF audits, including control design assessment, operating effectiveness testing, and documentation of audit evidence.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsXHdE9MOowiWdxq2RaunujYsId&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Execute testing in accordance with Internal Audit methodology, ensuring high-quality workpapers, clear rationale, and traceability of results.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZFXMd2F5ToEOShxocGJuzEv1sUc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Draft audit issues, root-cause analysis, and practical remediation recommendations based on observed gaps and regulatory expectations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
