&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A6kNdcYgyoyXRbxXHYSllt8Zgmg&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AMrmd5tJ6o323UxZ08flctzRgQd&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AMrmd5tJ6o323UxZ08flctzRgQd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zz7PdmckxoAOEDxntX4lj8r3gEd&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V8nBdDg4PoNMuvxhA81lq7usgJb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SZxIdVy8robRUzxrRSLl2yLSgue&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V3BJdxkFtotJxvx0wdLl1Az9gsh&quot;&gt;We are looking for a dedicated and proactive Business Development Manager to join our team, specifically focused on high-volume Affiliates, Trading Communities and KOLs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UiIzd7nVAoGcL6xdnZTlT9eqgKf&quot;&gt;As a Business Development Manager, you will play a key role in expanding our network of Affiliates (Key Opinion Leaders, Trading Communities, Traffic Websites), and (secondarily) VIP clients - in Germany and the broader Central part of the European Union. This role is responsible for those partnerships from a to z.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WKrPd1MAPoYOD8x8yzclRkrogke&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
