&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGYRdbt52oUGPoxI4B8l2H4Hgmh&quot;&gt;The salary range for this position is $250,444 to $375,666.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WHv3dG5ZFo5tLXxfLETl8K8wg9f&quot;&gt;The salary offered depends on a variety of factors, including job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and market location. In addition to the salary, a performance bonus and long-term incentives may be provided as part of the compensation package, as well as a full range of medical, financial, and/or other benefits, dependent on the position offered. Applicants should apply via OKX internal or external careers site.&lt;/div&gt;
