&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JGBIdZIIlojZf6xqzvWl0wYOgsI&quot;&gt;The Workplace IT Specialist ensures a reliable, secure, and high-quality workplace technology experience for employees across our EEA-region offices. Based in our Malta office, this role is the primary owner of local office IT and workplace facilities, and the first-line point of contact for EEA-region user support. The role also provides remote backup and support for other EEA offices as needed, and works as part of our Global IT team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HcP7dWM9PoVzaKx1XnrlNqzOgqh&quot;&gt;Second-line support for SaaS platforms and network infrastructure is handled by the broader Global IT team; this role focuses on delivering first-line support and knowing when to escalate. The ideal candidate is customer-focused, technically curious, works well independently, and looks for ways to improve day-to-day IT operations through automation and process improvements.&lt;/div&gt;
