&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tk5JdB9BLoCfGkxnlk1l5ZFVgAe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AF70dpUcYoBfZDxsdwWlrcEigqg&quot;&gt;OKX is looking for a Senior Director of AI to lead both people and product — building and managing a high-calibre AI team while staying deeply involved in the design, evaluation, and production deployment of autonomous agent systems. This role calls for a leader who leads by doing: technically grounded, sharp on product judgment, and able to translate both into tangible business outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YyaadOegXomiQLx2QgkleXV0gCb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UgzLdl2PGorE2Txawk9l0xhcgEg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; — Build, manage, and develop a team of AI engineers and researchers; own hiring, growth, and performance across the function&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JSNadiNddoUq5ExSgUWl6MpBggf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent Product Delivery&lt;/strong&gt; — Lead end-to-end delivery of autonomous AI Agent products, covering the full lifecycle from requirements and architecture through to production operations&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jmved7GIQoBNZgxBRrflWZibgDh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eval-Driven Development&lt;/strong&gt; — Establish benchmark-driven evaluation frameworks that replace manual iteration with quantifiable quality signals across agent systems&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XfdBd1bccovLWsxdecdlIRaHg4b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent Harness Design&lt;/strong&gt; — Design and implement end-to-end Agent Harness infrastructure to ensure agent stability and reliability in complex, real-world scenarios&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LNTgd1paoofBFax4JCAlb4DdgVf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt; — Orchestrate creative reasoning steps alongside deterministic guardrails, finding the right balance between flexibility and control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KFJGdOjbZovw0QxDW1qlhMoGgwC&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Workflow Integration&lt;/strong&gt; — Embed AI Agent capabilities deeply into core products and engineering pipelines, improving both developer productivity and business value&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MWNYdha4GoyTGCxAF2AlRVs7gyf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Alignment&lt;/strong&gt; — Collaborate with product, engineering, and business teams to ensure technical direction stays tightly aligned with strategic priorities&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W2ORdsNk0oNDEHxo3NPlE3vkg6c&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Rb0odmHvToPTiFxtwU2lzDH9g6e&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HbZQd8Pw1oxOGmxQgTblLh9mgdc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BiFUdDJzbozK8GxehMnl08N3ggg&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XQ8odtCProp9SPxyckYl2y3MgIb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-DsFUdfE3LoyAW0xvnGHlVVoEgvg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YOiddp5v1on57ux5kaxlCxZlgOh&quot;&gt;The trading services team provides core order and position management systems, manual, automatic, social, and broker trading products of full spectrum of products (spot, margin, futures, options, perpetures, etc.) for the exchange. It is the backbone of our industry-leading trading product used by millions of users.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XVrpdQIhCoGo6QxwREMlD6J4gke&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Xl72dXcVooQh4axn8wrlAW33gmf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2lZdF9JnoaGp8x7cJwlXDHEg3g&quot;&gt;Design and implement innovative solutions for our full range of trading products including spot, future, perpetual swap and options&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YhlHdTv1Dognawx7WbYlvGlWgVc&quot;&gt;Build out industry-leading risk management platform&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cd0sdiSTmoe3RPxRzy0lLDmNgOg&quot;&gt;Build out automated trading strategies&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RlBNdEeAMoVig2xCVA7l3YAPgzc&quot;&gt;Performance, stability optimization for overall trading architecture aiming for low latency, high availability and scalability&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GLcVdAbC4ohb0nxyu8slBCGUgbc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-W4m7dROEJoWDiIxMf3rlzZf2g2e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Addkdmll8oCUdExCveVlOBwRgRe&quot;&gt;Solid STEM (Science/Technology/Engineering/Mathematics) education background&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EzKvd8gJToUhEmx67hxld0E8gde&quot;&gt;Experienced in R&amp;amp;D and architecture of high-performance and low-latency systems, with good system optimization skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WmBodewsGo5M3jxks3BlcLHpgZe&quot;&gt;Familiar with distributed systems and microservice architecture&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TJcRdCOlYojyDQx6AL5lYgsJg3g&quot;&gt;Experience in practicing automated testing and continuous integration&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GrYUdtyExoODOcxu2H1lAQMQgFc&quot;&gt;Strong logical thinking and problem-solving skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGaSd4WavoChY1xeA3alYiYNgxg&quot;&gt;Good understanding of the crypto trading industry, able to participate in business decision-making and implementation, and able to make good technical planning to support business iteration and innovation efficiently.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoJfdpqfFoOEsZxvjf5lyGkHgOy&quot;&gt;Crypto trading, traditional trading core system, or big/complicated distributed system experience is a plus&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EpwPd4TpAoUI4Vx2ddslM3fjgEh&quot;&gt;Team management experience is a plus&lt;/div&gt;
