&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When you join Upstream Rehabilitation, you get the strength of a national network with the feel of a local clinic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our central support teams handle the administrative work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;so you can focus on what matters most — the patient in front of you. With a network of over 1,200 clinics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;coast-to-coast&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;across 26 brand partners, we lead the industry in quality outcomes,&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;data, technology, and innovation to reduce paperwork and give you more time for care.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You’ll&amp;nbsp;be part of a fantastic group of clinicians who shape our culture, create a positive work environment, and know how to have fun along the way.&amp;nbsp;It’s&amp;nbsp;easy to see why so many Physical Therapists choose to grow their careers with Upstream.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Estimated pay ranges listed above are based on several factors including but not limited to your pay class, experience,&amp;nbsp;background&amp;nbsp;and geographic location of the clinic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Upstream Rehabilitation is an Equal Opportunity Employer that strives to provide an inclusive work environment where our differences are celebrated for the value they bring to our communities, our patients and our teammates. Upstream Rehabilitation does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, national origin, religion, gender (including pregnancy), sexual orientation, age, disability, veteran status, or other status protected under applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-109r811:
&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe will succeed at our mission of increasing the GDP of the internet only if we preserve Stripe users’ trust. To achieve their trust, the team is building authorization infrastructure and a platform that ensures proper authorization for users and services. We enforce access controls and provide access observability and policy governance. We collaborate with teams across Stripe to adopt our authorization platform to protect their resources, especially Stripe users’ data.&amp;nbsp; Ultimately we ensure resources across Stripe are accessed securely and in compliance with policies, hence maintaining Stripe users’ trust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an engineer who is passionate about addressing tough problems in the authorization space. This role is critical, not only for Stripe, but for the future of the commercial internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reliable, performant and scalable authorization infrastructure (e.g. libraries, frameworks, services).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build comprehensive understanding of authorization needs of our users (e.g. product teams and infrastructure teams).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build comprehensive, easy-to-use, and policy driven authorization solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with our users to adopt our authorization solutions to protect their resources by providing a great user experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build access visibility and continuous policy governance to empower resource owners, legal and compliance to put risk of inappropriate access under control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-5 years of professional hands-on software development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience in the security domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has a curious and learning mindset, regardless of level or experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has empathy, strong communication skills and a deep respect for the power of collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works well cross-functionally and cross-team; and your co-workers at all levels trust you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives clear next steps when encountering ambiguous spaces without clear lines of ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks creatively and holistically when solving problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefers simple solutions and designs over complex ones, and have a good intuition for what is lasting and scalable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High standards for code quality and a constructive attitude to help others raise the bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the authorization domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Go, Java or Ruby&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-0f0t5pi:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grayscale is the largest digital asset-focused investment platform in the world by AUM and offers the broadest selection of digital asset investment products in the U.S. based on number of products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform spans the full spectrum of institutional-grade solutions—from single-asset exposures to diversified and thematic strategies—with a goal of providing every investor with access to the hyper-expanding digital asset universe. &amp;nbsp;Our firm offers a rare combination of decades of traditional finance work experience and digital asset leadership that brings an institutional mindset to the maturing digital asset industry. This convergence of capabilities positions us to deliver investment solutions and client experiences that are both institutionally robust and technologically advanced, which we believe offers a competitive edge that is difficult to replicate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud of our deep crypto expertise and work closely with individual and institutional investors as they explore this asset class as part of their portfolio allocation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1100&quot; data-end=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Grayscale Investments is seeking a Cybersecurity Engineer to build, implement, and maintain security capabilities across our technology platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1266&quot; data-end=&quot;1687&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for implementing security controls, automating security processes, and integrating security throughout the software development lifecycle across cloud infrastructure, enterprise applications, AI-enabled systems, and modern engineering platforms. This role is instrumental in ensuring Grayscale&#39;s technology environment remains secure, resilient, scalable, and aligned with regulatory expectations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1689&quot; data-end=&quot;1993&quot;&gt;Working closely with engineering, product, and compliance teams, you will help embed secure-by-design principles into technology solutions, strengthen cloud and application security, improve detection and monitoring capabilities, and support the secure adoption of emerging technologies across Grayscale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2016&quot; data-end=&quot;3782&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;q3nla8&quot; data-start=&quot;2016&quot; data-end=&quot;2205&quot;&gt;Partner with engineering teams to implement security controls and secure design patterns across cloud infrastructure, enterprise applications, developer platforms, and AI-enabled systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u8a3ka&quot; data-start=&quot;2206&quot; data-end=&quot;2395&quot;&gt;Build and operationalize security controls that protect sensitive data, including identity and access management, data protection, network security, logging, monitoring, and auditability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rga32q&quot; data-start=&quot;2396&quot; data-end=&quot;2599&quot;&gt;Participate in threat modeling, architecture reviews, and security assessments for applications, cloud platforms, and emerging technologies, identifying and mitigating security risks before deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bopubh&quot; data-start=&quot;2600&quot; data-end=&quot;2718&quot;&gt;Implement and maintain security controls for cloud platforms, APIs, developer tooling, and third-party technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7wwynw&quot; data-start=&quot;2719&quot; data-end=&quot;2857&quot;&gt;Build monitoring, detection, alerting, and incident response capabilities in partnership with engineering and security operations teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;n45y19&quot; data-start=&quot;2858&quot; data-end=&quot;3020&quot;&gt;Integrate security tooling and automation into CI/CD pipelines and cloud-native engineering workflows using Infrastructure-as-Code and policy-as-code practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;yld3nj&quot; data-start=&quot;3021&quot; data-end=&quot;3175&quot;&gt;Support secure software development by partnering with engineering teams to embed security throughout the Secure Software Development Lifecycle (SSDLC).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;4ehoyv&quot; data-start=&quot;3176&quot; data-end=&quot;3334&quot;&gt;Assess and mitigate technical and operational risks associated with cloud platforms, enterprise applications, AI-enabled systems, and third-party providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1cbaot2&quot; data-start=&quot;3335&quot; data-end=&quot;3480&quot;&gt;Partner with compliance, audit, and business stakeholders to ensure technology solutions meet regulatory, control, and governance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1milxek&quot; data-start=&quot;3481&quot; data-end=&quot;3625&quot;&gt;Contribute to the development of security standards, engineering patterns, automation, and operational best practices across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1l04ukj&quot; data-start=&quot;3626&quot; data-end=&quot;3782&quot;&gt;Stay current on emerging security threats, technologies, and industry best practices while helping strengthen Grayscale&#39;s long-term security capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3803&quot; data-end=&quot;5375&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ocig8b&quot; data-start=&quot;3803&quot; data-end=&quot;3953&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience in cybersecurity, security engineering, cloud security, application security, DevSecOps, or a related engineering discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;i28v6&quot; data-start=&quot;3954&quot; data-end=&quot;4047&quot;&gt;Experience implementing security controls within cloud-native environments, preferably AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xufavf&quot; data-start=&quot;4048&quot; data-end=&quot;4233&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of security fundamentals including identity and access management, data protection, network security, vulnerability management, monitoring, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dgpjhm&quot; data-start=&quot;4234&quot; data-end=&quot;4391&quot;&gt;Experience integrating security into software development workflows, including CI/CD pipelines and Secure Software Development Lifecycle (SSDLC) practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9hc1xg&quot; data-start=&quot;4392&quot; data-end=&quot;4550&quot;&gt;Strong programming and scripting capabilities (e.g., Python, Terraform, Infrastructure-as-Code) with the ability to automate and validate security controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jdgmox&quot; data-start=&quot;4551&quot; data-end=&quot;4646&quot;&gt;Experience with cloud infrastructure, Kubernetes, APIs, and modern application architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w85vyj&quot; data-start=&quot;4647&quot; data-end=&quot;4819&quot;&gt;Experience with security tooling such as SIEM/SOAR, vulnerability management, cloud security, endpoint security, application security, or detection engineering platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;45av02&quot; data-start=&quot;4820&quot; data-end=&quot;4952&quot;&gt;Experience conducting threat modeling, security assessments, and architecture reviews for modern applications and cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ttmihg&quot; data-start=&quot;4953&quot; data-end=&quot;5054&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AI/ML systems, including LLMs and AI-enabled application architectures, is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5s3n7a&quot; data-start=&quot;5055&quot; data-end=&quot;5198&quot;&gt;Experience operating in regulated environments with strong control, audit, and compliance requirements, preferably within financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wszysh&quot; data-start=&quot;5199&quot; data-end=&quot;5375&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to collaborate effectively across engineering, infrastructure, product, and security teams to solve complex technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1h92v4h:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners closely with business leaders to understand issues in the department and employee sentiment, providing HR guidance when appropriate, including but not limited to on/off boarding, performance, promotion, potential, disciplinary cases and employee disputes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides guidance and input on business unit restructures, workforce planning and succession planning;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages and resolves complex employee relations issues. Conducts effective, thorough and objective investigations;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executes and implements people policies to the business unit assigned;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintains in-depth working knowledge of legal manpower regulations, reducing legal risks and ensuring regulatory compliance. Partners with the legal department as needed/required;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifies training needs for business units and individual executive coaching needs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzes data trends and metrics in partnership with the HR COE teams to develop solutions, programs and policies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participates in evaluation and monitoring of people programs to ensure success;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performs other related duties as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as HRBP or Employee Relations role;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and customer service skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management skills with a proven ability to meet deadlines;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical critical thinking and problem-solving skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational skills and attention to detail;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to comprehend, interpret, and apply the appropriate sections of applicable laws, guidelines, regulations, ordinances, and policies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to acquire a thorough understanding of the organization&#39;s hierarchy, jobs, qualifications, compensation practices, and the administrative practices related to those factors;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;both Chinese and English&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1vkhc31:
&lt;p&gt;The North American SMB Sales team at Afterpay and Cash App is responsible for driving revenue to our core consumer payments businesses, giving our Merchant partners access to the largest and most engaged network of next generation consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a strategic, analytical, and experienced &lt;strong&gt;Head of SMB Sales&lt;/strong&gt; to build and scale a high-velocity, playbook-driven sales engine across a broad and growing base of small and medium-sized businesses, unlocking new revenue opportunities across our Buy Now Pay Later and Pay Now products. The SMB segment spans three motions: a BDR function that sources and books meetings for Account Executives, an Inbound motion serving our smaller, higher-volume businesses, and an Outbound-led motion focused on our larger, higher-growth SMB accounts. You will be responsible for orchestrating these motions into a single, cohesive system, and for the discipline, tooling, and processes that help generate pipeline and let the team convert and onboard merchants efficiently and at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate exhibits a strong sense of ownership to win new business for Afterpay and Cash App, and a demonstrated ability to navigate ambiguity; think strategically and operationally about business, marketing and technical challenges; and lead cross-functional workstreams ultimately tied to pipeline creation and conversion. This role requires a strategic problem solver who is a rigorous operator and an effective influencer, comfortable balancing data-driven rigor with a strong bias for action and hands-on execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond ultimately being responsible for revenue outcomes across our SMB merchant pipeline, spanning a broad range of industries across retail, fashion, beauty, travel, home and more in North America, you&#39;ll also be building and supporting a strong culture of performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has demonstrated excellence in building and operating high-velocity sales motions at scale, leading and managing high-performing teams, and a dedication to continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee the North American SMB Sales Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead a multi-motion team spanning BDR, Inbound, and Outbound Account Executives. Build and continuously refine the playbooks, processes, and tooling that let the team convert and grow merchants efficiently at high volume, moving with a bias for action and iterating quickly based on data. Craft a segment-wide strategy and hold the team accountable to delivering on OKRs and revenue targets across each motion, in concert with the broader Sales &amp;amp; Account Management function at Afterpay and Cash App.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build an A-Team: &lt;/strong&gt;You will inherit a team of strong performers with relevant experience. Further develop their skills, knowledge, efficacy, and an overall team culture focused on performance and betterment, including coaching frontline managers to drive results through their own teams. Set an energetic, accountable tone for the North America sales organization, rooted in a strong sense of ownership and led with empathy over ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Meaningful Cross-Functional Partnerships: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams to better support your team in generating revenue, including Marketing, Finance, Product, Risk, Legal, Account Management and more. You can influence without authority across teams and build the internal relationships required to navigate a distributed and matrixed set of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Sales Process and Methodology: &lt;/strong&gt;Build and refine a repeatable sales approach that covers the full deal lifecycle — from discovery and qualification through articulating value, negotiating, and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Forecasting Rigor and Pipeline Hygiene: &lt;/strong&gt;Implement best practices in forecasting accuracy and pipeline health, partnering closely with Finance and Sales Ops/Strategy to keep both sharp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define Ideal Customer Profile and Value Proposition: &lt;/strong&gt;Shape and sharpen our ideal customer profile, key use cases, and value proposition, and centralize and socialize the sales and growth narratives that resonate most with SMB Merchants to inform our broader B2B marketing and sales strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Voice of Afterpay and Cash App: &lt;/strong&gt;Represent the business to SMB Merchants as a thought-leader in the payments and Buy Now Pay Later landscape, and demonstrate Afterpay and Cash App&#39;s value as a growth driver for small and growing businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Voice of the Merchant: &lt;/strong&gt;Represent market feedback and sentiment internally, advocating for your clients while balancing against the needs and constraints of our business, by aggregating and delivering key insights across the organization in a structured, consistent, and proactive manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An obsession with our products and a motivation fueled by feeling the impact of your work as more consumers build financial wellness with Afterpay and Cash App.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in high-growth environments leading SMB Sales, BDR, or Account Management organizations, preferably in a fast-moving technology or financial services company, with experience operating at high volume and velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership skills with the ability to develop talent, motivate high-performing teams, and build strong cross-functional relationships, including a proven track record of coaching and managing frontline managers to results. You put your people in the best position to succeed, and your management style is tailored to each individual to maximize their performance and engagement at work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up or scaling sales organizations from scratch — hiring, onboarding, and developing talent across BDRs, AEs, and frontline managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build, operate, and continuously improve playbooks that scale across a large and growing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with Product and Marketing to drive conversion — improving self-serve sign-up, activation, and onboarding flows to convert more prospective merchants into active partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presence with senior internal leaders, with demonstrated ability to influence and earn trust, ask the right questions, and use sound business judgment across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated track record of leading teams that consistently drive revenue growth and exceed their revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with analytics and tools that support business performance measurement and management, particularly around forecasting, funnel, and pipeline conversion metrics at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative storytelling abilities, ability to seek out relevant, meaningful data and build business cases to inform partners on Afterpay and Cash App&#39;s value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A scrappy and humble mindset, where toggling between team lead and in-the-weeds work is business as usual. You&#39;re equally comfortable writing an annual plan as you are jumping into a pipeline review to unblock a rep. You get the job done and inspire others to do so as well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future. To find a location&#39;s zone designation, please refer to this&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot;&gt; resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All Zones: ($319,040 - $478,560)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amounts listed above include target variable compensation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-0oorkwl:
&lt;p&gt;The North American Mid-Market Sales team at Cash App is responsible for driving revenue to our core consumer payments businesses at Cash App and Afterpay, giving our Merchant partners access to the largest and most engaged network of next generation consumers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-energy, dynamic, and thoughtful &lt;strong&gt;Head of Mid-Market Sales &lt;/strong&gt;to&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;forge and expand relationships with fast-growing and established brands and unlock new revenue opportunities across our portfolio of Pay Now and Pay Later products. You will be on the front lines of a fast-growing payments business, partnering with executive leadership and senior stakeholders at high-growth and established mid-market companies. You will be responsible for sophisticated deal negotiation and execution with leaders in commerce while winning business at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate thrives in a challenging, fast-paced environment, has a passion for developing and expanding client relationships, and exhibits a strong sense of ownership to win new business for Cash App and Afterpay. You will have a demonstrated ability to navigate ambiguity; think strategically and operationally about business, marketing and technical challenges; and lead cross-functional workstreams to launch product and commercial initiatives. This role requires a strategic problem solver who is a relentless negotiator, effective influencer, and skilled at balancing high-touch relationship building with a scalable, process-driven sales motion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond ultimately being responsible for revenue outcomes across our Mid-Market merchant pipeline – which comprises high-growth and established consumer brands in North America across retail, fashion, beauty, travel, QSR, home and more – you will be responsible for building and supporting a strong culture of performance. You excel at developing others and leading with empathy but without ego.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate has demonstrated excellence in complex commercial negotiations at scale, leading and managing high performing teams and a dedication to continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oversee the North American Mid-Market Sales Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead a team of seasoned Mid-Market Account Executives. Coach the team to navigate sophisticated deal negotiations while winning business at scale. Support deal negotiations through internal and external advocacy, particularly by clearing blockers to revenue. Craft a segment-wide strategy and hold the team accountable to delivering on OKRs and executing against revenue targets, in concert with the broader Sales &amp;amp; Account Management function at Cash App and Afterpay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop Meaningful Cross-Functional Partnerships: &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams to better support your team in generating revenue, including Marketing, Finance, Product, Risk, Legal, Account Management and more. You can influence without authority across teams and build the internal relationships required to navigate a distributed and matrixed set of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build an A-Team: &lt;/strong&gt;You will inherit a team of strong performers with relevant experience. Further develop their skills, knowledge, efficacy and an overall team culture focused on performance and betterment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Voice of Cash App and Afterpay: &lt;/strong&gt;Represent the business to leading Mid-Market Merchants as a thought-leader in the payments landscape and demonstrate Cash App and Afterpay’s value as a growth driver for our commerce partners. Develop and grow Block’s relationships with merchant partners, including their leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft Deal Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: Develop and pitch powerful sales narratives that educate prospective merchants of Cash App and Afterpay’s value proposition. Effectively communicate with senior decision makers at high-growth and established brands across North America. Leverage insights, data and market intel to continuously improve our go-to-market strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Portfolio Strategy:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Leverage insights across your team’s portfolio to centralize &amp;amp; socialize the very best sales and growth narratives that resonate with Mid-Market Merchants and inform our B2B marketing and sales strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the Voice of the Merchant:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Represent market feedback and sentiment internally, advocating for your clients while balancing against the needs and constraints of our business, by aggregating and delivering key insights across the organization in a structured, consistent, and proactive manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An obsession with our products and a motivation fueled by feeling the impact of your work as more consumers build financial wellness with Cash App &amp;amp; Afterpay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years experience in high-growth environments leading Mid-Market Sales, or Mid-Market Account Management organizations, preferably in a fast-moving technology or financial services company and experience working with large-scale established clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience navigating and operating effectively within matrixed global organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated track record of leading teams that consistently drive revenue growth and exceed their revenue targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership skills with the ability to develop talent, motivate high-performing teams and build strong cross-functional relationships. You put your people in the best position to succeed and your management style is tailored to each individual to maximize their performance and engagement at work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high familiarity and comfort with how product development works, preferably in payments. You hold your own interfacing with stakeholders across disciplines (technical, marketing, product), and you have credibility with your internal product and engineering colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence, with demonstrated ability to influence and earn trust with senior leaders, ask the right questions, and use sound business judgment internally and externally at large companies, including at the C-suite level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An operational mindset as well as a strategic one - you can implement robust processes and lead teams through complex relationships as well as set a clear vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with analytics &amp;amp; tools that support business performance measurement &amp;amp; management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative storytelling abilities, able to seek out relevant, meaningful data and build business cases to inform partners on Cash App and Afterpay’s value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A scrappy and humble mindset, where toggling between team lead and in-the-weeds work is business as usual. You’re equally comfortable writing an annual plan as you are rolling up your sleeves to support one of your team members. You get the job done and inspire others to do so as well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A willingness to travel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future. To find a location&#39;s zone designation, please refer to this&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot;&gt; resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All Zones: ($319,000 - $478,600)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-0lgyty0:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;OQUBdWDwBoffxtxSKztugr24sQe&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusmECWnLczaL1wXNeVD4TRDd&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuszFx8OAzjFU6g48PeScgzwb&quot;&gt;We are seeking a senior MLRO &amp;amp; Compliance Officer to lead the compliance and financial crime function for our ADGM-licensed Recognised Investment Exchange (RIE) and Recognised Clearing House (RCH) entities. This combined role carries responsibility for both Compliance Officer and MLRO functions across market infrastructure entities, requiring deep expertise in exchange and clearing house regulation, market integrity, and financial crime obligations under the FSRA regime.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuskiNFNujssXi4K7oLKt9jYb&quot;&gt;This is a senior position, for an individual who can navigate the unique regulatory expectations of market infrastructure operators while building practical, scalable compliance frameworks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusz0NcRC1cbeDek1agKXAKIc&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxusquEPSelm5rX3JRm16ZZHAg&quot;&gt;Compliance Officer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus8fazVNZU7EgHF3c2uvOKMc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Responsible for the design, implementation, and oversight of the compliance function and monitoring of adherence to all FSRA Rules, FSMR, MIR, and other applicable regulations governing RIE and RCH operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusEZSBMaiFVx6Hj0tByzNRfc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develops and maintains compliance policies, procedures, and monitoring programmes specific to exchange and clearing house operations, including market surveillance, rulebook compliance, default management procedures, and participant conduct oversight.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusdCDn594eTO7djp8RiD8Jsd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provides independent compliance advice to the Board and senior management of both entities, and escalates material issues in accordance with governance frameworks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus5lzApm3hnZEMBJWLm85RPh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Conducts regular compliance reviews, testing, and gap analyses across both the RIE and RCH, ensuring controls are proportionate to the systemic risk profile of market infrastructure.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusGNOD6UyzbbhO5eZW2hU9gg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Liaises with the FSRA on all compliance matters relating to the RIE and RCH, and ensures timely and effective remediation of regulatory findings.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusqiw5Pd8bzWDPYpOpUWJJGb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Advises on new market products, trading rules, participant admission criteria, and clearing arrangements to ensure ongoing regulatory alignment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus45OIL4vHrapvbunKWtkGmg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partners with Legal, Risk, Technology, and Operations teams to embed compliance requirements across both entities&#39; operating models.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxusmCJUKhouifR4ka7wPufeYd&quot;&gt;MLRO&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus8ijewv9hCQzvLEOjdURw4d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Has overall responsibility for the implementation, oversight, and effectiveness of the AML/CFT/sanctions programme across the RIE and RCH in accordance with the FSRA AML Rulebook.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus6sxBX58Jhzjjp3gHQCIurb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Receives, investigates, and decides on internal suspicious activity reports (SARs/STRs), and files reports with relevant authorities including via goAML where applicable.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusMzXhzvb80AdGm0evH9DDRg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develops and maintains AML policies, risk assessments, CDD, EDD, and ongoing monitoring procedures tailored to the participant and transactional risk profile of a virtual asset exchange and clearing house.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusfGRqepMyFdwyGYlyuK81Gc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensures staff training and awareness programmes on AML/CFT are current, documented, and proportionate to the risk environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus3FUrn6eFzUBkBHWdfYSzYc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Acts as the key point of contact with the FSRA and other relevant authorities on financial crime matters, and provides regular AML reporting to the Board.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusjw248gJGl3xyqAbasSH09e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintains and periodically reviews the entity&#39;s Business Risk Assessment (BRA) and Customer Risk Assessment (CRA) frameworks in the context of market infrastructure operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusGFewrLt7q9Naqlj8EgX9bd&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusYdlV4mWzBxNqrZTYHGX2qe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;10+ years of significant senior compliance and/or financial crime experience within ADGM, DIFC, or other regulated financial services environments, with a preference for market infrastructure, exchange, or clearing experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusG8aahHlmAv2elVZ5CaJd6e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong working knowledge of FSRA Rules, FSMR, MIR, the ADGM AML Rulebook, and applicable sanctions frameworks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusUTVOt0H062JU2BFltt3fCb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Understanding of RIE and RCH regulatory obligations, including rulebook governance, participant oversight, default management, and systemic risk considerations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus4JN5YIhW8Tf20aEjVkwWqh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience supporting regulatory authorisations, recognition applications, or supervised entity setup.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxustEhhhu6uGO0iV6fQPUIxzb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience engaging with the FSRA or equivalent regulator on market infrastructure supervisory matters.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusbWPrqc489T9uHvWwH8gQXe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to manage compliance responsibilities across two distinct but related regulated entities within a unified framework.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuszNIYqofn1S1ORQHw4aRkHd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong judgement, stakeholder management, and decision-making capability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDiLdaJZ2o3FoXxBrpcu2DrSsqd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Demonstrated interest in, and practical adoption of, AI technologies to enhance compliance, regulatory, or operational effectiveness will be viewed very favourably.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusuL9IbgnqAyOhFlGMSg8grh&quot;&gt;Profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus7522Z7Rg6cM0flEzXorCyf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior MLRO / Compliance Officer or equivalent senior control function experience, ideally within a recognised exchange, clearing house, or market infrastructure operator.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusUmzlt3XclbCzci5oGViRgc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong UAE / ADGM regulatory credibility, with exposure to virtual asset market infrastructure, crypto exchanges, or traditional exchange/clearing environments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusKLus4kZcpbnnclaHDi3j8e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Practical, commercially minded operator with the ability to manage complexity across dual-entity structures.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusIdEEnbwEaiC854V9oiadxh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Approved Person or willingness to seek FSRA regulatory approval for the Compliance Officer and MLRO controlled functions across both entities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

