&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;14&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;- Lead the strategic development and scaling of digital asset custody solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;- Serve as the business owner of the custody product: from infrastructure choices to pricing models to market positioning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;19&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;- Partner with third-party custodians, sub-custodians, banks, and wallet providers to design and maintain asset flows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;- Collaborate with product and engineering teams to define feature needs (e.g., whitelisting, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;MPC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, token support, settlement models)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;22&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;23&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;- Define and implement client-facing workflows: onboarding, segregation, audit, and reporting- Support &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;BD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; in pitching custody solutions to institutional clients, including co-developing commercial proposals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;24&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;25&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;- Monitor evolving regulatory, technical, and compliance requirements related to digital asset custody- Oversee key custody metrics (e.g., &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;AUC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, transaction volume, SLAs) and drive reporting for internal and external stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;26&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;29&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;- Bachelor&#39;s degree in Math, Economics, Business, Engineering, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;Finance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
