&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;33&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;34&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;- Hands-on experience in crypto custody, blockchain operations, or digital asset servicing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;35&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;36&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;- Strong understanding of wallet technologies, custody solutions, blockchain transaction mechanics, and settlement infrastructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
