&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZQkFdBrRmoaWTvx6Ma3lpqdWgSd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven experience operating at Compliance Officer or Senior Compliance Officer level, with 5+ years&#39; experience in a compliance, legal or regulatory role within financial services, fintech or crypto industries&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WALUd6WLUoecnax0CuulI5BsgBg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
