&lt;div&gt;Sound understanding of the MFSA regulatory framework (or an equivalent ESMA-supervised NCA), MiFID II conduct-of-business requirements and EU financial services regulation&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HN1QdirNsoKR8SxjhcElSTlIgkN&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
