&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an HR Partner to support our team in New York in a broad range of strategic and operational responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your ability to pivot from strategic thinking to practical implementation and back will be critical. On a given day, you might serve as a resource for employees to resolve issues, hold long-term strategic discussions with leaders, coach new managers on employee relations issues, help design and improve our people processes (e.g., performance management), and dig into data.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As you work alongside other HR Partners to support colleagues, you will also be a key member of our global HR team. Our HR team is an extremely dedicated group of people across our New York, London, and Hong Kong offices who enjoy working collaboratively to keep Jane Street an excellent place to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lend your expertise to inform strategy on issues related to firm growth, performance feedback, career and leadership development. There will also be opportunities to collaborate on initiatives on a global scale and refine the role to meet the evolving needs of the firm over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jane Street is a challenging, dynamic place to work with smart and intellectually curious people. Our organizational structure is flat with few titles, and you will have the opportunity to adapt your deep experience in a broad array of human resources disciplines to our distinctive work culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a bachelor&#39;s degree and around 10 years of experience in HR, including 5+ years in an HR Business Partner role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mature and professional; you handle information with sensitivity and care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible team player who is comfortable both managing and doing the work yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive and approachable; you stay composed, prepared, and balanced in all interactions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong understanding of HR best practices; you may not have all the answers, but you know where to find them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can develop and articulate your own point of view (using personal insight and data) while also remaining open to other perspectives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken communicator; you choose words thoughtfully&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-15ss1t6:
&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Product&amp;nbsp; - Connect Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connect is Stripe’s platform for businesses that serve other businesses. It gives platforms the infrastructure to represent the people and companies in their ecosystem, onboard and verify them, manage their accounts, accept payments, and pay them out - without building payments, compliance, or financial-services systems themselves. This is how businesses like Shopify can help entrepreneurs run and grow their businesses. It is also the kind of infrastructure that marketplaces such as DoorDash need to coordinate money movement across large networks of restaurants, merchants, and dashers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connect has impact across industries. &lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/customers/shopify&quot;&gt;Shopify&lt;/a&gt; uses Stripe to embed financial services for merchants; &lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/customers/lugg&quot;&gt;Lugg&lt;/a&gt; streamlines worker onboarding and offers instant payouts; &lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/customers/doorloop&quot;&gt;DoorLoop&lt;/a&gt; reduces manual customer onboarding tasks by nearly 50% with Stripe; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://stripe.com/customers/sharetribe&quot;&gt;Sharetribe&lt;/a&gt; helps entrepreneurs launch and run marketplaces on Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is accelerating the emergence of entirely new business models: global networks of creators and experts, AI-native marketplaces, and agent-driven products that change how people discover, buy, sell, and deliver services. These businesses are more dynamic than traditional platforms: participants may operate across borders, take on different roles, and need new ways to establish trust, access financial capabilities, and get paid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Connect Abstractions team owns the platform primitives that make these models possible. We are building the foundational abstractions for representing participants, onboarding them safely, configuring their capabilities, and managing their lifecycle on Stripe. Our work will determine how quickly the next generation of platforms can launch, how flexibly they can evolve, and how much of Stripe they can bring to the businesses and people they serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a chance to define a foundational product area at Stripe. You will turn a fast-changing set of user and product needs into durable platform primitives that work across products, industries, and geographies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines high-leverage strategy with hands-on product execution. You will work through ambiguous, consequential questions like: what should a platform be able to model? What should be simple by default but flexible when needed? How can Stripe make complex financial infrastructure feel effortless for a platform and its users?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The outcome of your work will compound. The abstractions you help create will be reused across Connect and Stripe, shaping what new products platforms can build and how quickly they can bring them to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial Product Manager to build the platform experiences behind Connect&#39;s next generation of users. You will own critical product primitives that platforms, including the fastest-growing AI companies, use to onboard, configure, and manage their users on Stripe. You will turn a clear strategic direction into products that solve hard user problems today while creating a coherent, extensible foundation for business models that are still being invented.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for someone who enjoys the depth of platform work but is uncompromising about product craft and solving real user needs - both the ones users have today and will have in the future. The work is not building infra for its own sake; you will build capabilities that help our users launch a new marketplace, enable a global network to pay its contributors, or give a business entirely new ways for their end users to earn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring the next generation of Connect accounts to life. Own key product areas within the account platform, translating strategy into a focused roadmap, crisp product decisions, and high-quality launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build from use cases. Start with the real problems platforms face, such as onboarding a new seller, supporting a complex business model, or evolving a user&#39;s financial capabilities, and then work towards the primitives needed to solve them well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sophisticated infrastructure feel simple. Partner with engineering and design to create API and product experiences that are powerful and intuitive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See around corners. Develop a strong point of view on how AI will change platform economics, participant models, and financial workflows. Make focused foundational investments that unlock the next wave of demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn user signals into durable product investments. Work closely with users, Sales, Partnerships, and other Stripe teams to distinguish bespoke requests from patterns that should become scalable platform capabilities, connecting business needs, user needs, and platform evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive high-velocity, high-craft execution and own outcomes. Lead cross-functional work from discovery through launch, and hold yourself accountable for developer experience, platform adoption, user value, and business impact, not simply features shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a product builder who can move easily between a user’s hardest problem, the business opportunity behind it, and the product decisions needed to solve it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked on technically complex products - such as APIs, developer tools, shared platform capabilities, or core product experiences - but you do not build tech/platform for its own sake. You see strong platform design as a way to help users move faster, create better products, and unlock new business models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are opinionated, thoughtful, and execution-oriented. You can focus a team on the few decisions that matter most, create momentum in ambiguous situations, and ship products that raise the bar for both quality and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of product management experience, with meaningful time owning platform, API, or developer-facing products end to end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to own a product area end to end: setting strategy, driving execution, and measuring outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical instincts and comfort defining the measurement framework before you ship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication and the ability to build alignment across functions and levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in payments, fintech, or financial infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience productizing bespoke or custom solutions into broadly available platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of making well-judged foundational investments ahead of user demand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-0wjameq:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Business, Crypto Exchanges, you will own the strategy, growth, and operational performance of Alpaca&#39;s global crypto exchange business. You&#39;ll lead expansion across our B2C and B2B2C offerings, drive licensing, product, and commercial initiatives, and partner cross-functionally to build a scalable, compliant, and market-leading platform. This is a fully remote role with global collaboration across teams and time zones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Exchange entities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow our spot crypto business, including B2C crypto trading and B2B2C Crypto-as-a-Service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute license strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a flawless compliance record&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee audits, both financial and regulatory, while our finance and compliance teams handle the details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Product&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect and decide what new features to add to make our crypto offering competitive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add more coins, more chains, more licenses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the UI/UX for the direct consumer business (Trading API)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution for B2B prospects (Broker API)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Operational tooling&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push internal operational tooling improvements to scale:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 global multi-currency banking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stablecoin on/off-ramp&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal market making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crypto reconciliation and rebalancing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Vendors&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage critical contracts with key vendors including Fireblocks, Notabene, and Chainalysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine better strategies for switching vendors where strategically advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Growth and commercial&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design growth initiatives to gain new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get on prospecting calls to pitch new business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run solutioning calls to design compliant integrations during presales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build out go-to-market materials and training programs to scale this&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross-functional and reporting&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and direct initiatives across ops, compliance, finance, sales, and marketing, and support those teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage upwards by building visibility into business performance via dashboards and AI status reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring (Required Qualifications):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in crypto exchanges, brokerages, or regulated trading venues, with at least 3 years owning a business line rather than a function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with VASP, MSB, or equivalent licensing regimes, including regulatory examinations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of exchange mechanics: order books, matching, market making, margin systems, liquidations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on understanding of crypto operations: custody architecture, hot and cold wallet policy, reconciliation, treasury rebalancing, on-chain settlement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling and solutioning B2B infrastructure to institutional counterparties, including technical integration conversations without an engineer present&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record managing vendor contracts at commercial scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across CET and ET time zones daily&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bonus Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work at a licensed broker-dealer, FCM, or clearing entity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with tokenized securities, stablecoin rails, or on-chain settlement infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience standing up a licensed entity in a new jurisdiction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with Fireblocks, Notabene, Chainalysis, or comparable tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in banking operations or payments in a multi-currency environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://files.alpaca.markets/disclosures/AlpacaRecruitmentPrivacyPolicy.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1ifamfk:
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;N1IVd9JTGoMUpdxEl6cleo88gqf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgzCItBnNgRmiyVsUKAZlEic&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgO1BKPa5yd15VdDPHABDlFg&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg3RHTwYYTNbT8m3Fs7cjiKc&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgFjR4JB8yJxRPK8qW3Q2Ovb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgEsnhurv4g6O75ClsC9CDSz&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgiw8JHw3Wf4PMK7Z3os2KWc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgtmcJKCwQeLdbVl847BVvId&quot;&gt;We are looking for a dedicated and proactive Senior Business Development Manager to join our team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgxdP0L1mZidFQvRUwEZZpJu&quot;&gt;As a Business Development Manager, you will play a key role in expanding our network of Key Opinion Leaders (KOLs) and affiliates in Poland. This role is responsible for those partnerships from a to z.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgZm34iCw32eIhmJnDxKCsIh&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgHLNrd3guGqUYzOoXGVr1fe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgd7Tmz8vHz3zdlrSdhzFqlb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrate extensive knowledge of the trading and crypto industries, including market trends, regulations, and key players, to make informed business decisions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgWMhu875VGJ1x80PXN5zSaf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affiliate Recruitment:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively search for and attract new affiliates, VIP traders and trading/crypto communities and influencers, fostering strategic partnerships to enhance our network.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgjv2RIs8TAQPO76oByp60Ih&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results-Driven Approach: &lt;/strong&gt;Implement strategies and campaigns to drive measurable results, focusing on creating content, increasing trading volume, acquiring new users, and promoting active transactions through affiliate channels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg014RizrEr3bEdwFMS2jvTh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate and maintain strong business relationships with VIP and affiliates, ensuring their needs are met and aligning their strategies with our business objectives for mutual growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgVxKfT9xJokakJ1Pj5vQcwd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership Expansion: &lt;/strong&gt;Initiate and participate in meetings with partners, exploring opportunities to expand cooperation and strengthen existing relationships, both locally and internationally.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg19K0W9I04hD9UdISN3KQHf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration with Product Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate closely with colleagues from the product department, providing valuable market insights to optimize product offerings and attract qualified users.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgxjd3MO1dxcB1zkKntsrXl8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitor Analysis: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay updated on competitors&#39; advantages and industry trends, utilizing this knowledge to refine our strategies, maintain a competitive edge, and capitalize on market gaps.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgTkMuN4lhMd82Mggn0si6Pc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgEzX6JisJwC0muqwQ5VugWh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HxSNdNcbpo7VPNxnx6NlOQ1ngAf&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Marketing, Analytics, or a related field (or equivalent years of experience)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdmndShUIoRXjAxRUotl0BqQgNg&quot;&gt;Fluency in English and Polish&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZFO7dEO6uotwLKxTRBhlnynNgmd&quot;&gt;Proven experience in affiliate operations, performance marketing, or BD within crypto, finance, or trading - especially in Poland&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TzK6dNABLoWAa8xir9RladdUgQc&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills, with hands-on experience using data/BI tools (e.g. Excel, SQL, Tableau/Looker or&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TCswdlZyno87jGxb4NClkU03gyd&quot;&gt;similar) to driving decisions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EprjdcWO4oys7px1VZilgEOVgJe&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of affiliate marketing operations: tracking, attribution, campaign management&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XVOmdOBM2oIJY6xIPbklGdaZg3b&quot;&gt;Highly organized, process-oriented, and comfortable owning operational details end-to-end&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GYD6dsqoUo7sW6x9IwplFGWagnf&quot;&gt;Goal-oriented mindset, with a focus on measurable results and continuous optimization&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VpEJdTnvNoLDa8xwNHploxWVgFf&quot;&gt;Understanding of financial market dynamics and regulations relevant to the Polish/Eastern European region&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgepbxsumJvtKlqdi8PJjmUg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlguRe32YxSxZcYH220ANAzXb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgMLxInMA7sbsNkELl6GfRN7&quot;&gt;Experience working across time zones and cross-cultural teams&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgtpnRjMyY7EP9SN4Sy7slYM&quot;&gt;Bonus points if you have previously worked at a crypto exchange, trading company, CFD broker!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlguyLWeS39bBIkRC7pq0p1cg&quot;&gt;Passionate about blockchain technology and the crypto trading space&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgzkhDeVNtoet94bHmcAXaie&quot;&gt;Knowledge of other Eastern European languages is a strong plus&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxlgPUMXgzMlWXnyecXBPV7AMb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgCKJKQu6Tw3xcHHkBq8ERLf&quot;&gt;Competitive total compensation package&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgG4HutUOUgyuV0siHeLWfWf&quot;&gt;L&amp;amp;D programs and Education subsidy for employees&#39; growth and development&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg3jOXtPWxKVxa6OrSZLdyNb&quot;&gt;Various team building programs and company events&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgmIkgc2gmxvEFkYA38Eaiah&quot;&gt;More that we love to tell you along the process!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Notice:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
