&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KH1Ud8VMSoXfiox9aDOlHTUqg1b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TkuhdzsUHop1Hjx4F6rl3A3igce&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HQACdwWjPoaLU6xU8oslhURQgSd&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfqndDD34oilMCxhCmLl6UCvgvg&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Fy17dMTdno5NS4x36LTlCBs6gZf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DMMHd83mqo847RxiPpolFd47g7c&quot;&gt;We are looking for a dedicated and proactive Business Development Manager to join our team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jsp8drDOwoZYstxHo9PlLOhGg0L&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QVDYdNU45oJSUMx2oOelC6slgFc&quot;&gt;As a Business Development Manager, you will play a key role in expanding our network of Key Opinion Leaders (KOLs) and affiliates in Czechia &amp;amp; Slovakia. This role is responsible for those partnerships from a to z.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUyudywBgoFE7zxf1KClbZLgg0d&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QHPydPf77oR05AxKV9olBUUxgVf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-To2LddON7oYb4rxsrIolY0AIgHe&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expert Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrate extensive knowledge of the trading and crypto industries, including market trends, regulations, and key players, to make informed business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affiliate Recruitment:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively search for and attract new affiliates, VIP traders and trading/crypto communities and influencers, fostering strategic partnerships to enhance our network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results-Driven Approach:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Implement strategies and campaigns to drive measurable results, focusing on creating content, increasing trading volume, acquiring new users, and promoting active transactions through affiliate channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate and maintain strong business relationships with VIP and affiliates, ensuring their needs are met and aligning their strategies with our business objectives for mutual growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership Expansion:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Initiate and participate in meetings with partners, exploring opportunities to expand cooperation and strengthen existing relationships, both locally and internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration with Product Team:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate closely with colleagues from the product department, providing valuable market insights to optimize product offerings and attract qualified users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitor Analysis:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Stay updated on competitors&#39; advantages and industry trends, utilizing this knowledge to refine our strategies, maintain a competitive edge, and capitalize on market gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-IydRdcMokoAujvxRAD5lMHQjg7b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gwu3df560oGSx8xUrjklIoqbgRg&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Marketing, or a related field (or equivalent years of experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and Czech;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in affiliate development within the crypto, finance or trading industry, especially in Czechia &amp;amp; Slovakia&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and ability to interpret market data to drive strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and negotiation abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goal-oriented mindset, with a focus on achieving and exceeding targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth understanding of financial market dynamics and regulations in the Eastern European region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Fl8vdv5SaonEEuxJl4RlceozgVf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YkN8dw09FopACUxNEkKlE23xgmf&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across time zones and cross-cultural teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points if you have previously worked at a crypto exchange, trading company, CFD broker!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about blockchain technology and the crypto trading space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of other Eastern European languages is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OGkAdK1m8o9XN0xviPIlOiFIgfb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I05Ddjg0Xo67ggxWk0klSae0ghc&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive total compensation package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&amp;amp;D programs and Education subsidy for employees&#39; growth and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various team building programs and company events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More that we love to tell you along the process!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
