&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;22&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;23&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;24&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;25&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;We are looking for a senior leader to head our newly formed Trading Risk team. This is a critical leadership role created as part of a strategic reorganization to consolidate all business-risk-related functions across our trading verticals into a single, dedicated team. The Head of Trading Risk will own end-to-end business risk operations and logic design across multiple product lines, reporting directly to senior leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
