&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfqndDD34oilMCxhCmLl6UCvgvg&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Fy17dMTdno5NS4x36LTlCBs6gZf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DMMHd83mqo847RxiPpolFd47g7c&quot;&gt;We are looking for a dedicated and proactive Senior Business Development Manager to join our team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jsp8drDOwoZYstxHo9PlLOhGg0L&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
