&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affiliate Recruitment:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively search for and attract new affiliates, VIP traders and trading/crypto communities and influencers, fostering strategic partnerships to enhance our network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results-Driven Approach:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Implement strategies and campaigns to drive measurable results, focusing on creating content, increasing trading volume, acquiring new users, and promoting active transactions through affiliate channels.&lt;/li&gt;
