&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnership Expansion:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Initiate and participate in meetings with partners, exploring opportunities to expand cooperation and strengthen existing relationships, both locally and internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration with Product Team:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate closely with colleagues from the product department, providing valuable market insights to optimize product offerings and attract qualified users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitor Analysis:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Stay updated on competitors&#39; advantages and industry trends, utilizing this knowledge to refine our strategies, maintain a competitive edge, and capitalize on market gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
