&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H3bBdpbxToYBOSxXdoil0VJagMS&quot;&gt;Own the account backbone of a CeFi platform trusted by &lt;strong&gt;millions&lt;/strong&gt; — login, registration, account security, MFA, Passkey — where a single security regression is measured in real user funds. The more senior you are, the more you set the technical direction others build on.&lt;/div&gt;
