&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;DvE5dj59eo7oh0xN37Alj9MpgUP&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tk5JdB9BLoCfGkxnlk1l5ZFVgAe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AF70dpUcYoBfZDxsdwWlrcEigqg&quot;&gt;OKX is looking for a Senior Director of AI to lead both people and product — building and managing a high-calibre AI team while staying deeply involved in the design, evaluation, and production deployment of autonomous agent systems. This role calls for a leader who leads by doing: technically grounded, sharp on product judgment, and able to translate both into tangible business outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YyaadOegXomiQLx2QgkleXV0gCb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UgzLdl2PGorE2Txawk9l0xhcgEg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; — Build, manage, and develop a team of AI engineers and researchers; own hiring, growth, and performance across the function&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JSNadiNddoUq5ExSgUWl6MpBggf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent Product Delivery&lt;/strong&gt; — Lead end-to-end delivery of autonomous AI Agent products, covering the full lifecycle from requirements and architecture through to production operations&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jmved7GIQoBNZgxBRrflWZibgDh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eval-Driven Development&lt;/strong&gt; — Establish benchmark-driven evaluation frameworks that replace manual iteration with quantifiable quality signals across agent systems&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XfdBd1bccovLWsxdecdlIRaHg4b&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent Harness Design&lt;/strong&gt; — Design and implement end-to-end Agent Harness infrastructure to ensure agent stability and reliability in complex, real-world scenarios&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LNTgd1paoofBFax4JCAlb4DdgVf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LLM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Orchestration&lt;/strong&gt; — Orchestrate creative reasoning steps alongside deterministic guardrails, finding the right balance between flexibility and control&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KFJGdOjbZovw0QxDW1qlhMoGgwC&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
