job-0yjtvr3:
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-FFAodAfWIos8Aix4qsTlwXrtgfb&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R7kbdRMikoWhEnxfvErlsqVrghc&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-UnSWdl2O5okRuWxVZbTlz3RPgDd&quot;&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-UnSWdl2O5okRuWxVZbTlz3RPgDd&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Core product role within the Advanced Trading PM team. Own advanced trading product lines and trading features for our onshore compliant markets(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;EEA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;,US,SG,UAE and etc) — from strategy and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;PRD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; to launch and iteration — while keeping our product mechanics competitive with leading CEXs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;16&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;20&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Product Ownership:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the roadmap and delivery for assigned advanced trading product areas: account/margin model, order lifecycle, position management, market data surfaces, and trading UI on Web and App.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear PRDs and user stories; drive designs through review,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;UAT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, launch, and post-launch iteration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics and run continuous improvement loops on trading experience, liquidity quality, and risk outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;31&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Competitive &amp;amp; Market Insight:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously benchmark against leading CEXs (Binance, Bybit, Coinbase, Kraken, Bitget, etc.) — deconstruct product mechanisms, fee/liquidity models,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;UX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, and new launches.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track TradFi derivatives and onshore compliant-market developments; surface actionable opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;41&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Trading Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve speed-to-trade, order tickets, Kline/charting, and active-trader retention features on Web and App.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with design and engineering to ship polished, high-performance trading surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;49&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;50&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Liquidity, Execution &amp;amp; Risk:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to liquidity parameters, fee tier design, and execution-quality tracking (spread, depth, slippage, fill-rate) under senior guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support risk framework work: price limits, funding rate, index/mark price logic, leverage &amp;amp; position tiers — translating requirements into product specs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;58&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;59&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Compliant-Market Delivery:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with compliance, legal, and local entity leads to deliver product changes for licensed jurisdictions (SG, EU/&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;MiCA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, HK, US, BR, AU, UAE).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate regulatory requirements into product specs without over-degrading UX.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Execution:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner day-to-day with engineering, quant/risk, design,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;ops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, BD, and institutional client teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate progress, risks, and tradeoffs clearly to the team lead and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;31&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;81&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with at least 3+ years on crypto trading products (derivatives strongly preferred).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;83&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Solid working knowledge of CEX product mechanisms: perpetuals/futures/options, margin models, funding rates, index/mark price, liquidation, order types, market microstructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;85&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience shipping trading features on Web and/or App at a top-tier CEX or comparable trading platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
