&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://files.alpaca.markets/disclosures/AlpacaRecruitmentPrivacyPolicy.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1d2x2mj:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;As a SAM Compliance Lead Analyst on the CX Compliance team, you&#39;ll investigate AML and fraud-related transaction activity on the blockchain to protect Coinbase customers and maintain regulatory compliance. This team is responsible for executing Coinbase&#39;s AML compliance programs, including transaction monitoring, suspicious activity reporting, and investigative due diligence across our global operations. You&#39;ll own end-to-end case investigations, from alert triage through SAR filing, and ensure the quality and consistency of compliance outputs in our Luxembourg operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate AML and fraud-related alerts from transaction monitoring systems, law enforcement referrals, and internal business lines, analyzing blockchain activity and KYC information to assess risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document investigative findings in clear written narratives and determine whether activity warrants escalation or Suspicious Activity Report (SAR) filing in accordance with regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute due diligence research and analysis in support of Coinbase&#39;s AML compliance policies, applying BSA/AML, KYC, and OFAC regulatory standards to every case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain detailed case documentation demonstrating compliance with applicable regulations, internal policies, and procedures across the Luxembourg entity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry developments in AML, KYC, and sanctions compliance, applying evolving regulatory requirements and best practices to investigative workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in AML/fraud compliance operations, including conducting investigations, writing SARs, and managing case workflows in a regulated financial services or fintech environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to analyze blockchain transaction activity and apply KYC, BSA/AML, and OFAC regulatory frameworks to investigative casework.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with compliance and productivity tools such as Google Workspace, JIRA, Hummingbird, and Salesforce Service Cloud, with demonstrated ability to manage detailed documentation across high case volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with blockchain analysis tools (e.g., Chainalysis) and professional certification in AML or fraud (e.g., CAMS, CFCS, CFE) preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt; The target annual &lt;strong&gt;base&lt;/strong&gt; salary for this position can range as detailed below. Total compensation may&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;also include equity and bonus eligibility and benefits (including medical, dental, and vision).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€95.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€95.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1hp927k:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Physical Security Operational Risk Manager to help us scale our global physical security program. This position sits within our Physical Security team in New York.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work at the intersection of security operations, global security standards, public-sector partnerships, and crisis response—identifying and reducing physical security risk, turning regional security practices into consistent global standards, and sharpening how we respond to incidents across regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It&#39;s a hands-on role suited to someone with a background in corporate security, public safety, intelligence, emergency management, law enforcement, the military, or critical infrastructure who moves comfortably between risk strategy, execution, and incident response.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional responsibilities of the role will include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with regional security leads and the broader global Physical Security team to identify, assess, and prioritize physical security risks across all Jane Street locations and Streeters; coordinating mitigation efforts from planning through execution; and providing leadership with visibility into risks, blockers, timelines, and resource needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with the global Physical Security team to develop and maintain global operating standards (e.g., PSOC procedures, access control, incident response, guard force expectations, emergency procedures, escalation paths), agreeing on shared metrics for operational performance, running quality assurance and post-incident reviews together, and partnering with regional leads to close gaps between regional and global practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating with regional teams to build and strengthen relationships with law enforcement, emergency services, and government agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping manage the firm’s operational relationship with security risk/emergency providers alongside the global team; keeping escalation paths, service levels, and contact trees tested; planning with regional security leads for civil unrest, natural disasters, workplace-violence threats, and medical and travel emergencies; and running tabletop exercises and after-action reviews together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating with our global and regional security teams during incidents and aligning our response, communications, documentation, and follow-up; maintaining shared escalation and notification protocols; and contributing concise incident summaries, trend analysis, and leadership updates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our firm grows, your leadership will be crucial in shaping the security systems that protect our global operations and meet the highest standards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 10+ years of professional experience in corporate security, law enforcement, military, emergency management, intelligence, public safety, critical infrastructure, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A motivated self-starter who can handle competing priorities and is comfortable making an immediate impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural team leader who collaborates with colleagues across several departments and geographic regions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a track record assessing and reducing physical security risk, and building operating procedures and standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have established experience working with law enforcement, emergency services, or intelligence partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with GSOC/PSOC operations, guard force management, access control, CCTV, visitor management, and emergency response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show sound judgment under pressure and calm coordination in fast-moving, ambiguous situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to travel globally, potentially up to 25% of the time, on short notice, and support incidents outside business hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-0k8lncy:
&lt;p&gt;Flow Traders is looking for entrepreneurial, competitive, and analytical students to join our New York Trading team as a Trading Intern for Summer 2027. Spend your summer experiencing what it’s like to be a Trader in the financial capital of the world!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The trading internship will take place over nine weeks in our New York office, beginning in early June through early August. During the program, you will have the opportunity to explore your interest in trading, while being fully immersed in the excitement on our Trading floor. As an intern, you will get a 360-degree view of Flow Traders’ role in the financial markets, how our Traders seize arbitrage opportunities, and how they work together as a team to optimize and improve their desk. Together with your intern class, you will solve problems, participate in trading simulations, and work on trading projects with our traders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;No prior experience is required. We’re looking for individuals who are passionate about trading and eager to learn how to apply their quantitative skills in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn directly from industry leaders on the New York trading floor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in structured educational courses and hands-on trading simulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and test trading strategies through project-based work using quantitative models and trading tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Traders and Quantitative Researchers to solve real-world trading challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain in-depth exposure to Flow Traders’ core business and market-making activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in intern events and become an integral part of our collaborative “One Team” culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Need to Succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidate for a Bachelor’s degree studying in the United States with a major in Finance, Science, Technology, Engineering, Mathematics, Statistics, Computer Science, Economics or related&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Class of 2028, preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable interest in trading and global financial markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent mental math, quantitative and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Excel and an affinity for scientific programming or development languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to think on your feet, reason logically and deliver under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovative and creative with an entrepreneurial and competitive mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attracted to a fast-paced, team-oriented work environment that offers great challenges and rewards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the final round interview for this position will be in a superday format. You will also be required to report in-person for this position at our New York office. Flow Traders will assist with housing and accommodations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our internship program has limited space; once all positions are filled, the recruitment process will close. We highly suggest that you start your application process as soon as possible as the entire recruitment process can take between 5-10 weeks.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Flow Traders, we acknowledge the importance of open and transparent communication whether it be with our employees, our stakeholders, or our local and global communities. When it comes to salary, Flow Traders uses reliable market research to create base ranges. Where candidates will fall within the range depends on a few different factors including but not limited to level of experience, location, and specific skill set. We also consider ourselves one global team, and to demonstrate that, all employees are eligible to share in the company’s success through an annual discretionary variable remuneration allocated based on company, group and individual performance and contribution. Per the NYC Salary Transparency Law, the total compensation for this role includes a prorated base salary of $150,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Students enrolled in a university or college within the United States are welcome to apply to the New York Trading Internship. A similar program is offered in our Amsterdam and Hong Kong offices for students studying or living in Europe and APAC.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flow Traders does not accept unsolicited resumes from any professional staffing or search firms. All resumes, and any other information identifying potential candidates, submitted to any employee at Flow Traders via-email, the Internet or directly without a valid and signed search agreement will be deemed free to contact by Flow Traders without any restrictions and no placement fee of any kind will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by Flow Traders.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-MM1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-1rt0ngn:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;About the team + role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;25&quot;&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards. The Tax Operations team’s mission is to support our tax information reporting and compliance efforts related to the purchase and sale of equities and crypto. We partner with product, engineering, and account operations teams to ensure robust and scalable tax systems. Our team fosters a highly collaborative, supportive, and execution-oriented culture. We are dedicated to ensuring a seamless tax reporting experience for all Robinhood customers!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;915&quot;&gt;Robinhood is looking for a skilled Tax Operations professional to join our team! We are seeking motivated professionals who thrive in dynamic environments and can manage multiple priorities. In this role, you will lead tax reporting processes for taxable and retirement accounts, executing critical exception reports covering areas such as withholding, cost basis, and crypto transactions. You will also partner with Customer Experience and Account Operations teams to resolve complex tax-related inquiries and withholding issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1597&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA and New York, NY offices, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week&lt;/strong&gt;. At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1955&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1972&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product, project, and engineering teams to launch, improve, and scale Robinhood products and systems, tracking various tax-related initiatives and new product promotions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2161&quot;&gt;Lead the tax reporting processes for taxable and retirement accounts, executing critical exception reports covering areas such as withholding, cost basis, and crypto transactions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2342&quot;&gt;Partner with Customer Experience and Account Operations teams to resolve complex tax inquiries, cost basis issues, and withholding discrepancies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2489&quot;&gt;Develop and implement reconciliations of data between internal systems and vendors, verifying the accuracy of tax information transmitted to the IRS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2642&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2659&quot;&gt;Bring a Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Accounting, or a related field, along with 5+ years of professional experience in tax operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2796&quot;&gt;Demonstrate experience with retirement tax reporting, specifically with IRS Forms 1099-R and 5498&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2896&quot;&gt;Showcase strong analytical and communication skills, with proficiency in tools like SQL or Databricks to manage, mine, and convert large datasets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3044&quot;&gt;Manage and drive tax projects to completion in a deadline-driven environment, maintaining high attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3161&quot;&gt;Apply prior experience in Financial Services, Fintech, or Crypto, with an understanding of tax onboarding procedures and Forms W-9/W-8BEN preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3313&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3329&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3380&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3505&quot;&gt;Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3627&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3741&quot;&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3838&quot;&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3929&quot;&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4031&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$165,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$123,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$145,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$129,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1c788w9:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;About the team + role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;25&quot;&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards. The Tax Operations team’s mission is to support our tax information reporting and compliance efforts related to the purchase and sale of equities and crypto. We collaborate closely with internal partners to ensure robust processes and data flows. We are dedicated to ensuring a high standard of compliance in a fast-paced and collaborative team environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;826&quot;&gt;Robinhood is looking for a skilled Tax Operations Analyst to join our team! We are seeking driven individuals who thrive in a fast-paced environment and can manage multiple priorities. In this role, you will work on executing various exception reports covering areas such as reporting, withholding, and cost basis. You will also help our Customer Experience and Account Operations teams handle tax-related inquiries and resolve reporting issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1423&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our New York, NY and Menlo Park, CA offices, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt; At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1935&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1952&quot;&gt;Collaborate with our product, project, and engineering teams to launch, improve and scale Robinhood products and systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2074&quot;&gt;Contribute to and track various tax related projects such as new product launches and promotions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;Help our Customer Experience and Account Ops teams handle tax related inquiries and resolve reporting and withholding issues, including areas such as withholding, cost basis, retirement accounts, and crypto tax reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2398&quot;&gt;Develop and assist with the implementation of reconciliations of data between internal systems and vendors, as well as verification of data being sent from the tax reporting vendor to IRS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2588&quot;&gt;Work on executing various exception reports covering areas such as reporting, withholding and cost basis, while implementing internal policies and procedures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2747&quot;&gt;Work on building and maintaining dashboards for metrics and checklists to manage and change workflows and queries to improve team functions as well as to improve customer experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2931&quot;&gt;Work with various Robinhood entities and departments to streamline data flow as well as automate processes where possible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3057&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3074&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Finance, Accounting, or similar field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3134&quot;&gt;3-5+ years of work experience in tax, accounting, and/or operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3204&quot;&gt;High attention to detail&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3230&quot;&gt;Ability to manage and drive projects to completion in a deadline driven environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3315&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and communication skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3358&quot;&gt;Bonus points:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3373&quot;&gt;Financial Services, Fintech, and/or Crypto experience preferred&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3438&quot;&gt;Previous Tax Ops or Tax Project management experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3493&quot;&gt;Understanding of Tax Onboarding, including IRS Forms W-9 and W-8BEN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3562&quot;&gt;Prior expertise with tools such as SQL, Databricks, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;Proficiency in working with large datasets, data mining and conversions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3695&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3711&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3762&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3887&quot;&gt;Top Tier benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4009&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools on the market and continuous AI skill-building for every employee, technical or not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4123&quot;&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4220&quot;&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4311&quot;&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4413&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$115,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$135,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$101,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$119,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$89,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$105,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1b6ar30:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;Founded 20 years ago and headquartered in Chicago, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Group of financial services firms has grown to more than 600 people operating throughout North America, Europe and Asia. Since spinning out of a large brokerage firm in 2016, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; Trading has rapidly scaled as an independent proprietary trading firm utilizing its own capital, trading strategies, and risk management methodologies to provide liquidity to worldwide financial markets and hedging opportunities to commodity producers and users. Now, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; group affiliates include two broker dealers, a cryptocurrency market making firm, and a bourgeoning investment adviser.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Overview: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV Trading is building a centralized AI function to govern, standardize, and accelerate firm-wide AI adoption.&amp;nbsp;The Senior AI Engineer defines how the firm builds production agent systems and ships reference&amp;nbsp;implementations that demonstrate the patterns in production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;- Define firm-wide standards for agent and MCP development&lt;br&gt;- Build reference agent applications for business teams&lt;br&gt;- Design patterns for connecting agents to internal databases, APIs, and knowledge sources&lt;br&gt;- Establish security and governance requirements for AI in a regulated trading environment&lt;br&gt;- Partner with Security on AI-specific controls (data access, audit, threat detection)&lt;br&gt;- Evaluate and adopt infrastructure for agent deployment and observability&lt;br&gt;- Partner with stakeholders to identify and deliver high-value use cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;- 5+ years software engineering; strong Python&lt;br&gt;- Production LLM-powered agent systems shipped (not demos)&lt;br&gt;- Experience integrating agents with databases, APIs, and internal data sources&lt;br&gt;- MCP and/or tool-calling experience in production&lt;br&gt;- Security experience in regulated or sensitive-data environments&lt;br&gt;- Kubernetes, CI/CD, observability&lt;br&gt;- Autonomous; strong communication with technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;- Prop trading, hedge fund, or financial services&lt;br&gt;- Firm-wide platform or standards work&lt;br&gt;- Multi-model environments (Claude, GPT, etc.)&lt;br&gt;- Agent evaluation and testing in production&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is not accepting unsolicited resumes from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; should submit resumes in response to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;’s posted positions. All resumes submitted by search firms to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-0rsl0rj:
&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe&#39;s Financial Connections group is building technology that expands the scope of problems we tackle beyond card payments. We aspire to enable individuals and businesses to securely share their financial data to improve their product experiences. With more high-quality customer financial data, both Stripe and our users can offer better products to their customers. We have ambitious goals to enable all global businesses to run their entire financial life cycle on Stripe, and we want you to be part of our story.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Operations roles in Financial Connections are a dynamic and critical component of the organization&#39;s success. We sit at the intersection of product and platform engineers, financial partners, and AI systems—connecting them to ensure that nothing is lost in translation and that the systems underpinning Stripe’s open banking ecosystem remain reliable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Operate, maintain, and expand banking integrations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a domain expert in open banking, financial data access, and data aggregation—the systems, the partners, and the failure modes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own integration health end-to-end: triage degradations, diagnose root causes, coordinate with financial partners, and drive resolution with urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle technical inquiries from internal Stripe teams and external partners, often requiring deep investigation and targeted code or configuration changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and launch new financial partner integrations using agentic tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct complex data analysis to investigate product performance, scope partner requirements, and surface reliability insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build agentic systems and automation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and ship LLM-powered agentic workflows that streamline and automate high-volume operational tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate as a Human-in-the-Loop reviewer for automated processes that carry meaningful risk, applying your domain expertise where automation alone isn&#39;t sufficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify inefficient or manual processes and eliminate them through AI-powered automation, code changes, or driving complex process improvements across Stripe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Partner and scale&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a technical point of contact for financial partners—troubleshooting issues, aligning on product usage, and managing relationships with clear communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide authoritative technical context to cross-functional partners including product, partnerships, compliance, and legal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and improve anomaly detection systems and observability tooling to ensure data flowing through partner and internal systems is reliable and correct&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TechOps IRE roles combine software engineering, data analysis, AI systems development, and cross-functional partner management. The ideal candidate brings experience across technical systems, data investigation, and complex project ownership—and finds genuine satisfaction in making things run reliably at scale through both human judgment and intelligent automation. Successful candidates may index more highly in one area than another.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical problem-solving skills, with the ability to develop a working understanding of complex systems through a variety of methods: reading and writing code, studying documentation and partner specifications, running debugging tools, reading logs, querying raw data, and asking precise questions of domain experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building with AI and LLM tooling with established clear outcomes—you don&#39;t need experience with any specific framework, but you should be able to pick up new tools quickly and think clearly about where automation adds value versus where human judgment is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL skills and proficiency navigating a variety of data systems to diagnose and scope issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with developer tools (e.g. git) and an ability to make well-scoped code changes in a large codebase&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to frame messages appropriately for both technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An instinct to build solutions that increase the leverage of the people around you—not just to solve the problem in front of you, but to eliminate the class of problem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of and experience with payment technologies, open banking, and financial data ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or operating agentic or LLM-powered workflows in a production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Presto, Splunk, or similar data querying and log analysis tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing technical relationships with external partners or vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-0kf6752:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Square&#39;s mission is to &lt;strong&gt;power all the ways small businesses do business&lt;/strong&gt;, helping merchants in the UK operate more efficiently, grow confidently, and unlock new opportunities. As we continue scaling across the UK, we are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Channel Sales Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to build and lead a network of self-employed field sales consultants to drive adoption of Square&#39;s payments and business solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll own the end-to-end management of your regional sales operation, from identifying and onboarding independent consultants to coaching them toward excellence and delivering measurable results. You&#39;ll balance hands-on field leadership with strategic planning, ensuring your consultants are equipped, motivated, and aligned with Square&#39;s standards. This is a dynamic, field-facing role that requires both the ability to inspire and develop talent and the analytical rigor to track performance and optimize strategy based on real-world insights. This role will require regular travel across your assigned region and some national travel may also be required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer remote work opportunities within the UK.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, onboard, and motivate self-employed field consultants across your region to represent Square’s hardware and software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular coaching, training, and field support to maximize consultant performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a regional plan to drive merchant sign-ups, set and monitor KPIs, and adjust tactics based on performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visit the field regularly to accompany consultants, model effective sales behaviors, and help close deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and analyze sales performance, provide feedback, and align efforts to Square’s standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce reliable regional forecasts, pipeline updates, and performance summaries for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture insights from the field about local SME needs, trends, and competitive dynamics, and use them to inform strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of related experience and a history of managing &lt;strong&gt;self-employed or independent field salespeople&lt;/strong&gt; (ideally in the UK market).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coaching and leadership ability, particularly with non-employee contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of delivering sales targets in fast-moving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of consultative sales, pipelines, and metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal skills to build trust and drive alignment with independent consultants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset — able to interpret performance data and act strategically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; experience in fintech, payments, POS, or working with UK SMEs; experience with performance-based or commission-only sales models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is a proud equal opportunity employer. We work hard to evaluate all employees and job applicants consistently, based solely on the core competencies required of the role at hand, and without regard to any legally protected class.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about what we’re doing to build an inclusive workplace? Check out our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/news/inclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inclusion &amp;amp; Diversity page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
