job-1vtmbmo:
&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn’t work together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we’ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We’re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block is looking for an entrepreneurial sales leader to build and lead our Strategic Product Sales organization—a specialized team responsible for accelerating adoption of our highest-priority products across new and existing customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a builder role. You&#39;ll partner cross-functionally to identify where we&#39;re underpenetrated, develop the commercial strategy to unlock growth, and create scalable cross-sell motions that drive product adoption at scale. You&#39;ll lead a team of product sales specialists while partnering closely with Account Executives, Account Managers, Product, Marketing, Revenue Operations, and Enablement to improve how strategic products are sold across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires equal parts commercial strategy, sales leadership, and cross-functional influence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Scale a Product Sales Organization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, hire, and lead a high-performing team of Product Sales Managers and Specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner cross-functionally to design the operating model, engagement strategy, territory approach, and capacity plan for the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish forecasting, pipeline management, inspection rhythms, and performance metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Revenue Operations to define goals, compensation, and success measures aligned to commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Build New Commercial Motions&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy targeted strategies towards underpenetrated strategic products and design scalable sales motions to accelerate adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop commercialization strategies that increase attach rates, cross-sell, and expansion revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine which customers to prioritize, how to engage them, and which sales resources should be deployed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously evaluate performance and refine go-to-market strategies based on customer and market insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Lead Strategic Selling&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Executives and Account Managers on high-value customer opportunities requiring specialized product expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex commercial conversations with executive stakeholders, helping shape account strategy and maximize customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy your team of specialists to accelerate strategic opportunities while enabling relationship owners to remain at the center of the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove barriers to winning complex, multi-product deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Enable the Broader Sales Organization&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create repeatable sales plays, messaging, competitive positioning, ROI frameworks, and commercialization strategies that help the broader sales organization sell more effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Enablement to build scalable programs including playbooks, webinars, workshops, and sales training.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve product expertise across Account Executives, Account Managers, and other first-party sales teams - and drive improved success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help establish best practices that increase product penetration across managed and unmanaged customer segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Drive Cross-Functional Execution&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Product, Marketing, Revenue Operations, Finance, Customer Success, and Sales Leadership to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully drive increased adoption across Square’s strategic product portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase product adoption and attach rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve sales productivity and customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence product commercialization through customer and market feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of leadership experience in enterprise software, fintech, SaaS, payments, or another complex B2B environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building new sales organizations, commercialization functions, or strategic go-to-market motions from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading specialist sales, overlay sales, solution sales, or product-focused commercial organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to drive cross-sell, product adoption, attach, and expansion revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts with the ability to identify growth opportunities and translate them into scalable sales strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading through influence and partnering across Sales, Product, Marketing, Revenue Operations, and Enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence with strong consultative selling and customer engagement skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of building high-performing teams, coaching leaders, and scaling organizations through growth and change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is an equal opportunity employer evaluating all employees and job applicants without regard to identity or any legally protected class. We will consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records for employment in accordance with state and local laws and “fair chance” ordinances. We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible. &lt;strong&gt;Want to learn more about what we&#39;re doing to build a workplace that is fair and square? Check out our&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/news/inclusion&quot;&gt;I+D page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate’s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To find a location’s zone designation, please refer to this &lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone A - D:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$386,000—$579,000 USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Amounts listed above include target variable compensation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-0563b4g:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Galaxy Digital Inc. (Nasdaq: GLXY) is a global leader in digital assets and data center infrastructure, growing the economy that runs on code. Galaxy delivers the onchain infrastructure that connects institutions to digital assets, including trading, advisory, asset management, staking, self-custody, and tokenization. Galaxy also develops and operates data center infrastructure to power AI and HPC workloads. Anchored by its Helios campus in Texas, Galaxy is building a multi-gigawatt pipeline of more than 5.7 GW of potential capacity, positioning it among the largest and fastest-growing data center developers in North America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Company is headquartered in New York City, with offices across North America, Europe, the Middle East, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional information about Galaxy&#39;s businesses and products is available on &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.galaxy.com/&quot;&gt;www.galaxy.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a diverse team of free thinkers, and fast movers united to help investors and creators energize the global economy. We are looking for individuals&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;thrive in a culture of builders and overachievers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;embrace high performance, transparent feedback, and a mission-first approach. Our culture shapes our way of working and gets us where we want to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Seek Excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Selective To Be Effective.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Highly Aligned, Loosely Coupled.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Disagree Transparently.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Encourage Independent Decision-Making.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Dream Teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;You will establish a new business dedicated to the financialization of AI infrastructure. Market participants are accumulating large, correlated exposures across power and compute and lack adequate tools to manage them. This role designs the strategy and client solutions that meet those needs, and over time develops the principal risk-taking framework that extends the product suite. This is a broad mandate with significant scope to shape the direction of the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Develop and own the strategy for Galaxy&#39;s entry into AI infrastructure markets — define where Galaxy will engage across the range of modes (brokerage, dealing, market-making, structured lending) and how to sequence products so the business earns flow, relationships, and market data ahead of financialization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Originate transactions and build the counterparty network across AI labs, neoclouds, hyperscalers, data-center and power developers, utilities and IPPs, crypto-mining operators, and financial counterparties, developing the proprietary market intelligence that any downstream product depends on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Design and structure bespoke instruments — forwards, swaps, options, and take-or-pay and capacity-reservation structures — that let clients hedge cost exposure or monetize idle capacity across the AI infrastructure stack, spanning power and electricity, compute and GPU capacity, and inference and token cost&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Develop pricing and risk frameworks for instruments with limited or no existing liquidity, including mark-to-model valuation, basis decomposition, and proxy and cross-hedging methodologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Build a credit and structured-lending capability where it fits the opportunity — underwriting GPU fleets and data-center deployments against the quality and durability of their contracted cash flows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Source liquidity, build exchange and OTC connectivity, and stand up the desk&#39;s operational and control infrastructure with legal, credit, and quantitative teams — risk limits, documentation, collateral arrangements, and booking processes — and, as the business matures, design and implement the principal risk-taking framework that integrates proprietary positioning into the client suite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Build and lead the team across origination, trading, structuring, and credit; represent Galaxy with exchanges, benchmark and index providers, counterparties, and partners&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;8+ years building and running a markets business — trading, brokerage, structured products, or physical commodities — with a track record of taking a franchise from zero to scale and running risk or structuring transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of the AI compute ecosystem — data-center development, neoclouds, GPU economics, hyperscaler dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Range across modes (trade, structure, lend, intermediate) rather than a single-product specialty&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep fluency in a flow commodity defined by basis, term structure, and non-storability — power, freight, bandwidth/telecom, or a comparable market where non-fungibility and obsolescence shape how it trades&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to price and manage risk in illiquid or nascent markets — comfort with basis risk, mark-to-model valuation, and proxy hedging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credit and structured-lending judgment, including asset-backed and project-finance structures, with a sharp instinct for the difference between bankable contracted offtake and merchant price risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quantitative fluency, including the ability to build and interrogate pricing models in Python or a comparable language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Institutional-grade execution and a rigorous, skeptical, process-driven approach to risk&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Power or energy trading background, including ISO/RTO mechanics, nodal/zonal pricing, and PPAs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Experience in or alongside an AI business, cloud provider, data-center operator, or large energy offtaker, with corresponding understanding of cost structures and procurement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Experience financing or operating capital-intensive physical infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Crypto-mining operations experience and the associated power and hardware economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Prior experience launching a new derivatives product, or contributing to the design or governance of a market index or benchmark&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Entrepreneurial and comfortable operating amid ambiguity, with a clear preference for building over administering an established function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Creative — many of the relevant instruments do not yet exist and will need to be conceived and brought to market by the desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Driven and commercially focused, with a clear ownership mentality appropriate to a role of this scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW81796384 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW81796384 BCX0&quot;&gt;Competitive base salary and discretionary bonus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
