&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgqDz04PJyQlgP2MO6P06DIe&quot;&gt;We are building the foundational data infrastructure that powers one of the world&#39;s leading crypto exchanges. As a &lt;strong&gt;Big Data Platform Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will design, build, and evolve the core platform services that enable hundreds of data engineers and analysts to move fast and ship reliable pipelines. You will be at the forefront of our AI agent initiative — embedding LLM-driven capabilities directly into the platform layer so that scheduling, cost optimization, and incident response increasingly run autonomously.&lt;/div&gt;
