&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VhAAd9EtnoP9uDxtiUZlBDKCg3b&quot;&gt;As a Technical Expert, you will own the core build-out of the company&#39;s R&amp;amp;D Efficiency Platform, proactively identifying and eliminating risks across the delivery pipeline through CI/CD, DevSecOps, Change Management, and AI-Native upgrades—reducing delivery cost while improving quality and efficiency via platformization and automation.&lt;/div&gt;
