&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills, both orally and in writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent numeracy and analytical skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of financial regulatory capital planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capital management and liquidity awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the principles and application of risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of project management and governance principles and techniques and ability to apply them to projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of financial products, FX, Derivatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical accounting exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regulatory reporting exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally have transaction support and other (M&amp;amp;A / tax)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Skills (Python, SQL etc) a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to broker / trading backgrounds will be very advantageous as will regulated financial services businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
