&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;B41EdNSDuocHEjxP6Q0l0lbFgBb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SVCJd0WBboGZLVxgd2Xl5cv1gVe&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Senior Growth Manager, the Growth Manager will be responsible for driving user acquisition, retention, and revenue growth across multiple marketing channels. This is a hands-on individual contributor role requiring strong execution capabilities, commercial acumen, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-QtIUdyq4bo3MnHxN9b4loz5CgIe&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JpuHd6VQYoAVvAxME7AloJMVgxf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as the key local stakeholder for paid media, working closely with performance teams on strategy, campaign reviews, performance analysis, and optimization opportunities across Meta, Google, DSPs, and other acquisition channels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EFXCd3ZvToKYi2xgpIblZfi3gud&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Plan and execute CRM and lifecycle marketing campaigns, including email, push notifications, and in-platform communications.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YEnIdrYfdoe0L1xmfJglfgnbgNf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop segmentation strategies to acquire, engage, retain, and reactivate users, including VIP customer segments.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VkiBdcW9MoBAJIxVBPGlmERdgKg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
