&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vj0rdJaK3ooBhvx5xGzlzo6jgAg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Work cross-functionally with regional and global stakeholders to drive growth initiatives and business objectives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M1hGd7gzronhhUx5wy0lD4FUgQf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Take ownership of projects from strategy development through execution and performance reporting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
