&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Security Engineer, you will have the opportunity to shape our security posture in many domains including; application security, vulnerability management, IAM, cloud and network security, incident response, digital forensics, DevSecOps, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
