&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WmoIdNqieo7hmCxG1vnle0i6gdg&quot;&gt;At OKX, design isn&#39;t decoration — it&#39;s how we shape the future of finance. As a senior creative force within our Brand Design team, you&#39;ll define the aesthetic language of one of the world&#39;s fastest-growing cryptocurrency platforms, working across every surface that matters: brand identity, digital campaigns, web, editorial, social, events, and beyond.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PgEId1HoEoHlhBx779mlXFHQgwe&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll own creative end-to-end, from first idea to final pixel. We&#39;re looking for someone who elevates every brief they touch: a designer with the instincts to find clarity in ambiguity, the range to move fluidly across channels, and the presence to raise the bar as part of a global team.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PyEMdmK9MowhBSxBwMRlbrckgLh&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-E1bqdpJNQoh30sx3qE6lll5rgje&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
