&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S7aCdiDsyoYdaHxrYaGlLRytgdb&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this position is: &lt;br&gt;Tier 1: $200,355 to $300,533 &lt;br&gt;Tier 2: $160,284 to $240,426 &lt;br&gt;Tier 3: $140,249 to $210,373&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AibOd3vPNo6SaGxghNOlyg0AgHe&quot;&gt;The salary offered depends on a variety of factors, including job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and market location. In addition to the salary, a performance bonus and long-term incentives may be provided as part of the compensation package, as well as a full range of medical, financial, and/or other benefits, dependent on the position offered. Applicants should apply via OKX internal or external careers site.&lt;/div&gt;
