&lt;li&gt;Excellent technical and non-technical communication skills, verbal and written.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
