&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;This is a hands-on role focused on building and scaling accounting infrastructure. You will take ownership from external providers, strengthen processes, and help design systems that can support increasing trade volume, new products (margin, perpetuals, derivatives), and institutional-grade reporting.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
