&lt;li&gt;Manage tax reporting and partner with external tax advisors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support regulatory filings and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Investor Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
