&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KIBOdaMnooVdWMxRVeBlYVDAgPd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Own the mobile engineering for P2P trading flows, including trading channel mechanics, payment methods, and end-to-end buy and sell transaction journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KIBOdaMnooVdWMxRVeBlYVDAgPd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build and maintain cross-regional fiat payment integrations, including local bank transfers, e-wallets, and third-party PSP integrations across markets such as Southeast Asia, LATAM, and MENA.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QdoHdP81Lo1pO5xleEEly4hpgob&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ensure mobile payment flows and user data handling comply with local and international regulatory requirements, including KYC tiers, transaction limits, and regional compliance constraints.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GzTXdXuIToINuwx9MAyldv36g9c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate closely with compliance, legal, product, and regional market teams to translate local regulatory requirements into reliable, user-friendly mobile experiences.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VmGldjRr3oQ4NRxNF7mluA4yggg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive technical decision-making on payment architecture, clearly articulating trade-offs across delivery speed, maintainability, and compliance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CKtFdvLKgocTI5xplRxlTmdsgC1&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Apply AI coding tools actively in your workflow—not only for code generation, but also to build and maintain repeatable personal AI development workflows.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VIbKdf6YUolfD0xyCZklDUGigEd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Mentor engineers on the team and contribute to a culture of ownership, technical rigour, and high engineering standards.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
