job-0uh2hiz:
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus3bYvV5DS6icDHnquWbEcNb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus3bYvV5DS6icDHnquWbEcNb&quot;&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Hong Kong, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxussQumjJyp0pDHcFh7Y3bH0b&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;OvVyd3xPZo5hNhxbppju7P8isgg&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CzjQdI1IWofbWMxmIahu6dAMsjc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Q5McdBHqRos9a1xglGGuWZx7sgc&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusdoP7NU01oX9Z29HojysCiF&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Staff Mobile Engineer to join our OEX Mobile Growth team — a pure mobile team sitting at the intersection of engineering rigour, consumer growth craft, and product instinct. This is not a feature delivery role. You will own the client-side architecture for new user acquisition, referral and virality mechanics, and the reward and conversion funnels that drive growth for millions of users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring deep expertise in mobile attribution — from MMP design and evolution through to anti-fraud, channel revenue sharing, and ROI evaluation — and you know how to turn attribution data into decisions. You are also fluent in AI-assisted development and bring the discipline to build, maintain, and continuously improve your own AI engineering workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusJZ5t4Jnk2dRFRKdHIJXMmb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusl2cgB8vs7Q3ent4HKPgocd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;R1MMdOP7Jor8rJxZjvEuEmM9s6b&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;EJEWdyXsfojXT9xHKfDuSPpSswb&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;IwA0dvhKMo2zqdxUm6sux6uxsbb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lawfdsko6oZQdQxizyqutN4Ls6f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Own the client-side architecture for core growth conversion flows — new user acquisition, referral and virality loops, reward mechanics, and activity-driven engagement systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and evolve the mobile attribution system — including MMP integration, attribution modelling, and the application of attribution data across anti-fraud, channel revenue sharing, and ROI evaluation scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimise growth infrastructure including funnel instrumentation, experiment frameworks, and acquisition loops that directly serve the mobile user base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Product, Business Development, and local market teams to translate commercial goals into concrete, data-backed engineering proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive technical decision-making on growth infrastructure, articulating trade-offs clearly and defending or revising positions based on evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply AI coding tools actively in your workflow — not just for code generation, but to build and maintain repeatable personal AI development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers on the team and help establish a culture where engineers bring solutions, not just responses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusJHbXag5ngXLLiXggj1zhBg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;R1MMdOP7Jor8rJxZjvEuEmM9s6b&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;EJEWdyXsfojXT9xHKfDuSPpSswb&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;IwA0dvhKMo2zqdxUm6sux6uxsbb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software engineering experience with a track record of shipping production-quality systems at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with new user growth, referral and virality mechanics, activity and reward systems, and the client-side architecture behind core business conversion flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in mobile attribution design and evolution — hands-on experience with attribution platforms and solutions, and proven ability to drive attribution data into anti-fraud, channel revenue sharing, and ROI evaluation applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in AI-assisted development — able to independently build and maintain personal AI engineering workflows, not just use AI tools ad hoc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data instincts: you think in funnels, know how to instrument what matters, and use metrics to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outspoken and proposal-driven — you come to the table with a point of view, push back when you disagree, and bring data and a counter-proposal rather than just flagging concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional communication — comfortable working with Product, Business Development, and local markets to align on goals and hold the line on engineering quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
