&lt;li&gt;Depth in MMPs such as AppsFlyer, Adjust, or SKAdNetwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building referral systems, k-factor mechanics, or anti-fraud layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A/B experiment framework ownership at meaningful scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ASO operational experience (App Store Connect, Google Play Console).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in fintech, crypto, or regulated consumer financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating across APAC, EEA, or US markets.&lt;/li&gt;
