&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZIldCu8Yo2RNGxb5sclYF8Egkh&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PnxBdg8iAorvjexFwVDlzjCigoe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VfjpdpiXQogYF9xFrTWlZ3n3gCh&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Communications, or a related field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
