&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and develop a mobile engineering team, driving ownership and accountability across project milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide hands-on technical guidance on mobile development, architecture, and engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion the adoption of AI tools and workflows across the team - from code generation and review to testing and incident analysis with a goal to raise the quality and velocity of delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
