&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;We are looking for a hands-on product manager to own and scale our Affiliate and KOL marketing channels, with a primary focus on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;EEA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; (Europe) and other onshore regulated markets. Your mission is to drive measurable user acquisition and transaction volume through data-driven optimization and ecosystem building across multi-jurisdictional environments. If you have a proven track record of driving growth at a leading crypto exchange or a hyper-growth platform, we want you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
