&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Own the affiliate product strategy for EEA and other regulated onshore markets (AU, SG, UAE, BR, TR), aligned with company-level acquisition, activation, and ROI goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
