&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;24&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Own the affiliate product infrastructure — dashboard, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;attribution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, commission calculation, campaign management, and partner lifecycle tooling across mobile, web, and APIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
