&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Design and run scalable affiliate programs — onboarding flows, incentive experimentation, promotional campaigns, and cross-market performance benchmarking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
