&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;35&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;5+ years in growth, affiliate/partnerships, or product-led growth roles, preferably at a crypto exchange or hyper-growth consumer platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;36&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;37&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Strong product mindset — you think in systems, funnels, and scalability, not just campaigns and deals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
