&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;39&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Strong analytical capability — you can design affiliate quality scoring, cohort retention analysis, and ROI models, not just read reports.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;41&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Experience driving growth in regulated or compliance-heavy environments, ideally across European or multi-jurisdictional markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
