&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-EtcidcYF9oghLpxGsEIu71nes3e&quot;&gt;About this Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X0dCd571XofnPTxIII9ucOkas1u&quot;&gt;Bybit is building a next-generation global financial platform, expanding beyond exchange into a fully integrated financial ecosystem.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TRihdvg9LoPVh1xWWxuuwD2Rs3c&quot;&gt;As the business scales across markets, regulatory regimes, and product lines, the organization must evolve just as quickly — in structure, capability, and governance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ItlZdmOEloozMyx78yyuI9D1syf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FegedgcVdoTtzWxmTiGue5hlsRk&quot;&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Global Head of &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;to partner directly with the Founder and executive team to design, scale, and future-proof the organization.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JF3LdcxYIoZOV9x9hdxuk0ofs7d&quot;&gt;You will act as a strategic partner to the Founder to build a high-performance, globally scalable organization, enabling Bybit’s next phase of growth and transformation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F3vodmY4toXinsxZN3VuQUi2sHd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
