&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MIXudlc5EozeeQxeonhuM39esyf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the full global HR function across all business units&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jrsrdt08Co6MRFxKSgAuJt5hsfd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner directly with Founder and leadership team to translate business strategy into organizational strategy&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U4YbdYZwDoYT96xtctOuqZh5sYe&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and evolve organizational structures, operating models, and talent strategies to support global expansion&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M47tdnndno0bf6xJeBYuUD54sAc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive global hiring strategy and leadership capability building, ensuring the organization can scale at speed&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
