&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The treasury intern is a structured four weeks program designed to develop future talent in the Treasury.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This program will admit four or three-potential candidates who will gain hands-on exposure across key financial domains. Participants will work closely with experienced professionals, gain practical insights into real business operations, and build a strong foundation in treasury and market-related activities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participants who successfully graduate from the course will be awarded a Certificate of Completion, and may be considered for a permanent role in the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
