&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;17f6627bc171&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2667&quot; data-local-id=&quot;50797cc62505&quot;&gt;5–8 years of experience in DevOps, SRE, or Platform Engineering roles.&lt;/p&gt;
