&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in financial crimes or fraud prevention within financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

job-0i4a99l:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Galaxy Digital Inc. (Nasdaq: GLXY) is a global leader in digital assets and data center infrastructure, growing the economy that runs on code. Galaxy delivers the onchain infrastructure that connects institutions to digital assets, including trading, advisory, asset management, staking, self-custody, and tokenization. Galaxy also develops and operates data center infrastructure to power AI and HPC workloads. Anchored by its Helios campus in Texas, Galaxy is building a multi-gigawatt pipeline of more than 5.7 GW of potential capacity, positioning it among the largest and fastest-growing data center developers in North America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Company is headquartered in New York City, with offices across North America, Europe, the Middle East, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional information about Galaxy&#39;s businesses and products is available on &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.galaxy.com/&quot;&gt;www.galaxy.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a diverse team of free thinkers, and fast movers united to help investors and creators energize the global economy. We are looking for individuals&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;thrive in a culture of builders and overachievers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;embrace high performance, transparent feedback, and a mission-first approach. Our culture shapes our way of working and gets us where we want to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Seek Excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Selective To Be Effective.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Highly Aligned, Loosely Coupled.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Disagree Transparently.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Encourage Independent Decision-Making.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Dream Teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Blockchain Security Lead owns the&amp;nbsp;security&amp;nbsp;posture of on-chain systems and protocols across the organization. This role blends strategic&amp;nbsp;leadership with deep hands-on expertise, overseeing a small team of&amp;nbsp;blockchain&amp;nbsp;security&amp;nbsp;engineers while actively contributing to design reviews, threat modeling, and code audits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner closely with on-chain product and engineering teams to embed&amp;nbsp;security&amp;nbsp;into architecture, development, and operations—building scalable, reusable&amp;nbsp;security&amp;nbsp;controls that grow with the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a team of blockchain security engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and evolve the blockchain security strategy and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted security partner to product, protocol, and infrastructure teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead threat modeling and architecture reviews for on-chain systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform and guide security reviews and audits of smart contracts (Solidity, Rust/Solana) and backend services and supporting infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement reusable security controls, patterns, and reference architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support secure deployment of cloud-native infrastructure (containers, Kubernetes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research emerging blockchain threats, exploits, and mitigations, and translate them into actionable controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Embrace and champion the thoughtful adoption of AI to improve team performance and business outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools (e.g., generative AI, automation platforms, data copilots) to improve productivity, decision-making, and output quality in your day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field (or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of security software engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years working with blockchain technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years working with smart contract security across multiple chains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or mentoring a small, highly technical team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Published material on vulnerabilities/security bugs within the Web3 community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in secure SDLC, threat modeling, and application architecture review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi agent code reviews for vulnerabilities using frontier models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure coding practices and in-depth code review capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong familiarity with smart contracts (Solidity, Rust), cloud-native environments (Docker, Kubernetes), authentication and authorization, TLS/PKI, and cloud, infrastructure, and network security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, confident communicator across technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable balancing hands-on execution with strategic ownership; detail-oriented, pragmatic, and strong in problem solving under ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct exposure to Solana, staking systems, or similar Layer 1 protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at a blockchain security audit firm (e.g., Trail of Bits, Halborn, Ottersec, Zellic)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in financial services or institutional crypto security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with DeFi protocol security, key management, and custody architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to or leading security programs at a crypto exchange, protocol foundation, or digital asset firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW81796384 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW81796384 BCX0&quot;&gt;Competitive base salary and discretionary bonus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW74345553 BCX0&quot;&gt;Hybrid/Flexible Working Arrangements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW74345553 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Time Off (paid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3% 401(k) company contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid health and protective benefits for employees, partners, and other dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW86126979 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW86126979 BCX0&quot;&gt;Competitive family planning benefits for US employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW86126979 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn about the Crypto industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Smart, entrepreneurial, and fun colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW75787114 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW75787114 BCX0&quot;&gt;Free daily snacks and weekly breakfasts/lunches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW75787114 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free coaching and counseling sessions through Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Apply now and join us as we grow the economy that runs on code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Galaxy respects diversity and seeks to provide equal employment opportunities to all employees and job applicants for employment without regard to actual or perceived age, race, color, creed, religion, sex or gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, lactation and related medical conditions), gender identity or gender expression (including transgender status), sexual orientation, marital or partnership or caregiver status, ancestry, national origin, citizenship status, disability, military or veteran status, protected medical condition as defined by applicable state or local law, genetic information or predisposing genetic characteristic, or other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local laws and ordinances.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We will endeavor to make a reasonable accommodation to the known limitations of a qualified applicant with a disability unless the accommodation would impose an undue hardship on the operation of our business. If you believe you require such assistance to complete the application process or to participate in an interview, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@galaxy.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers@galaxy.com.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1u1hdpk:
&lt;p&gt;Flow Traders is looking for an experienced Operations Specialist to join our APAC team in Hong Kong. The ideal candidate is analytically strong, proactive, and motivated to work in a fast-paced trading environment. This is a unique opportunity to join a leading proprietary trading firm where operational excellence, automation, and continuous improvement are at the core of how we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Operations team is responsible for trade lifecycle management, reconciliations, settlement, and control processes that directly support our trading desks. We are building a team that goes beyond traditional mid/back-office execution: we expect our specialists to deeply understand process flows and business logic, design better solutions, and leverage AI and other tools to implement them. What matters most is the ability to analyse how things work, identify what should change, and manage the migration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role sits within our broader first-line controls function, which encompasses our traditional operations function and other First-Line controls, trade reporting, and data management. As we continue to integrate and develop this function, there are opportunities to broaden your scope beyond traditional operations into these adjacent areas, offering a varied and rewarding career path for the right candidate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform daily trade reconciliations, position monitoring, P&amp;amp;L attribution, and cash/cost reconciliation across multiple asset classes and prime brokers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve trade breaks, settlement issues, and corporate action events in a timely manner, liaising with counterparties, custodians, and prime brokers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse existing operational processes end-to-end, map business logic and data flows, and design improved solutions that reduce manual effort and error rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI-assisted development tools and scripting (Python, SQL) to build and maintain automated reconciliation, reporting, and control workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and improve data pipelines that feed control and reporting workflows, ensuring accuracy, completeness, and timeliness of operational data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the onboarding of new counterparties, prime brokers, and market connectivity, including SSI setup and operational readiness testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the APAC delivery of global technology and process improvement projects, collaborating with Technology teams to define requirements and validate outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and manage operational risk throughout the trade lifecycle, escalating issues proactively and contributing to root-cause analysis and remediation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You Need to Succeed&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of mid/back-office or operations experience, preferably within a proprietary trading firm, hedge fund, or prime brokerage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical literacy: you must be able to read, understand, and reason about code (Python, SQL) and data structures, whether you write it yourself or work with AI tools to generate it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to analyse complex process flows, understand the underlying business logic, and translate that into clear, implementable solution designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of trade lifecycle processes across listed equities, ETFs, futures, FX, and/or OTC derivatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with reconciliation frameworks, clearing and settlement workflows, and familiarity with Asian securities markets and their respective rules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with AI-assisted development and productivity tools to accelerate solution delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with large datasets, perform analysis, and translate findings into actionable process improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and problem-solving skills, with a proactive, assertive, and flexible approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and the ability to manage a diverse range of tasks efficiently in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Economics, Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Flow Traders does not accept unsolicited resumes from any professional staffing or search firms. All resumes, and any other information identifying potential candidates, submitted to any employee at Flow Traders via-email, the Internet or directly without a valid and signed search agreement will be deemed free to contact by Flow Traders without any restrictions and no placement fee of any kind will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by Flow Traders.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-0th9twc:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a financing professional to support and develop Jane Street&#39;s APAC financing capabilities across multiple asset classes. To thrive in this role, you’ll need prior experience developing financing solutions at a bank, broker-dealer or buy-side firm and strong relationships with prime brokers and counterparties across the spectrum of APAC markets and financing structures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is entrepreneurial—it offers the opportunity to collaborate on immediate trading decisions and develop the firm&#39;s longer-term financing strategy. In doing so, you can expect to work with a broad range of internal teams to understand and manage the various constraints of a quantitative trading firm. Additional responsibilities of the role will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimising our financing capacity: improving access to inventory, identifying inefficiencies in our workflows, reducing costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating across our trading desks on real-time and strategic trading decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining and developing relationships with prime brokers and other external financing counterparties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping to form our longer-term financing strategy by improving and expanding our financing activity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding our firmwide financing constraints and comparing financing opportunities using in-depth cost-benefit analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying your technical skills to help build and improve infrastructure supporting our financing workflows and initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 3-7 years of related securities financing experience at a bank or buy-side firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong understanding of Asian market microstructure and mechanics, financing and stock loan markets; having experience across multiple asset classes and financing structures is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a strong understanding and appreciation of risk and risk consequences in the context of Asian markets and products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited and able to cultivate and manage relationships with prime brokers and other clearing, execution, and financing counterparties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong analytical skills and experience performing technical data analysis to solve problems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually curious and motivated to learn about how the financing role fits into other areas of the firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An effective communicator who works well in a team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Python, SQL or other programming languages is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-0dqsayf:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced logistics and supply chain professional to help manage our equipment inventory, delivery, installation, and deployment for our offices, data centres, and co-locations, and to track assets throughout their lifecycle. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role covers a range of sites across the Asian market and will be based in our Hong Kong office, and working alongside our London office, to align global processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional responsibilities of this role will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing, implementing, and coordinating comprehensive logistics plans for equipment movement from warehouses to data centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the call-off process, ensuring the timely and accurate delivery of equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating, with the support of the business stakeholders, the planning of installations and deployments of equipment across multiple sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working alongside our internal Procurement team to support the management of inventory levels and identify any stock challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping with asset transfers and driving process improvements across logistics and supply chain operations where possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshooting and resolving any logistics-related issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing customs broking and paperwork arrangements for the importing and exporting of goods across global markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and oversee our warehousing providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure real-time inventory data accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5+ years of experience in logistics and project management, preferably in IT or data center environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have demonstrable experience improving, streamlining, and documenting processes, and operate with a high sense of urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a proven track record of managing vendors and coordinating third-party services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experienced project manager and resource planner who understands warehouse operations and inventory management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong communicator with great people and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Excel and Google Sheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in managing asset transfers and improving that process where possible (a plus but not required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and Mandarin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

job-06h5s5b:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Founded in Silicon Valley in 2009 by Marc Andreessen and Ben Horowitz, Andreessen Horowitz (aka a16z) is a venture capital firm that backs bold entrepreneurs &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/news-content&quot;&gt;building the future&lt;/a&gt; through technology. We are &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio&quot;&gt;stage agnostic&lt;/a&gt;. We invest in seed to venture to &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/growth/&quot;&gt;growth-stage technology&lt;/a&gt; companies, across &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/ai/&quot;&gt;AI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/bio-health/&quot;&gt;bio + healthcare&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/consumer/&quot;&gt;consumer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/&quot;&gt;crypto&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/enterprise/&quot;&gt;enterprise&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/fintech/&quot;&gt;fintech&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/games&quot;&gt;games&lt;/a&gt;, and companies building toward &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/american-dynamism/&quot;&gt;American dynamism&lt;/a&gt;. a16z has $100B+ under management across multiple funds.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We’ve established a team that &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/about/&quot;&gt;is defined by&lt;/a&gt; respect for the entrepreneur and the company-building process; we know what it’s like to be in the founder’s shoes. We’ve invested in &lt;a href=&quot;https://a16z.com/portfolio/&quot;&gt;companies&lt;/a&gt; like Anduril, Airbnb, Coinbase, Cursor, Databricks, Deel, Figma, GitHub, Roblox, SpaceX, and Stripe. Our team is at the forefront of new technology, helping founders and their companies impact and change the world.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Staff Engineer, Security Automation to anchor automation across a16z&#39;s security org. Your mandate is leverage — connect the tools the security team relies on, centralize the data they generate, and build the dashboards and AI-native automations that let a small team (Security Engineering and Incident Response) operate at the scale of a much larger one.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This is an AI-native role. You&#39;ll build with and on AI: LLM-augmented workflows, agentic automations, AI-assisted analysis as a first-class building block — and you&#39;ll help the rest of the security team get more leverage out of AI in their own work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;a16z&#39;s security stack spans cloud telemetry, SIEM, identity, endpoint, vulnerability scanning, ticketing, and more. The team needs them stitched into one picture and one workflow rather than ten siloed ones. You&#39;ll be the person who makes that real. You&#39;ll work day to day with the Security Engineering Lead, Incident Response, SecOps, IT, and ASG(A16Z’s Applied Software Group).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Venture capital firms face targeted, sophisticated threats — capital call wire fraud, vishing, social engineering, and threat actors who specifically pursue firms in this space. Your work protects the firm, our LPs, and our portfolio companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role requires an in-office presence 2 days a week in our San Francisco, CA office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;To join our team, you should be excited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Build the connective tissue across the security tools the org relies on — SIEM, vulnerability scanners, EDR, identity, asset management, ticketing — and centralize the data they generate into a single picture the team can act on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Use AI as a first-class building block - LLM-augmented analysis, agentic automations, AI-assisted summarization - and design for compounding leverage, not one-off scripts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Build the frameworks and dashboards that unify asset inventory, vulnerability posture, exposure reviews, and compliance evidence across systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Take the bigger automation problems off the team&#39;s plate — vulnerability management at scale, asset hygiene, access reviews, and the workflows that span multiple tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Raise the rest of the security team&#39;s leverage with AI - share patterns, ship tooling others use, and make it easy for security engineers and IR engineers to add AI to their own work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;5+ years of security engineering experience, with automation and tool-building as a core part of your work — not a side project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Builder mindset — comfortable shipping production-quality security tooling, with strong Python or similar&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience building with LLMs or AI APIs — integrating AI into workflows, not just using AI-powered products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Broad security fundamentals across cloud security, detection engineering, identity, and vulnerability management. Depth in one is fine; breadth across many is required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Understanding of AI security risks: prompt injection, data exfiltration from LLM workflows, agent identity boundaries, and model risk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Experience translating technical security concepts, decisions, and trade-offs into terms non-technical audiences across the firm can act on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Low ego, high empathy, and the capacity to collaborate across security, engineering, and IT without creating friction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;The anticipated salary range for this role is between $243,000 - $284,000, actual starting pay may vary based on a range of factors which can include experience, skills, and scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;This role is eligible to participate in the a16z carry program and various discretionary bonus programs as well as benefit and perquisite plans including health, dental, vision, disability, life insurance, 401K plan, vacation, and sick leave.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a16z culture&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do only first class business and only in a first class way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We take a long view of relationships, because we are in the relationship business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We believe in the future and bet the firm that way&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We are all different, we recognize that, and we win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We celebrate the good times&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We do it for the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;We play to win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;At a16z we are always looking to hire the absolute best talent and recognize that diversity in our experiences and backgrounds is what makes us stronger. We hire candidates of any race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital or family status, disability, Veteran status, and any other status. These differences are what enables us to work towards the future we envision for ourselves, our portfolio companies, and the World.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Our organization participates in E-Verify. Click&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.e-verify.gov/employees&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1674233464432000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1-yT1T3ug2xE734Ge62fLD&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt; to learn about E-Verify.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;times new roman&#39;, times, serif;&quot;&gt;Andreessen Horowitz hereby reserves the right to make use of any unsolicited resumes received from outside recruiting agencies and / or individual recruiters without being responsible for payment of any fees asserted from the use of unsolicited resumes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-0xp5msv:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Galaxy Digital Inc. (Nasdaq: GLXY) is a global leader in digital assets and data center infrastructure, growing the economy that runs on code. Galaxy delivers the onchain infrastructure that connects institutions to digital assets, including trading, advisory, asset management, staking, self-custody, and tokenization. Galaxy also develops and operates data center infrastructure to power AI and HPC workloads. Anchored by its Helios campus in Texas, Galaxy is building a multi-gigawatt pipeline of more than 5.7 GW of potential capacity, positioning it among the largest and fastest-growing data center developers in North America.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Company is headquartered in New York City, with offices across North America, Europe, the Middle East, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional information about Galaxy&#39;s businesses and products is available on &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.galaxy.com/&quot;&gt;www.galaxy.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Value:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a diverse team of free thinkers, and fast movers united to help investors and creators energize the global economy. We are looking for individuals&amp;nbsp;who&amp;nbsp;thrive in a culture of builders and overachievers&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;embrace high performance, transparent feedback, and a mission-first approach. Our culture shapes our way of working and gets us where we want to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Seek Excellence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Selective To Be Effective.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Be Highly Aligned, Loosely Coupled.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Disagree Transparently.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Encourage Independent Decision-Making.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build Dream Teams.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Galaxy’s Digital Infrastructure Services (DIS) is the institutional backbone of our blockchain ambitions – spanning staking, validators, custody, DeFi, and tokenization – serving tier-1 banks, asset managers, and financial infrastructure providers. As Business Partner – Execution &amp;amp; Delivery, you will sit at the center of DIS as a high-agency execution and strategy partner to senior leadership. You will drive the organization’s highest-value work to completion: supporting internal transformation initiatives, owning delivery across complex cross-functional programs, building the client-facing materials that represent DIS externally, and showing up in institutional client rooms when it matters. This role requires someone equally at home in an org design conversation with DIS leadership and in a technical workshop with a tier-1 bank.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a direct execution partner to DIS leadership on internal transformation initiatives – org design, operating model changes, team structure, and cross-functional alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop materials that support leadership decision-making: frameworks, options analyses, org charts, decision memos, and structured recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and synthesize the full picture of what’s happening across DIS – internal initiatives, external engagements, open gaps – so leadership is always informed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the organization stay ahead of capacity and staffing needs: understand what’s coming, what it requires, and where we need to hire, realign, or augment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery coordination for the most complex, cross-functional DIS initiatives – platform integration, institutional client programs, and strategic product buildouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate strategic intent into structured delivery plans with clear owners, milestones, and accountability – and hold teams to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the connective tissue between engineering, product, distribution, and external stakeholders – ensuring no handoff falls through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay deeply familiar with the active deal landscape – understanding where each engagement stands, what’s required to close or deliver, and where we have product, resource, or capability gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain high-quality client-facing materials: pitch decks, capability presentations, proposal documents, and engagement readouts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent DIS in institutional client engagements as appropriate – including workshops, technical sessions, and implementation reviews with tier-1 banks, asset managers, and infrastructure providers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify blockers, scope drift, staffing gaps, and resource conflicts – and bring them to the right people before they compound&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the ongoing evolution of DIS’s operating model – delivery cadences, cross-team rituals, and program tooling – and identify patterns across projects to build repeatable processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Embrace and champion the thoughtful adoption of AI to improve team performance and business outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI tools (e.g., generative AI, automation platforms, data copilots) to improve productivity, decision-making, and output quality in your day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in a strategy, business partner, operations, or execution-focused role – ideally within a fast-moving technology or financial services organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to support senior leadership on internal transformation: org design, operating model changes, team alignment, and cross-functional prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts – able to understand a deal landscape, identify capability and staffing gaps, and connect the dots between pipeline and organizational capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written communication and materials production – pitch decks, executive briefings, capability documents, and client-facing presentations that reflect well on leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly structured thinker with a bias for action – creates order in ambiguity rather than waiting for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating across functions and org levels simultaneously – org design in the morning, a client session in the afternoon, an engineering status review by end of day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low ego, high accountability – you own your work and say what you see&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in digital assets, blockchain infrastructure, or institutional financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with custody, staking, DeFi, or tokenization products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience supporting or working alongside tier-1 financial institutions (banks, asset managers, custodians)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in post-acquisition integration, platform transformation, or org redesign&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW81796384 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW81796384 BCX0&quot;&gt;Competitive base salary and discretionary bonus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW74345553 BCX0&quot;&gt;Hybrid/Flexible Working Arrangements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW74345553 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Time Off (paid)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3% 401(k) company contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid health and protective benefits for employees, partners, and other dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW86126979 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW86126979 BCX0&quot;&gt;Competitive family planning benefits for US employees&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW86126979 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to learn about the Crypto industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Smart, entrepreneurial, and fun colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW75787114 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW75787114 BCX0&quot;&gt;Free daily snacks and weekly breakfasts/lunches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW75787114 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free coaching and counseling sessions through Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Apply now and join us as we grow the economy that runs on code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary ranges included below will be commensurate with candidate experience, expertise and local market. Final offer amounts are determined by multiple factors, including candidate experience and expertise. At Galaxy, we maintain a total compensation philosophy which consists of a competitive base salary, annual bonus, and equity incentives.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$225,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Galaxy respects diversity and seeks to provide equal employment opportunities to all employees and job applicants for employment without regard to actual or perceived age, race, color, creed, religion, sex or gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, lactation and related medical conditions), gender identity or gender expression (including transgender status), sexual orientation, marital or partnership or caregiver status, ancestry, national origin, citizenship status, disability, military or veteran status, protected medical condition as defined by applicable state or local law, genetic information or predisposing genetic characteristic, or other characteristic protected by applicable federal, state, or local laws and ordinances.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We will endeavor to make a reasonable accommodation to the known limitations of a qualified applicant with a disability unless the accommodation would impose an undue hardship on the operation of our business. If you believe you require such assistance to complete the application process or to participate in an interview, please contact &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:careers@galaxy.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers@galaxy.com.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-17sezvh:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prediction markets are one of the fastest-growing areas in trading, offering traders a way to put money behind their beliefs in sports, politics, and culture. They can be powerful truth signals since traders have financial motivation to be right and there is no third party setting the odds with a built-in edge. As a Product Marketing Manager on the&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot;&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Consumer &amp;amp; Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; team, you&#39;ll support the Prediction Markets team in growing awareness and adoption of Coinbase&#39;s prediction markets product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the voice of the customer by immersing yourself in the prediction markets ecosystem and understanding which segments of users are trading which types of prediction markets across sports, politics/economics, culture, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop growth strategies and tactics for ongoing news and big events (e.g., sports tournaments, elections), ideating, refining, and executing plans using channels like social, email/push, influencers, paid ads, events, and incentives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead go-to-market strategy for product and feature launches such as parlays, from planning through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and report on the performance of product marketing initiatives to inform ongoing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think big about the future of prediction markets and how Coinbase can use them to better predict outcomes and bring awareness to those predictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of marketing experience within the trading/crypto or FinTech space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of ideating and implementing growth strategies on products, and working closely with product teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated track record of creating customer segmentation and insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced quantitative and deductive skills, with the ability to distinguish between signal and noise and make data-guided decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate effectively across multiple teams to drive go-to-market execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preference for experience in prediction markets, sports, or gaming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P77089&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$140,080&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$164,800 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
