job-00smkhh:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT HUT 8&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine the ultimate destination for those who want to work at the cutting edge of technology, &lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;energy,&lt;/span&gt; and infrastructure. Hut&amp;nbsp;8 is on a mission to build and operate some of the world’s largest data centers for next-generation computing workloads, including AI, Colocation, Cloud, and Bitcoin Mining. We are proud to offer interesting and challenging opportunities for individuals who want to build teams, solve problems, and make an impact from day one. If you’re an ambitious individual looking for a career that is as rewarding as it is challenging, you’ve come to the right place.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Commissioning Field Engineer to support the testing, verification, and turnover of critical infrastructure systems across our data center and mission-critical facility portfolio. This is a hands-on, field-oriented role responsible for executing commissioning programs from pre-functional testing through integrated system verification. The role is project-based, which means assignment locations will vary — candidates must be comfortable with travel and potential relocation to support active project sites across our growing footprint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Some of the key responsibilities you should expect are the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute pre-functional, functional, and integrated system commissioning activities across mechanical, electrical, and controls systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support startup and commissioning of critical infrastructure including UPS systems, generators, switchgear, PDUs, CRAC/CRAH units, chillers, and BMS/EPMS platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document commissioning activities, test results, deficiencies, and resolutions in accordance with project commissioning plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate closely with general contractors, subcontractors, equipment vendors, and the owner&#39;s engineering team to sequence and execute commissioning activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct site observations to verify installations are complete and compliant with design drawings and specifications prior to testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify field deficiencies and work with the project team to drive timely resolution before milestone dates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and ensure readiness for operational turnover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate, detailed commissioning records including test reports, punch lists, and equipment start-up logs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce safety protocols and ensure compliance with site-specific safety plans and OSHA standards during all commissioning activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate daily progress, issues, and schedule risks to the project commissioning lead or project manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–5 years of hands-on experience in commissioning, startup, or field engineering within data centers, mission-critical facilities, or large-scale infrastructure projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of mechanical, electrical, and controls systems common to mission-critical environments (UPS, generators, switchgear, cooling, BMS/EPMS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read and interpret construction drawings, single-line diagrams, and equipment submittals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of commissioning documentation requirements including test scripts, punch lists, and turnover packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience coordinating with multiple trades and subcontractors on active construction sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in fast-paced, milestone-driven project environments with shifting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with strong written and verbal communication skills — able to produce clear field reports and communicate issues effectively to project leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to travel to project sites; relocation may be required based on project assignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OSHA 10 or OSHA 30 certification preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with mission-critical infrastructure commissioning (power, cooling, fiber, telecom) is a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must possess and maintain a valid driver&#39;s license; active passport preferred for potential international project assignments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE WORK ENVIRONMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is project-based and will be assigned to active data center construction and commissioning sites within Hut 8&#39;s portfolio. Assignment locations will vary and candidates should expect regular travel with the possibility of extended on-site presence or relocation depending on project needs. Reasonable accommodations will be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions of the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT MAKES HUT 8 A GREAT PLACE TO WORK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hut 8 offers a benefits and wellness program that includes medical, dental, vision, life, and&amp;nbsp;short-term and long-term disability insurance, as well as paid time off.&amp;nbsp;We are proud to invest in building the best team in the industry. At all levels of the organization,&amp;nbsp;we are driven by an entrepreneurial spirit, radical transparency, and relentless growth mentality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Hut 8, you will have the opportunity to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Work with bright, driven peers from a range of educational and professional backgrounds&amp;nbsp;including software development, energy, engineering, entrepreneurship, investment&amp;nbsp;banking, private equity, and management consulting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Design and pitch new products, services, and other initiatives to a leadership team&amp;nbsp;consisting of serial entrepreneurs and seasoned executives and backed by a board of&amp;nbsp;directors consisting of industry veterans of energy, finance, and government&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Debate ideas and alternatives in a truly meritocratic setting where the learning curve is&amp;nbsp;steep and the lessons come from both senior and junior members of the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▶ Build a lifelong network of friends and professional connections at the cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;intersection of technology, energy, and infrastructure&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-0lyphm8:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join us in building the future of finance.&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to democratize finance for all. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cerulli.com/press-releases/cerulli-anticipates-124-trillion-in-wealth-will-transfer-through-2048&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;An estimated $124 trillion of assets&lt;/a&gt; will be inherited by younger generations in the next two decades. The largest transfer of wealth in human history. If you’re ready to be at the epicenter of this historic cultural and financial shift, keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;About the Team + Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Robinhood is assembling an elite team applying advanced technology to the country&#39;s biggest financial challenges. National Impact builds industry-changing products in partnership with the U.S. Government that expands financial access for millions of Americans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The team launched its debut product, Trump Accounts, as the #1 app in the app store and one of the fastest-growing financial products launched to date. The year ahead is about growing and improving this product while expanding into new verticals where Robinhood can partner with government stakeholders to reach millions more Americans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As the lead Product Manager for National Impact, you will own 0-1 products end to end, from initial concept through national rollout, shaping how millions of Americans access, understand, and participate in the financial system. You will set both the strategy and the quality bar for one of Robinhood&#39;s most visible product lines, where craft translates directly into customer trust. You&#39;ll work alongside senior leadership, engineers, designers, researchers, data scientists, and marketers to decide where we play, turn ambiguous regulatory and partnership requirements into straightforward customer experiences, and hold the line on quality through launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This is a rare opportunity to drive outsized impact at the intersection of fintech, consumer product, and public-private partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;The preferred location for this role is New York, NY, in office a minimum of 3 days per week, with comfort traveling to Washington, DC on a semi-regular basis to work directly with our government partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end product for 0-1 launches, from initial concept through national rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Set and execute the product vision and strategy for National Impact, including growing Trump Accounts and identifying the next verticals where a government partnership unlocks financial access at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead a team of engineers, designers, researchers, data scientists, marketers, and cross-functional partners to better understand customers, government stakeholders, and the most pressing barriers to financial access&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Set the quality bar — the copy, flows, edge cases, and launch readiness that make complex financial and government workflows feel simple and trustworthy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Translate ambiguous regulatory, operational, and partnership requirements into clear, dependable customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Partner closely with legal, compliance, policy, operations, finance, communications, and external partners so products get built the right way the first time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Keep teams aligned and moving quickly across product, regulatory, operational, and partnership workstreams, and deliver on time against public commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Communicate strategy, tradeoffs, and the reasoning behind them to senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Foster a culture of ambition, learning, and iteration through experimentation, customer research, and thinking big&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3 print:block print:space-y-1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;5+ years of experience building and shipping high-quality consumer fintech product experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working with 3rd-party partners on large-scale projects to deliver a shared product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;A track record of shipping 0-1 products at scale, beyond prototypes and pilots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong product judgment and the ability to turn ambiguous opportunities into clear strategy, roadmap, and execution plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Ability to operate in unclear, 0-1 situations while sustaining a high quality bar under real time pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience working with legal, compliance, operations, policy, or other regulated-product stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong leadership, communication, and relationship management skills, with experience influencing across highly cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience using research, experimentation, and product analytics to guide decision making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Passion for Robinhood&#39;s mission to democratize finance for all and excitement about building products that can expand financial access at national scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Performance-driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, and equity ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Top-tier benefits to fuel your work, including supplemental health insurance, ancillary insurance, and mental health support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lifestyle wallet—a highly flexible, employer-paid spending account for expenses beyond traditional benefits, such as wellness, childcare, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Time off to recharge, including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, paid volunteer time off, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience with catered meals, events, and comfortable workspaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Monthly commuter stipend to help offset in-office commuting costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In addition to the base pay range listed below, this role is also eligible for bonus opportunities + equity + benefits.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Base pay for the successful applicant will depend on a variety of job-related factors, which may include education, training, experience, location, business needs, or market demands. The expected base pay range for this role is based on the location where the work will be performed and is aligned to one of 3 compensation zones. For other locations not listed, compensation can be discussed with your recruiter during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 1 (Menlo Park, CA; New York, NY; Bellevue, WA; Washington, DC)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$225,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 2 (Denver, CO; Westlake, TX; Chicago, IL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$198,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Zone 3 (Lake Mary, FL; Clearwater, FL; Gainesville, FL)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Click &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to learn more about our Total Rewards, which vary by region and entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If our mission energizes you and you’re ready to build the future of finance, we look forward to seeing your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood provides equal opportunity for all applicants, offers reasonable accommodations upon request, and complies with applicable equal employment and privacy laws. Inclusion is built into how we hire and work—welcoming different backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences so everyone can do their best. Please review the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.robinhood.com/applicantprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for your country of application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1miars4:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Core Infrastructure team within Coinbase&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers/product-groups&quot;&gt;Platform&lt;/a&gt; product group builds the foundational systems that keep Coinbase online, secure, and scalable, owning the compute and networking platforms that power every product and service across the company. As the Group Product Manager for Core Infrastructure &amp;amp; Reliability, you&#39;ll own the product vision and multi-year strategy for Coinbase&#39;s cloud infrastructure, driving the design, operation, and scaling of the systems that underpin hundreds of billions of dollars in annual transaction volume. You&#39;ll partner deeply with Engineering, SRE, Security, and Finance to ensure Coinbase&#39;s infrastructure is reliable, cost-efficient, and resilient across multiple cloud environments and regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product strategy and roadmap for Core Infrastructure, spanning compute, networking, multi-region and multi-cloud architecture, and platform reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen infrastructure reliability and resilience programs, defining platform-level SLOs, capacity planning, failover capabilities, and incident reduction targets to meet the uptime demands of a global financial platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead evaluation and adoption of cloud infrastructure technologies (Kubernetes, service mesh, distributed storage, observability, infrastructure-as-code), making build-vs-buy decisions that balance cost, speed, and long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align infrastructure investments with business priorities, optimize cloud spend, and ensure infrastructure services meet regulatory and compliance requirements across operating jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how Coinbase&#39;s product and engineering teams consume infrastructure by building self-serve capabilities, improving developer experience, and reducing friction across provisioning, deployment, and observability workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive infrastructure cost strategy by analyzing utilization patterns, identifying the highest-leverage optimization opportunities, and translating infrastructure metrics into executive-level investment cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of product management experience, with 5+ years focused on cloud infrastructure, platform engineering, or infrastructure reliability at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of defining and executing multi-year infrastructure platform strategies that delivered measurable improvements in reliability, cost efficiency, or engineering velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth to engage with engineers on compute, networking, storage, Kubernetes, multi-cloud architecture, and distributed systems design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead complex, cross-functional initiatives in regulated, high-trust environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to articulate complex infrastructure strategy, cost tradeoffs, and long-term platform bets to senior and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
