&lt;div&gt;K8s Operations &amp;amp;amp; Vendor Engagement: Develop deep expertise in K3s / Kubernetes, including version management and disaster recovery. Independently identify and reproduce system issues, proactively engage with vendors to drive root cause analysis and resolution — not just workarounds.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg8sAlRnghARn6SBQwMOky5f&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Zero Trust Network Access Governance: Work closely on Zero Trust initiatives, participate in cluster network configuration and troubleshooting, identify device compliance risks, drive remediation of non-compliant devices, and continuously optimize access control policies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgDytf2NWEyTiOUavuwLZZnf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Monitoring &amp;amp;amp; Observability: Build and continuously improve log monitoring systems; proactively surface system risks through alert rules and trend analysis.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgneAzNGIEFC6lGrXaK0LU9g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;AI Agent Implementation: Lead the adoption of AI Agents in security operations — design and deploy AI Agent workflows for log analysis, alert triage, and automated incident remediation (e.g., Multi-step Agents using Claude / GPT with tool-calling), reducing manual intervention and improving response efficiency.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
