&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the opportunity (Posted on behalf of Starchild AI)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Starchild. We are looking for a resourceful and ambitious&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;AI Operations &amp;amp; Research Intern&lt;/strong&gt; based in Florianópolis to join us on this mission. You’ll play an integral role in the team, helping turn ideas and strategies into real, creatively executed initiatives within a fast-moving AI startup environment. 👍&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be working on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support research and analysis across real estate data, investment opportunities, and emerging tech applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in building small tools or quick prototypes (e.g., using Python or no-code/AI tools) to improve workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect, clean, and organize local and online data to support decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with local stakeholders and help drive operational execution on the ground.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to testing ideas and helping move projects from concept to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who will you be working with?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with the founder on day-to-day initiatives and strategic exploration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across different project areas including real estate, agriculture, and tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support coordination with external partners when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What challenges will you face?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across diverse and sometimes ambiguous projects with evolving priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balancing research, execution, and coordination tasks simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Figuring things out independently with limited structure or predefined processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapting quickly and leveraging AI tools to improve efficiency and output quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Student or recent graduate (Computer Science, Systems, Economics, Business, or related fields).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, resourceful, and comfortable with ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic coding skills (Python, data handling, or rapid prototyping).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Florianópolis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spanish proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with social media or content distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Info:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Part-time (~20 hours/week) with flexible working hours (not a standard 9–5).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to convert to a full-time role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly compensation + potential performance bonus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Getting the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re actively seeking talented individuals to join our team outside of our typical hiring schedule. This proactive approach allows us to connect with exceptional candidates like you even before specific positions become available.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On average, successful candidates go through five rounds of interviews and tests. Our hiring process begins by meeting with our People Team, who help facilitate the process of placing you in your new role. You can expect to share your experience and ideas in online video interviews with our hiring team, made up of management and potential new colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Submitting your resume now ensures that you&#39;re first in line when new opportunities arise. By doing so, you&#39;ll have a head start in the selection process and get a chance to showcase your skills and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get started on your application here!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

