&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;SQNAdAhPXoQDo0xCTO0ljS3eghd&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg6jD0nBRV7c2aG8YsCaOufe&quot;&gt;The Legal, Compliance &amp;amp; Finance Data Team builds the data infrastructure powering OKX&#39;s compliance operations globally — TMS, KYC/EDD, CMS, and regulatory reporting across 100+ markets. The compliance data domain is broad but learnable. We expect senior engineers to build deep domain knowledge quickly using AI tooling and structured onboarding.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg6jD0nBRV7c2aG8YsCaOufe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlg6jD0nBRV7c2aG8YsCaOufe&quot;&gt;
