&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlghpKUHFCAgM5XwumoA4HQWd&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Data Engineer to work as a core execution partner to our Compliance Projects. This is a hands-on technical role with real domain ownership — you will own sub-domains end-to-end, not just execute tickets. Strong performance creates a direct route toward the Compliance domain&#39;s technical leadership layer as the team scales.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
