&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Job Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Educational Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Current undergraduate or postgraduate students. Majors in STEM fields such as Statistics, Mathematics, Computer Science, Financial Engineering, or Big Data are preferred.&lt;/p&gt;
