&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Possess solid data analysis capabilities; proficient in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;69&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; to efficiently extract required data from databases; skilled in using &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;143&quot;&gt;Excel&lt;/strong&gt; for data processing.&lt;/p&gt;
