&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Core Competencies:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly sensitive to data, with excellent logical thinking and problem-solving/deconstructing skills; rigorous, detail-oriented, and possesses a strong sense of responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
