&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus9qcafz8J9vhi3nwZgrckWg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;OKX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; runs one of the largest crypto exchange businesses in the world. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-font-italic&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Our institutional banking relationships are central to the next phase of growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;We are hiring a senior banker in Singapore to own the global bank relationship book under a single point of accountability,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;reporting to the Global Head of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;Strategic Partnerships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;This person is the institutional face of OKX to global banks, and the institutional face of global banks inside OKX.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxushHxPgvpIV0pJrijghkWDWe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
