&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XPUidYbQZoB0jqxBD87u3JGHsmc&quot;&gt;This role reports directly to the Founder and will play a critical role in shaping the company’s long-term direction.&lt;/div&gt;
