&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;29&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Communicate clearly and professionally with customers and internal stakeholders throughout the case lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;30&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;31&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Identify root causes of recurring issues and surface findings to team leads and QA to strengthen processes and prevent recurrence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;32&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;33&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Document case details accurately in the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;CRM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; and contribute to knowledge base maintenance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
