&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;35&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Meet individual KPIs including response time, resolution rate, quality scores, and customer satisfaction targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
