&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;53&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Strong interpersonal and communication skills — able to manage difficult customer interactions calmly and reach constructive outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
