&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;55&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Applies sound judgment in non-standard situations; able to assess context, identify the core issue, and determine the most appropriate resolution path.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;56&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;57&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Demonstrates a proactive approach to learning — stays current with product and process updates and applies them immediately in day-to-day work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
