&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience Managing, retaining and growing a book of business $5M-$20M&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent over-performance on key sales or customer success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remarkable discovery skills with customers based in genuine curiosity about their business&lt;/li&gt;
