&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Learning and Development Specialist who can help our Talent Development team design and facilitate high-quality learning experiences. Ideally, you should have a teaching or training background, a strong understanding of how people learn, and a passion for creating impact through education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will create and maintain a broad set of content—including developing new objectives and assessments, and rewriting and reshaping existing content. You’ll work closely with HR partners, subject-matter experts, peer instructional designers, and other external partners as you analyze, design, develop, implement, evaluate, and maintain engaging and effective learning experiences for your colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additional responsibilities of the role will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing multiple projects simultaneously in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment while delivering high-quality work on time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing the research and needs analysis required in the development of content; and mapping course content and learning activities to the appropriate learning objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using a content-development framework to create engaging and effective learning content (e.g., courses, presentations, videos, one-pagers, hands-on activities, assignments)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing learning experiences to support a variety of modalities (e.g., self-paced online training, virtual classroom training, in-person classroom training, or a blend thereof)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitating classroom-based training where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluating feedback and prioritizing updates to improve experiences for future learners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 7-10 years of experience developing, implementing, and improving online and in-person learning experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a BA or MA in instructional design, education, or similar with excellent knowledge of learning theories and instructional-design models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with implementing adult-learning best practices and leading end-to-end instructional design projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to write, edit, and proofread effective copy, instructional text, presentations, and audio and video scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communicator; able to facilitate small and large group sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a highly collaborative mindset; proven able to work with employees across a wide range of disciplines and build credibility throughout an organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in developing relationships with technical and non-technical people alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized with strong project management skills; experienced with managing complex projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

