job-0b3qink:
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Mkjldw1y7oPwHJxRqbwlN9uvgGg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-LNLad76GrosXG2x3QlLle43sgMd&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Singapore, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-LNLad76GrosXG2x3QlLle43sgMd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SDSVdj7amoWRq5xqG5IlpAtngTf&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BP5IdIy6YoqZCkxHPIplqzJ6gUb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LWdEdPeOrof046xSIoHlcaN6g6z&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7SCdPjFcosBDqxrYJClc78lgne&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CFAcdGaseoo2ZVxCyY3lHRUigng&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-OM8UdjCX6ocQsSxDd6XlXJwkgsb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PT7AdLgB5oDMvqxyunqlSUqLgKd&quot;&gt;We are looking for a highly capable &lt;strong&gt;Senior Strategy Project Manager (VIP/Institutions)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our CEO Office department, supporting strategic initiatives across our VIP and Institutional business domains.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cg0gd9Y9Wogch9x248ClRHEIghz&quot;&gt;This role sits at the intersection of strategy, execution, data analytics, and AI transformation. You will partner closely with senior leadership to drive high-impact, cross-functional initiatives spanning business growth, operational scaling, and AI-enabled ways of working.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cg0gd9Y9Wogch9x248ClRHEIghz&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NlWxdGOIMoVw0ixlidblAWgfgK7&quot;&gt;Beyond program execution, we are looking for strong analytical and AI-native thinkers who can structure complex business problems, leverage data and AI-assisted workflows to drive insights, and help scale organizational effectiveness through automation and intelligent operational systems.&amp;nbsp;We are open to high-caliber talent from technology, consulting, fintech, platform, or other fast-paced environments who thrive in ambiguity, operate with strong ownership, and combine strategic thinking with execution excellence.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WRS1dpo2loYAD9x0XKJlrfPDgpc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h1 class=&quot;heading-1 ace-line old-record-id-Wo5Fd5BDvogU5ZxrWmelsPbFgUg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Kkh3d6E1Wo0rtGxlt8flvpaugnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Execution &amp;amp; Organizational Scaling&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TlqydMlPnoQGvBxOLYelblhEgIg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Support strategic initiatives related to VIP and Institutional business growth, operational efficiency, client experience, and scalable platform capabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YiGQdvmVOo03KNxIkmglaXf1gDg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner with senior leadership to translate high-level strategies into scalable execution roadmaps and operating mechanisms.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YaWRdhucSoRKCBxtgatlylZBgwg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
