&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgfQdYUjfeIUMoTPYhbdn7Hc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prior experience at a crypto exchange, traditional prime broker, custodian, or institutional liquidity provider.&lt;/div&gt;
