&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TZd7dZ4N3o9LUBxNmbCuSbSdsnt&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;CRM/A/B testing (Braze/Iterable); Python for ad-hoc analysis.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
