&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ARMWdtKDIowwlyxaSOuuzEqssIf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;At the OKX Liquidity Platform department, our Risk &amp;amp; Analytics Engineering team plays a pivotal role in ensuring the stability, efficiency, and resilience of our liquidity-providing business. As the guardians of risk management, we design and maintain cutting-edge systems that deliver real-time insights into trading activity and market risk across spot, derivatives, and event contract markets. The team operates at the intersection of technology and finance, leveraging expertise in quantitative analysis, system engineering, and market microstructure to build tools that safeguard our trading operations under volatile conditions. Our solutions are fully independent from trading logic, decoupled by design, and connected to 20+ trading venues — empowering us to monitor and manage risk effectively across diverse scenarios and asset classes. If you are passionate about the fusion of finance and technology and eager to tackle complex challenges in the crypto ecosystem, we welcome you to join us and help shape the future of risk management at OKX. This role is open to Senior and Staff-level candidates; scope and title will be calibrated based on experience and impact.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQ1gdeOLNoEsm2xDroWukiwGs3g&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GEUbd7sWzobkyGxnNNAufQyQsXe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build the Next-Generation Risk System (Green-Field): Join a green-field initiative to re-architect and implement our next-generation risk platform in Java from the ground up. You&#39;ll have meaningful ownership over technology choices, architecture, and engineering culture for a system that will become the backbone of risk management across our liquidity business.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop Advanced Risk Solutions: Design and implement internal risk monitoring and management systems tailored to strategic and business needs — including real-time market data analysis, PnL and risk calculations, automated alerting, reporting tools, circuit-breaking strategies, and high-availability architecture.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strengthen Risk Controls: Optimize existing risk control frameworks and logic to enhance system efficiency, prevent or minimize losses during market volatility, and ensure effective risk mitigation under diverse market scenarios.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Continuous Improvement: Collaborate with risk managers and product managers to gather feedback and refine the risk management system through iterative development.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive Cross-Functional Projects: Oversee project progress and coordinate with trading desk developers, risk managers, operations teams, and other key stakeholders to deliver high-quality solutions on time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkWsdUpKpouMsxxrbMluoheLsQc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Mentor &amp;amp; Share Knowledge: Guide junior engineers in establishing best practices and methodologies for building and maintaining risk control systems.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-ZvAmdvgIGoKyiHxjBTiu68Kcs9d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Passion for Finance &amp;amp; Technology: Strong enthusiasm for trading, blockchain, and the broader financial industry.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F7Q5dSyFPonFgJx4HDKu09ObsMh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Basic Financial Knowledge: Working understanding of financial markets, instruments, and core concepts such as PnL, margin, leverage, and market risk. Prior experience building or operating risk systems is a strong plus.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Educational Background: Bachelor&#39;s degree or higher in Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics, Physics, or a related technical discipline. A combined background in finance is highly advantageous.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Industry Experience: 5+ years of experience in quantitative trading or front-office technology roles at exchanges, banks, or investment institutions. Experience with market-making teams, crypto exchanges, or event-contract / prediction-market platforms is a significant plus.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Programming: Advanced Python skills; Java proficiency strongly preferred given the greenfield re-platforming work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Data &amp;amp; Messaging: SQL, Redis, and Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Cloud: Familiarity with major cloud platforms such as AliCloud or AWS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;APIs: Practical experience with RESTful APIs and web services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Environment: Comfortable navigating Linux/Unix shell environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X2QpdbNA3okEKcxYKY3ufqOXsQh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;Agentic Programming Fluency: Familiarity with agentic programming concepts (LLM-powered coding agents, tool use, multi-step autonomous workflows) and actively using them — either in your day-to-day work or through serious self-directed learning. Hands-on use of agentic coding tools such as Claude Code or Codex on real production work is a significant plus. We expect engineers on this team to amplify themselves with AI tooling, not just talk about it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BUc6dfFyioKLJyxdlHGudKExsjg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Compliance Mindset: Strong aptitude for risk control and compliance, with the ability to adapt systems to evolving control and regulatory requirements.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BUc6dfFyioKLJyxdlHGudKExsjg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Collaborative Skills: Strong logical thinking, effective teamwork, and excellent communication skills. Proven ability to organize and align resources to solve complex problems and achieve cross-departmental objectives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UhJ9dmqAXoYf0Rxmj2MuiHGesRc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
