job-0p3gis0:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Iberia Sales team is responsible for expanding Stripe’s footprint across Spain and Portugal. We focus on both winning net-new logo accounts and driving strategic growth within high-potential existing customers. We move with urgency, operate with focus, and pride ourselves on delivering strong commercial results through disciplined outbound execution, strategic account management, and high-quality customer engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Account Executive for Iberia&lt;/strong&gt;, you will drive revenue expansion across the Spanish and Portuguese markets. Whether acquiring net-new logos or driving deep adoption and cross-sell strategies within key existing accounts, you will act as a trusted advisor to senior business leadership. You&#39;ll execute long-term sales strategies, engage internal and external stakeholders, align on technical and business requirements, build value in competitive situations, and lead commercial negotiations to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive commercial revenue growth across Spain and Portugal by winning new accounts, expanding current partnerships, or both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle—from prospecting and pipeline generation to account planning, upselling, and closing complex transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional teams, including SDRs, Product Sales specialists, Solutions Engineering, Account Management, Risk, and Legal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans to increase product adoption and unlock new revenue streams within target business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead deal strategy, account mapping, and commercial negotiations for large, high-impact business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Regional Partnerships and Marketing to build pipeline, boost brand awareness, and deepen regional market penetration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of sales or enterprise account management experience, preferably selling technical products, with a proven track record of top performance in the Spanish and/or Portuguese market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in either net-new customer acquisition (hunting), strategic account growth and retention (growing), or a combination of both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand technical requirements and craft tailored solutions across a complex multi-product ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and executing account plans spanning multiple business units within complex organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal and presentation skills, with a track record of building lasting relationships with key internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead complex commercial negotiations involving bespoke agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate effectively in a fast-paced, fast-changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or professional fluency in English and Spanish; fluency in Portuguese is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in (or willing to relocate to) Madrid, Spain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in payments, fintech, or SaaS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background working within a fast-scaling growth stage or enterprise technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Portuguese.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

job-09tlzo5:
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d6d5c6caa36&quot;&gt;Founded 20 years ago and headquartered in Chicago, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; Group of financial services firms has grown to more than 600 people operating throughout North America, Europe and Asia. Since spinning out of a large brokerage firm in 2016, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; Trading has rapidly scaled as an independent proprietary trading firm utilizing its own capital, trading strategies, and risk management methodologies to provide liquidity to worldwide financial markets and hedging opportunities to commodity producers and users. Now, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; group affiliates include two broker dealers, a cryptocurrency market making firm, and a bourgeoning investment adviser.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Overview: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db7b8c101de&quot;&gt;We are seeking to hire an Equity Research Analyst who will immerse themselves in the information landscape, staying abreast of real-time news developments to help our trading strategies. This role is pivotal for providing timely insights and analysis that feed into the critical decision-making processes within our dynamic trading environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;706&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6d17a07f558d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and Mandarin. Working hours are 7am - 5pm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with traders and other analysts to communicate significant market events instantly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze broad macro trends, closely monitor geopolitical developments, and perform deep dives into company financials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construct and uphold detailed company and market databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;db73e6d3f6c4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read, write and speak fluent Mandarin Chinese and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Accounting, Finance, Economics, Mathematics/Statistics, or a related field. 1-3 years of experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent initiator with a robust skill set in analytical problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical proficiency in Excel and experience with Bloomberg or Reuters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong interest in following the news, market movements, and an understanding of their impact on trading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong work ethic with the capability to assimilate quickly in a demanding, high-pressure environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SQL, Python, or other programming languages is useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in buy-side or sell-side research is beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is not accepting unsolicited resumes from search firms. Only search firms with valid, written agreements with &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; should submit resumes in response to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;’s posted positions. All resumes submitted by search firms to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; via e-mail, the Internet, personal delivery, facsimile, or any other method without a valid written agreement shall be deemed the sole property of &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;, and no fee will be paid in the event the candidate is hired by &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;DV&lt;/span&gt; is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-1fuxemh:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AKmIdFMeNoZsMxxQTe5urisdsqf&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AKmIdFMeNoZsMxxQTe5urisdsqf&quot;&gt;Digital Copywriter&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus1veglkNDsCbYMfa3pkDbKg&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusyILJ9Gzprew5tVCuZBfyab&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world&#39;s largest cryptocurrency exchanges with over 80 million users and counting. With a vision to be the crypto ark of the world, we provide a comprehensive suite of products — Spot, Derivatives, Earn, TradFi, Alpha and more — to both retail and institutional clients. Ultimately, we endeavor to enable our users to achieve their dreams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus5Phj7u42N3LNkYaHzFshff&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxQ5sdsAin4OjJQBZHYsWne&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Copywriter/Senior Digital &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Copyw&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;riter &lt;/strong&gt;to join our growing Copy and Translation team. We are more than writers, but skilled communicators, marketers and storytellers. With your mastery of prose and big picture thinking, you will weave seemingly disparate pieces of information and industry trends to form a cohesive narrative that fulfills our business objectives, inspires and engages our audience, and above all, driving home the message of our brand proposition.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus39V1v2Dk6iiU1x9hN6P9Hf&quot;&gt;Key reponsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoLudCW55odFLLxjCkjuv0Nbsug&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Create clear and user-friendly content for Help Center articles and knowledge base entries, translating complex product logic into actionable guidance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bojcd91yooyP2UxsU8muhTGwsmd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Craft original campaign messaging that reflects our brand values and supports marketing objectives.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IwymdJVU6o1qN5xgBtIuCC8yskh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Create engaging, persuasive copy across multiple channels, including websites, system communications, email campaigns, and UX/UI, in line with our editorial style guide and UI component guidelines.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IkBJdx7dKocHULxvX1GuRy0xsgh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Edit and enhance existing content to ensure consistency with marketing strategy, tone, and positioning.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YgHCdb0YjoT6wXxRAUsuVyGvsec&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Partner closely with Product Managers and Project Managers to deliver clear, concise messaging for both everyday users and seasoned traders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qz6wdKBgso9JWFxBdYhuLeamsqb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with UX designers, marketers, and subject matter experts to ensure content is visually cohesive, on-brand, and aligned with intended outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NoNbd5zw3or2cixLyhUuJVGasyg&quot;&gt;Key requirements (updated)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrVcdzSZVorRgRxAbFGubQubsub&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;3+ years of experience in copywriting, journalism, UX writing, or closely related content roles, with a Bachelor’s degree in Creative Writing, Journalism, Advertising, Marketing, English, or a related field.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A7w7duzVLo2XjAx3UNQuH031s1d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to Integrate AI Workflows in daily work to optimise work delivery performance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U9w3d1p49onsLMxBjm0u3tNdsFd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong technical writing skills, with the ability to produce clear, structured, and user-friendly content, especially for &lt;strong&gt;Help Center and knowledge base articles&lt;/strong&gt;, and to translate complex product logic into simple, actionable guidance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TQsXdL7JgoCjxfx45VJute19syh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chinese language proficiency is required, &lt;/strong&gt;including the ability to read and understand Chinese PRDs and communicate effectively with Chinese-speaking stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LsycdKfDhodlHSxOJKpuaNE1s7c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience in cryptocurrency, fintech, or traditional finance is preferred.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G5wUd42j8oTZNZxaAlWuBFpSstb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A product-oriented and flexible writer with a strong understanding of product workflows, logic, and the user journey, able to work closely with product teams, accurately interpret PRDs, and create effective user-facing content across multiple mediums (web, system communications, email campaigns, UX/UI).&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WRMbdCkdaobDncx2LN7ugEgHspb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to work independently in a fast-paced environment and deliver under tight timelines.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4hydhSFMoLDubxujPQuEGMSsxd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong project and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to prioritize tasks, manage multiple projects simultaneously, collaborate cross-functionally, handle feedback effectively, and maintain clarity and alignment in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IjGedF1TMomVtoxh8CcuOBogske&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively with cross-functional teams and stakeholders from diverse backgrounds.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-N2bhdgZhworrJIxod6XuycWls9d&quot;&gt;Good to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OakPdyLQko7peexPUOmuDSQhsJf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience using GenAI tools as part of a writing and content development workflow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SYLOdsfiIoBik9xC2vXuk9FZsog&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability to thrive in a highly collaborative environment with multidisciplinary cross-functional teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OwOUdS5k2oOOoWxen4vuD2Gss3e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Portfolio or work samples demonstrating strategic and/or brand-building concepts executed across multiple platforms.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X8bZdHCEGogA4BxsWAouxyXysUb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;2+ years of agency experience or equivalent creative industry experience across all media, including digital, social, long-form content.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

job-1064e52:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
