&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: Web3 Product Manager – Crypto Launch &amp;amp; AI-Driven Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Abu Dhabi （need relocation）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chinese Language Skill is a must.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager with deep expertise in trading system architecture, order matching logic, user experience, and onchain assets. The ideal candidate is also forward-thinking and genuinely passionate about the tokenization of financial assets, including Tokenized Stocks, Pre-IPO, RWA Yield, and other onchain innovations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Trading Product Design &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the planning, design, and ongoing iteration of spot trading products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the end-to-end implementation of new trading features, continuously enhancing the user trading experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore and drive the design and application of AI-powered trading tools (e.g., smart order routing, assisted market analysis).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of core trading system logic, including order matching, order state flows, and market depth management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CeDeFi &amp;amp; RWA Innovation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the strategic direction for spot onchain business, bringing DeFi innovations into the centralized exchange environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the launch of CeDeFi products, bridging onchain and offchain trading experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead productization efforts for emerging asset classes such as RWA, Tokenized Stocks, Pre-IPO, and onchain yield products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
