&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of order matching engines, trading workflows, and core trading system logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product design skills, with proven ability to drive 0-to-1 product planning and execution independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the crypto asset market and a consistent track record of staying up to date with industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
