&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within the Asset Operations team and is responsible for the full lifecycle management of the platform&#39;s digital assets — spanning new asset onboarding, post-listing maintenance, liquidity and risk monitoring, yield optimisation, and asset value management. Through cross-functional collaboration with Wallet, Security, Finance, Compliance, and Marketing teams, the role ensures assets operate securely, generate stable returns, and maintain strong platform visibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Asset Onboarding &amp;amp; Maintenance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evaluation, testing, and launch of new tokens and chain assets, including mainnet deployment, parameter configuration, fee adjustments, and network verification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously monitor asset performance and coordinate with Wallet, Security, and Finance teams to ensure fund security, sufficient positions, and stable operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Post-Listing Asset Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage ongoing operations and maintenance of listed assets, including contract upgrades, token rebranding, asset repricing, and announcement publishing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track ecosystem developments (mainnet upgrades, contract migrations, etc.), assess their potential impact on the platform, and develop response strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Risk Events &amp;amp; Incident Response&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor, flag, and rapidly respond to asset-related risk events including network anomalies, price irregularities, contract issues, and position gaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate across Wallet, Security, and Finance teams to execute risk isolation and loss mitigation measures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead post-incident reviews and process improvements; maintain and enhance emergency response mechanisms and SOPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Process Management &amp;amp; Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain SOPs covering asset onboarding, maintenance, upgrades, and risk handling to improve overall execution efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Wallet, Security, Finance, Compliance, and Marketing teams to ensure project timelines and launch schedules are met&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular reporting on asset operations metrics and project progress; drive continuous process optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above; background in Finance, Economics, Blockchain, or related fields preferred; familiarity with traditional securities or relevant financial certifications is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in crypto asset operations or project management; solid understanding of major public chains, stablecoins, and RWA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of user behaviour, marketing dynamics, and asset value logic within the crypto industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with digital asset regulatory frameworks and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset with the ability to independently analyse and report on key metrics such as trading volume, AUM, and yield&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional communication and coordination skills; proven ability to drive collaboration across technical, security, and finance teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in both Chinese and English (spoken and written); able to conduct professional communication with overseas project teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilient under pressure with strong problem-solving ability; genuine long-term passion and conviction for the crypto industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

