&lt;div&gt;Comfort operating in an AI-augmented workflow: prompting agents, reading structured outputs, making final calls under time pressure.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SqEZdQT69odBjLxhLqHlmqIFgYg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
