&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlge9UcGKDMpk3xGn3QMoqpvf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Familiarity with risk parameter design (margin tiers, liquidation engines, insurance funds) at an exchange or financial institution.&lt;/div&gt;
