&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgPddYjjH0BNmFO4dRoRw0Sd&quot;&gt;We are open to two types of candidates for this role:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
