&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlgOTpSb3am3DiPi3Ved1zyBf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(b) High-Potential Talent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
