&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AiPQdXfdFoecDex1OG7lJgYoghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EuWHdkH30o9F82xVwqglNxGqgEg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the &lt;strong&gt;product planning, requirement analysis, and solution design&lt;/strong&gt; of the AI Native engineering platform, and drive continuous product evolution and adoption.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ukokd8mYloId0FxdPpBlwRbcgCc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop a deep understanding of the end-to-end engineering lifecycle, and translate the core scenarios and collaboration patterns of product, design, engineering, QA, and operations teams into structured product solutions.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKwAdisylo6UZIxXiBfl3byfgEg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
