&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxuslsyQOGHoiYb47TiA1n51Th&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxustOiFVk8C3Uy4rotl5Nem5f&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q479dQIlZozY6cxcPNFuoY1rsxe&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKOAdw3kVoh5EQxcr2juP3i0sTb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxus9qcafz8J9vhi3nwZgrckWg&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;KTQMdk22joFT3Px06Wrl6R3Qgpg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPfvdMwkVolRzsx0Jl9le2rigng&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;FHGWdRXH1oqajNxB4ril1kf6gbg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GC2EdiyAeoWUDDxHDv3lQ0V4gbh&quot;&gt;AI is not a feature at OKX. It is the next fundamental layer of how we serve users, operate at scale, and maintain trust in a regulated, global market.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuPYd9LnNoSQADxa402lCZhzg6c&quot;&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Director/Vice President of Product, AI &amp;amp; Agent&lt;/strong&gt; to own OKX&#39;s full AI product agenda — outward, through a crypto-native AI assistant that transforms how users experience our platform; and inward, through agentic systems that make our operations intelligent, auditable, and scalable. This is a single role with a unified mandate: building the AI layer that defines OKX&#39;s next decade.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxushHxPgvpIV0pJrijghkWDWe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;KTQMdk22joFT3Px06Wrl6R3Qgpg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;FHGWdRXH1oqajNxB4ril1kf6gbg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JG8mdwDzLo26iuxFgYnlMEy0gxe&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-Facing AI&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the strategy and execution of OKX&#39;s conversational AI assistant — an experience that lets users onboard, trade, stay informed, and get support through natural language. You will define what this product is, how it earns user trust, and how it deepens over time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JG8mdwDzLo26iuxFgYnlMEy0gxe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WRTbdkePtoIZvjxKaFPlxzqsgpc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational AI &amp;amp; Agent Systems&lt;/strong&gt; Own the agentic AI roadmap for OKX&#39;s internal functions — compliance, risk, fraud, and operations. You will identify the highest-leverage workflows, lead their systematic transformation into agent-driven systems, and ensure every output is traceable and regulatorily defensible.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WRTbdkePtoIZvjxKaFPlxzqsgpc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RGvPdiex0oWk0rxzDpzlHG3ugxc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Platform&lt;/strong&gt; Own the product design of shared infrastructure that powers both mandates — orchestration, evaluation, safety architecture, and the governance layer that makes AI products configurable and auditable across all markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusWnZPeJsdMU53QGew90VQeh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For In You&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;FHGWdRXH1oqajNxB4ril1kf6gbg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OzridTKEMoviPwxylndlVyiTgyL&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;12+ years in product &amp;amp; tech, with 5+ years in a senior leadership role owning technically complex products at scale&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ICVmdkXCVoNghxxTHtTl84YZgBf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven track record shipping conversational AI or agentic AI products — as the owner, not a contributor&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk4qdrPsqou1gWxP6fYlXzVvg6c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Deep familiarity with LLM product architecture: multi-agent systems, RAG, tool use, evaluation, and safety design&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZmkWdcIzzo8ZdsxDt74lQyaog5e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience operating in regulated environments where auditability and explainability are hard requirements&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ea6ydekH1orQf8x0Jfwlp9hogvc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong consumer product instinct alongside operational product rigor&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IgFCd8udJoa6g3xIUe6lwixegGy&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fluency in financial markets and what it takes to earn user and institutional trust&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
