&lt;div&gt;Executive-level communication in English and Mandarin&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusWnZPeJsdMU53QGew90VQeh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;FHGWdRXH1oqajNxB4ril1kf6gbg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XP9SdDQzroPnKWxq9qrlAZEPgLc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Background in crypto, fintech, or financial services at global scale&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUwSdIXO6ocQ3JxjgUQls6RVgfY&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Graduate degree in a technical field&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OpVmdrSRmoY2j4x3aAJl9ZKCg8d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with successful Conversational AI or Agentic AI products&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusWnZPeJsdMU53QGew90VQeh&quot;&gt;Why this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;FHGWdRXH1oqajNxB4ril1kf6gbg&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZsDhdU5L3oaPTzxGnN2l8qkigmg&quot;&gt;OKX operates at a scale where the gap between what AI can do and what we have built is still enormous. This role exists to close that gap — on both sides of the platform, simultaneously. If that is the kind of problem you want to own, we want to talk.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusWnZPeJsdMU53QGew90VQeh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Gb04dtjtMoHmldxfAjXuI6P4snC&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Competitive total compensation package&lt;/div&gt;
