&lt;div&gt;Strong ability to model and frame complex problems; defines the right problem boundaries and system abstractions before reaching for solutions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AdKvd1JiUoVV6txGAXTlMMPagTK&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven ability to constrain, guide, and evaluate AI outputs — decomposing complex engineering requirements into AI-executable task sequences&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M9XRd17A2obEEZxd1dEllNQGgye&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience establishing team-level AI working patterns; familiar with and having practiced AI Spec-Driven Development&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SECPd3F2FoZbjYxDo7ClWwqIgab&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintains high standards for code quality and system design integrity alongside — not despite — AI-assisted development&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OyC4dSaIZoQjqqxt6D3liNwMgce&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Soft Skills (Core)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H4jqdaw0EovlfBxCpUnlXwxUg1d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong ownership: treats team goals as personal goals — proactive, accountable, clears obstacles without being asked&lt;/div&gt;
