&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APNed22pRoHC2KxX7s3liCTAgCh&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Sound judgment: makes high-quality decisions under incomplete information — decisive and accountable&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G6CndNFAooP6szxnfZNly8HagRb&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Execution muscle: makes things actually land, not just live in decks and proposals&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T6Ksdy8IqoJrSixwlkDlk8LYg6d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fast learner: thrives in a fast-moving industry; rapidly absorbs new technologies, business dynamics, and regulatory shifts and converts them into team action&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SYF2dN9pVoFPucxTExjl2gbVgFf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
