&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-font-italic&quot; data-eleid=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please note that Hong Kong is a group-level service hub, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;OKX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;does not carry on a business of operating a virtual asset trading platform in Hong Kong.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
