&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of hands-on experience developing AI/ML solutions in areas such as computer vision, AI agents, multimodal learning, vision-LLM, or generative video/image modeling — including significant experience deploying AI/ML systems into production.&lt;/div&gt;
