&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of database systems such as PostgreSQL and/or DynamoDB, including replication, sharding, and performance optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with streaming and event-driven architectures using technologies such as Kafka, Flink, or similar systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern data platforms and compute engines such as Spark, Delta Lake, or equivalent large-scale data processing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead complex technical initiatives, define long-term architecture, and collaborate across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
