&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SfTNdXdRLofZjexdGv9lcoUAgEb&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KC2ldnJUPoZbzLx1TvelnkMhgZb&quot;&gt;We are seeking an experienced Overseas Operations Manager (P2P) to drive strategic growth and operational excellence across key overseas markets.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4JLdgABMoaL5HxehDnlQThjgdd&quot;&gt;This role requires deep understanding of P2P market mechanics, merchant ecosystem dynamics, regional payment infrastructures, and competitive positioning. The ideal candidate has hands-on experience operating P2P markets at leading exchanges (e.g., Binance, Bybit, Bitget) and can independently formulate expansion strategies while delivering measurable growth outcomes.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KnYZd8wNdoYDjvxLYSSlStMmgrc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
