&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-3&quot;&gt;Data Monitoring &amp;amp; Competitive Intelligence&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
