job-1b2xnb8:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Indirect Procurement Specialist to help our Procurement team provide sourcing and procurement support to several of Jane Street’s other internal teams, including Office Administration, HR, Travel, Recruiting, Creative Engagement, Accounting, and Facilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with stakeholders to plan an approach for upcoming needs and renewals, understand key requirements and expected outcomes for each project, develop and lead RFPs, and analyze and level bid responses. Negotiating agreements with suppliers will be a key focus of the role, ensuring that a contract encapsulates all of our requirements in collaboration with our Legal team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once a contract is completed, you will raise purchase orders and oversee any invoicing discrepancies. Throughout this process, you’ll oversee supplier communications and work with stakeholders to build strong supplier relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an independent and organized individual who can jump into the work to make an immediate impact. The right person for this role will have strong interpersonal skills and enjoy working with people from all different backgrounds.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 5+ years of related procurement experience, including a deep understanding of RFPs, MSAs, and SOWs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven leader with experience overseeing complex projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communicator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who requires minimal supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resourceful and comfortable navigating through ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiator, collaborator, and project manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective at managing large sourcing projects and daily transactional workload&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with creating POs with P2P systems (e.g., Oracle, Ariba, Coupa, Workday)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable analyzing and redlining contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a desire to understand the big picture as well as the intricate details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible team player; willing to support other workflows and categories as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel category management experience is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-07y2oly:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a seasoned Lead Technical Recruiter with a precision attitude and a deep understanding of the quantitative landscape? Look no further! Ripple is seeking a Lead Technical Recruiter to join our dynamic team and help us secure the elite talent necessary to drive our high-frequency growth and algorithmic innovation. As the Lead Technical Recruiter, you will be a crucial architect of our talent pipeline, owning the end-to-end process for specialized Quantitative Engineers and Researchers. You will partner closely with hiring managers to identify and attract the world&#39;s brightest mathematical and technical minds.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will have the opportunity to work with a versatile team and play a key role in crafting the future of Ripple. You will work closely with our Talent Acquisition team to develop and implement a sophisticated recruiting strategy that aligns with our strategic objectives, while providing an exceptional candidate experience for high-stakes talent. Join us and be part of a company that is revolutionizing the way we think about global payments through innovative engineering!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the specialized recruiting process from sourcing to complex offer negotiations for Quantitative Engineering and Algorithmic Trading positions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop high-level strategies to meet aggressive hiring goals, working alongside Engineering Leads to align technical priorities and performance objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
