job-1gdt7rk:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Logos is a movement supporting the development of the decentralised web. Logos technologies lay the foundations for a freer internet upon which communities can evolve into network states. Each protocol in the Logos stack seeks to empower its users while upholding civil liberties and fundamental freedoms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;** No need to apply or submit any information via this application (reference only). If you&#39;re interested in this role, please click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://logos.co/movement#activist-builder&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more and apply.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Logos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Logos is a movement to rebuild civil society using decentralised technologies. Logos is a sovereign, decentralised technology stack that allows for the creation of new types of corruption-resistant social institutions. It is designed to champion personal liberties and collective abundance through upgrading human governance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an open source movement, we need coders, creatives, and anyone passionate to help us build, own, and govern it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Circles initiative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://circles.logos.co/&quot;&gt;Logos Circles &lt;/a&gt;are self-organised groups that take action to solve issues that matter locally. They are a form of parallel governance: instead of reforming broken or rigged institutions, they build better ones that live on or are sustained by the network. Circles respond to local needs, build trust on the ground through solving problems, and experiment with real-world applications of Logos tech and values.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://logos.co/events/&quot;&gt;Upcoming circles &lt;/a&gt;near you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for Activist Builder Volunteers who are passionate about the use of Blockchain and privacy-preserving technology to provide alternate forms of governance that support local communities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will commit to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 2 hours per week for a minimum of 6 months, though one year is preferable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-Steward meet-ups, introduce Logos, and help guide the group on anything technical; development needs, leveraging existing OS resources etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help onboard Circle members to Logos, e.g. running a Logos node, or connecting builders with relevant Logos team members to support integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create space for others to contribute, grow, and take ownership over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project manage the delivery of any technical elements related to winnable issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spread the Logos love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with core contributors from Logos&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will commit to&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training on the Logos stack and how it works&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training and support on how circles are organised&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a dedicated “buddy” from our internal contributors who will be your POC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support during the circles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help in finding a location for the circle&#39;s meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a limited stipend to support essential Circle needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in software development / engineering and/or Computer Science&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be aligned with the Logos mission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have enough free time to dedicate to the circles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a deep level of technological knowledge so you can help apply the Logos stack to winnable issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be passionate about social issues and have desire to be part of the change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;** No need to apply or submit any information via this application (reference only). If you&#39;re interested in this role, please click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://logos.co/movement#activist-builder&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn more and apply.&lt;/h3&gt;

