job-07vgye7:
&lt;h2&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Stripe&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Link team builds the premier consumer network for next-generation commerce, leveraging our base of 300M+ registered consumers to pioneer the future of Identity, Consumer Finance, and AI-driven transactions. While our foundation was built on high-conversion merchant payments and a flexible digital wallet, we are expanding far beyond. We are building the infrastructure for a world where AI agents transact on your behalf, stablecoins go mainstream, and identity dictates how money moves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We think of Link as the wallet for the internet — and we&#39;re building for what&#39;s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build the Link App experience across web and native — building the wallet product consumers need to feel confident, excited, and inspired by the new ways payments and identity are changing online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That means being a true champion of the consumer: end-to-end owner of core features, a cross-functional partner to Engineering, Design, and GTM, and an active voice in shaping Link&#39;s consumer strategy alongside Link leadership. You&#39;ll define, build, and scale new and existing products — informed by consumer insights and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a technical PM who operates with a high degree of autonomy and drive. You care deeply about craft and impact — the only thing that really matters to you is getting well-built products into users&#39; hands. You&#39;re probably already exploring how AI is changing how products get built and what it means for the PM role; you might even have a few half-finished side projects that prove it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the consumer perspective — spend time with users, partner closely with Engineering, GTM, and Operations, and synthesize feedback and market signals into clear product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the voice of the Link consumer, both within the team and across Stripe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and drive an ambitious roadmap, from expanding core capabilities to leading nascent initiatives through to maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish team pace, clear prioritization, and rigorous execution standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner deeply with Engineering, Design, Data Science, Marketing, Sales, and Operations to ship cohesive, frictionless experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in a product or technical role, with experience shipping world-class consumer products at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High taste, design empathy, and sharp judgment — can put yourself in the shoes of consumers and be a steward of crafting great experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigorous with data — comfortable digging into metrics, writing SQL when needed, and thinking from first principles to deliver the right results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire for continuous product improvement; able to optimize for shipping a portfolio of small, medium, and large releases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership mindset — works on whatever it takes to solve problems and delight consumers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication, with a talent for distilling user problems into precise, actionable framing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing high-stakes external partnerships — aligning on milestones and executing integrations end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives with a high level of autonomy and responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on consumer financial products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building brand new products or working in a startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with GTM teams to bring a new product to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

job-0nnjjes:
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;OKX will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Singapore, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;3&quot;&gt;About OKX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom. OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves. Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles:&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er. OKX is part of OKG, a group that brings the value of Blockchain to users around the world, through our leading products OKX, OKX Wallet, OKLink and more.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;About The Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextContainer text-align-left&quot; data-partial-quote-enabled=&quot;true&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Q2KgdAwZrok9ivxWH1VlELmwgyc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxlged9wauGRPLXaCLneYrRmzd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;The DEX Token Markets team at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;OKX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; Web3 empowers users with a robust, data-driven platform designed for real-time market tracking and analysis across multiple DEXs and blockchains. Our platform provides traders with essential tools such as real-time charts, trade feeds, customizable token watchlists, price alerts, and advanced screeners that track key metrics like volume, price changes, and liquidity. With support for over 40 chains and hundreds of thousands of trading pairs, we offer one of the most comprehensive decentralized market monitoring solutions available. Trusted by millions of traders worldwide, our platform is an indispensable resource for navigating the fast-paced world of crypto trading and investment. As part of this team, you’ll contribute to building high-impact products that help users make smarter trading decisions in the decentralized ecosystem.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextContainer text-align-left&quot; data-partial-quote-enabled=&quot;true&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;1. Build and maintain the market tracking and analysis platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;22&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;2. Develop high-throughput, low-latency backend systems, and optimize them to keep the data accurate, timely, and reliable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;24&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;3. Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues to ensure the stability and quality of our services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;26&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;4. Deliver assigned features and projects with quality and on time, writing clean, well-tested, maintainable code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;28&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;5. Collaborate with product and other engineering teams to support their needs and keep integrations running smoothly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-OL1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;1. Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related technical field (or a strong STEM education background).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;11&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;2. 3-5+ years of extensive experience designing, building, and operating high-performance systems in Java, with a deep understanding of the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;JVM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, IO, multithreading, concurrency, and networking.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;3. Familiar with databases like&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;MySQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, with a deep understanding of transactions and indexing and hands-on experience in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;SQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; optimization; well-acquainted with frequently-used middleware such as caching and message queues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;4. Thorough command of common data structures, algorithms, and design patterns, with good coding norms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;5. Clear logic, strong learning and communication skills, a passion for technology, and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;20&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;23&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;1. Proven experience designing and developing distributed systems, with a solid grasp of core principles such as consistency, high availability, fault tolerance, and horizontal scalability applied to high-throughput data platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;25&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;2. Familiarity with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;DEX&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; mechanics and the broader Web3 ecosystem, ideally as a hands-on user or active trader, bringing genuine product intuition and a deep passion for decentralized finance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;27&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;3. Proficiency in reading, writing, and speaking English to collaborate effectively with global and cross-functional team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XvQudJ7z0ouSnuxOibouMkKzsCc&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Competitive total compensation package&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GAzBdJXxLo291PxrthXurPeds4g&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;L&amp;amp;D programs and Education subsidy for employees&#39; growth and development&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CKPxdgHeoosenzxCpV2uV32ysz0&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Various team building programs and company events&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XjPSdIa92oGeLox9Qo9uejVEs4c&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Wellness and meal allowances&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CS34dAJCDoMDHxx95pZu43yjsxB&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comprehensive healthcare schemes for employees and dependants&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Uqtsd4bN8oaHt7xyPlYuxmfcsob&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
