&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll utilize a broad set of product design skills including user interface design, user experience and interaction design, and prototyping. In this role, you&#39;ll be responsible for deeply understanding our users and product strategy to design and advocate for the highest quality product experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a part of the Connect Design team, you’ll lead product development for Stripe’s largest complex users Marketplaces such as Doordash and Lyft, and Platforms such as Shopify and Woo. You’ll drive the vision for how these marketplaces and platforms manage risk and compliance for their business and their users in the US and internationally. You’ll work with other designers on the team to define the future of the experience for all Connect users on the dashboard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll utilize a broad set of product design skills including user interface design, user experience and interaction design, and prototyping. In this role, you will be responsible for deeply understanding our users and product strategy to design and advocate for the highest quality product experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
