&lt;li&gt;Respond to inquiries regarding existing and new contracts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide direct legal support to the desk on new business initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with external counsel and other external advisers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate with counterparties in China and other jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While your daily work will focus on Hong Kong and China, you may also advise colleagues more broadly across our office locations worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 3-8 years of PQE on a corporate and/or finance team (e.g., derivatives, credit, M&amp;amp;A) within leading law firms or financial institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with drafting and negotiating contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to stay organised with exceptional attention to detail and accuracy, and able to handle competing priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writer and speaker; strong negotiator&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and flexible team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, responsible and professional in attitude and presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and able to clearly articulate your approach, analysis and conclusions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working on problems that rarely have clean, definitive answers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native in Mandarin and fluent in English, both in speaking and writing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
