&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce, NetSuite, Workday, Snowflake, or similar enterprise platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
