&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LpyydVbxOomihXxxFeOubWHTsLf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Hands-on experience in developing Microservices/APIs using Java, Spring Boot, and Spring Cloud&lt;/div&gt;
