&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AkFcdb8KioIywFxwjiZuG1y7sXd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proficiency in working with both relational and NoSQL databases, messaging frameworks (e.g., Kafka), distributed caching solutions (e.g., Redis) and other essential tools&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TX4HdUSMBot1NlxoBFEuK9rxsug&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comfort working in a cloud-based Linux environment&lt;/div&gt;
