job-1sf1gw2:
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a proactive, enthusiastic problem-solver to join our Operations team. We sit at the heart of Jane Street&#39;s trading, ensuring that assets, information, and ideas flow smoothly and efficiently both within the firm and between us and the outside world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our trading grows in scale and complexity, we have to continually rethink and improve the way we work. That&#39;s where this role comes in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To start, you&#39;ll be embedded within one of our Operations teams, learning the day-to-day work alongside your colleagues—running the processes, understanding the products, building real context for how things get done and why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over time, your focus will shift towards making that work better. That might mean redesigning how a reconciliation is done, removing handoffs between teams, imagining how tools and systems could work better, or applying AI where it helps. You&#39;ll look for the changes that would make the biggest difference, help build them, and see them through to adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As you build context and a track record, you&#39;ll be pulled into problems in other Operations teams as well, and the balance will tip towards the process-improvement side of the work. The best people in this role end up with a view of Operations that few others have.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect this role to evolve over time, and we&#39;re looking for someone who&#39;s energised by that and embraces it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a bachelor&#39;s degree and 2+ years of experience in operations, engineering, analytics, consulting, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Notice inefficiencies and gaps in teams, tools, and processes, and take the initiative to improve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic about problem-solving and think carefully about which solution best fits your problem (e.g. spreadsheets, scripts, AI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable digging into complex ideas and making them clear for others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter and able to set your own direction in ambiguous situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Humble about what you know and don&#39;t know, and not afraid to ask questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical skills are a plus but not a requirement—we care more about how you think than what you can build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t need to match every line, but if most of this resonates, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

