&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WWPbdV1BAo0DUux8aEqldokXgag&quot;&gt;The AI Engineering team is responsible for integrating AI models with different business lines, across teams such as Compliance, Trading, Financial Products, and Business Intelligence.&lt;/div&gt;
