&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M62edqARFoLhHUxLoS7lqudGgvf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M62edqARFoLhHUxLoS7lqudGgvf&quot;&gt;You will be a hands-on technical leader, shaping long-term platform strategy while also diving deep into architecture, performance, and reliability challenges across compute, data, and ML systems.&lt;/div&gt;
