&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced natural gas analyst/trader to help our team develop our existing fundamental-driven trading. The ideal candidate will be capable of providing deep insight into the European and/or Global gas market, driving and owning modelling and associated trading strategy. The role sits within the global Commodity team, which covers a wide range of products and strategy types within Jane Street’s core quantitative trading strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The right person will have a strong fundamental background in natural gas and enjoy working in a fast-paced and collaborative environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
