job-0ug3t6l:
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with the Best&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Orderly Network is a combination of an orderbook-based trading infrastructure and a robust liquidity layer offering spot and perpetual futures orderbooks. Unlike traditional platforms, Orderly doesn’t have a front end; instead, it operates at the core of the ecosystem, providing essential services to projects built on top of it.&lt;br&gt;Our DEX white-label solution is carefully crafted to save builders time and capital while granting access to our bootstrapped liquidity. Picture having the best features of CEXs while keeping settlements on-chain and maintaining full self-custody.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With Orderly, anyone can create a trading application thanks to our seamless plug-and-play experience leveraging our liquidity and composability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Looking ahead, our grand vision is to create an omnichain protocol, connecting traders from both EVM and non-EVM chains within the same orderbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;A Glimpse into Your Future at Orderly Network&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Orderly&#39;s Partnership team accelerates the growth of Orderly&#39;s ecosystem and business development by supporting committed teams that build ambitious products on top of Orderly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Associate, Eco &amp;amp; BD, you’ll conceptualize, implement, and manage growth initiatives for early- to mid-stage builders across all verticals (DeFi, gaming, NFTs, etc) to become thriving ecosystem projects. You will use creativity and data-driven evidence to identify which strategies and support verticals to prioritize. You will manage, maintain, and improve internal and externally-facing systems and processes. You are ready and willing to tackle any challenge, no problem too small.&amp;nbsp; You are self-sufficient, organized, and ambitious, with existing experience in L1/L2 ecosystem development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;What will you be working on?&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll develop and execute new initiatives that grow our ecosystem&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll work alongside Business Development, DevRel, Marketing, and Operations teams to execute initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll collaborate with a range of counterparties, builders, investors, exchanges, infrastructure providers—to promote the growth of our ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll manage initiatives like grants programs and hackathons that bring builders to Orderly and encourage them to compose with other ecosystem apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll research new defi protocols, work with L1/2 ecosystems, support in driving more utility for our token&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Who will you be working with?&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain close collaboration with Marketing, Operations, Product &amp;amp; BD Teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;About you&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two or more years of experience in ecosystem growth/BD at an L1/L2 blockchain or similar (e.g. portfolio support at a venture firm), onboarding and growing successful projects from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are biased toward action while respecting team-oriented priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are no-ego, adaptable, entrepreneurial, detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an excellent speaker and writer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are personable and able to manage expectations across many stakeholders and multiple on-going relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
