&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;1qg0nom&quot; data-start=&quot;3614&quot; data-end=&quot;3629&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3631&quot; data-end=&quot;4317&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;c1a2o7&quot; data-start=&quot;3631&quot; data-end=&quot;3682&quot;&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10nzurp&quot; data-start=&quot;3683&quot; data-end=&quot;3808&quot;&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hq13xo&quot; data-start=&quot;3809&quot; data-end=&quot;3936&quot;&gt;Best in class benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;117nnrx&quot; data-start=&quot;3937&quot; data-end=&quot;4034&quot;&gt;Lifestyle wallet - a highly flexible benefits spending account for wellness, learning, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p0jp9i&quot; data-start=&quot;4035&quot; data-end=&quot;4126&quot;&gt;Employer-paid life &amp;amp; disability insurance, fertility benefits, and mental health benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;z2b7ur&quot; data-start=&quot;4127&quot; data-end=&quot;4229&quot;&gt;Time off to recharge including company holidays, paid time off, sick time, parental leave, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
