&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;187&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or higher in Computer Science or a related field, with over 7 years of experience in development and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;188&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Java, Go or C++, solid computer science fundamentals, and a strong understanding of DevOps/SRE system construction principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;398&quot; data-end=&quot;585&quot;&gt;Understanding of core Middleware technologies like Nginx, Redis, ElasticSearch, Kafka, MySQL, Docker and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;586&quot; data-end=&quot;837&quot;&gt;In-depth understanding of the business architecture currently managed, along with a strong methodology for architectural design. Capable of rationalizing architectural designs for new business lines and providing targeted optimization suggestions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;838&quot; data-end=&quot;899&quot;&gt;Ability to build a complete business system from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusvnFLHEcrU3EZSqi1qdAlRh&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-To-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
