&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-LwbJdnRrLotYVzxapl7uggossdh&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join our product design squads at OKX as a Senior Product Designer, Trading and become a pivotal force in defining the crypto experience landscape. This role offers you a unique opportunity to craft intuitive, trustworthy, and aesthetically appealing user experiences that set the standard in the rapidly evolving crypto industry. Your work will not only shape customer-facing designs that meet the needs of a global audience but also drive business-facing design practices that underpin strategic decisions and product development. Collaborating with an interdisciplinary team of product managers, engineers, and other key stakeholders, you will lead the charge in transforming ideas into design-driven solutions that resonate with users globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
