job-1pj0u2f:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Procurement Specialist to help source IT hardware across our offices, data centers, and colocations in the Americas. This will include servers, networking, storage, and desktop-related equipment. In addition to sourcing the equipment, you’ll be intricately involved in raising purchase orders and coordinating logistics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As you manage the process of buying hardware for Jane Street, you’ll collaborate with external vendors and colleagues from our Data Center, Networking, IT, and Procurement teams. Clear communication will be needed as you deliver information and manage expectations for each request.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When a purchase request is made, you’ll enter it into our procurement system, obtain requests for quotes (RFQs), negotiate with vendors, and provide stakeholders with a summary of buying options (i.e., price, availability, lead time, etc.). When it’s time to buy, you’ll place the order and track the shipment to make sure it’s delivered on time. You’ll also review invoices for accuracy and request corrections if needed. Your ability to take initiative, follow up, and close the loop on all purchases and discrepancies will be critical to your success in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in supply chain, IT, engineering, or related technical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of relevant professional experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong background in Excel, knowledge of RFQ and ordering processes, and experience negotiating with suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly detail-oriented and organized&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator; describes detailed problems with brevity and accuracy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who can manage several deadlines in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player who enjoys collaborating with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-1wybdfa:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Ritual&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ritual is building a sovereign, execution layer for AI, with our private testnet already live and running. The Ritual chain is the first blockchain custom-built to support AI-native operations, designed from the ground up to enable a new class of applications at the intersection of crypto and AI. Our first product, Infernet, is pioneering new ground as the first solution to enable developers to access AI models both on-chain via smart contracts and off-chain, demonstrating our commitment to bridging these transformative technologies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prototype new mechanisms, then work to productionize your research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work at the frontier of modern cryptographic schemes and open-source AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with our engineering and product team to ensure your research has real-world impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Release your work into the open-source world and build alongside the Ritual community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About you&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intellectually curious about the latest advancements in machine learning, cryptography, and how they intersect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to see your research go beyond academic papers and have a tangible impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with taking research projects or experiments from ideation to prototype code, or implementation either on your own or coordinating with engineering teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick iteration and development cycles on writing and/or proof-of-concept&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h5&gt;Extras&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points if you have existing research or writing in conferences or journals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have some level of comfort with algebraic structures, distributed systems, mechanism design, or statistical modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Why join us&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a passionate group of engineers, researchers, and operators on a mission to build the next generation of AI infrastructure hardened by cryptographic schemes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work completely in open-source and ship weekly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximize your knowledge gradient around fields that typically would not intersect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re open to exceptional people of all backgrounds for research (e.g. high school, undergraduate and graduate degrees).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

