&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Data Specialist to help us understand, improve, and maintain the data that fuels our trading. You&#39;ll be embedded in an engineering team and will work closely with software developers, traders, and operations professionals across the firm.&lt;/p&gt;
