job-1rudrcl:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Network Engineer who can help us scale our networks to meet increasing business demands, drive standardization through automation, and look for opportunities to leverage AI to improve operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jane Street’s numerous distributed systems run on a multi-vendor, highly available network infrastructure and handle a variety of traffic profiles – from high-speed trading to everyday internet connectivity. A typical day on the Network Engineering team includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating on new data center and colocation initiatives, WAN routing optimization, and other cross-team design projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interfacing with stakeholders to assess business needs and develop innovative network features/capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading both reactive support tasks and proactive infrastructure improvements, focusing on thorough documentation to reduce outages and enhance troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exploring AI/ML-driven enhancements to streamline operations and continuously improve service quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using your networking expertise to help us scale our team’s infrastructure at large while maintaining high standards for network performance and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documenting solutions and processes that help the team work more efficiently, using a meticulous attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a passion for innovating within a complex network ecosystem, enjoy building scalable systems and documentation structures, and are curious about how AI can refine network operations, this role provides a platform to make a significant impact at Jane Street. We look forward to learning from your expertise and unique perspective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 7+ years of experience operating and deploying network infrastructure, with 3+ years dedicated to ground-up network design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have deep experience with routing and network protocols (OSPF, BGP, PIM-SM), and the troubleshooting of transport protocols (TCP/UDP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in Linux environments and proficient in at least one programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strongly inclined to automate workflows and explore AI/ML approaches to improve efficiency or reduce overhead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eager to produce comprehensive, scalable documentation that benefits the entire team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a demonstrated ability to balance multiple priorities, switch contexts effectively, and maintain a high level of customer service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaborator and communicator; ready to build strong partnerships with diverse global teams and stakeholders to share your recommendations, issues, and outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a flexible, reliable mindset and enthusiasm for sharing knowledge with peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Any prior exposure to overlay networks (EVPN, VXLAN) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:agency-partnerships@janestreet.com&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;agency-partnerships@janestreet.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

job-1xow7f0:
&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to hire a talented engineer to help run our internal Windows infrastructure. We are open to applicants with strong experience in areas such as infrastructure, applications, automation, and server or desktop operating systems in Windows environments.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Windows is our primary desktop operating system, and many of our core infrastructure services are provided by Windows servers. Having these systems work correctly is key to meeting our business needs for performance and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work to improve, automate, and standardize our Windows environment. Ideally this means you have experience scripting/programming in either PowerShell, Python, or C#. All of our scripts are centrally managed and stored in an organized repository, where they are reviewed by team members and used by many teams across the firm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of a global team, you will also collaborate with colleagues across the firm—locally and abroad—to develop new ideas, find and resolve issues, plan and execute deployments, and document the results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position sits within our IT Engineering group, a highly dedicated team of engineers who monitor and manage a Windows environment across a physical/virtual computing landscape that spans three continents. Your analytical thinking and expertise will be invaluable as we support the daily work of our colleagues and keep our systems operating at the highest standard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While there’s no fixed set of skills required for this role (we can teach you what you need to know), here are some of the things we’re looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced experience with the inner workings of Microsoft Windows 10/11 or Microsoft Windows Server 2016/2019/2022&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with using PowerShell (or Python, C#) to automate deployment, configuration, and monitoring environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of Active Directory/Kerberos/DNS/Group Policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to troubleshoot Windows operating systems and applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hardware monitoring and performance tuning in physical or virtual environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to solve complex problems in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and concise communication skills; the ability to maintain a high degree of customer service for all queries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible, reliable, and highly collaborative approach to your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you&#39;re a recruiting agency and want to partner with us, please reach out to agency-partnerships@janestreet.com.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

